<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MWANDUSO</para>
  <para style="toc1">KITABU CHA ICHANDUSO CHA MUSA KIKEMIGWA MWANDUSO</para>
  <para style="toc2">MWANDUSO</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mwand.</para>
  <para style="mt2">KITABU CHA ICHANDUSO CHA MUSA KIKEMIGWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">MWANDUSO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli ino ikemigwa, “Mwanduso,” nhegulo yake “songelo ya kinhu.” Na kino kicho kitabu cha ichanduso Mdilagano da Umwaka da Bibilia. Hata Kieblania cha umwaka kisonga na mbuli zilonga, “Haichanduso.” Kitabu kino cholagusa kila kinhu kukilawile na hasa vija Mulungu viyasang'hanike na mwanduso wa munhu. Lelo wasomi wana simulizi bwando za munhu ama wanhu wandike kitabu cha Mwanduso na vivija kipigiti vichandikigwe. Wanhu wayagwe wogelegeza kamba kilawa muna zinyandiko za umwaka zilawile mdiwambo da Babeli muikaline ya 5-6 kipigiti Kilisto hanavumbuka. Wanhu wayagwe wozibokela mbuli zilawa mngelegeza za wanhu kamba, Musa iyo yandike vitabu va Mwanduso, Kuhalawa, Mbuli za Walawi, Mheta, na Ng'humbukila ya Tolati muna imilao ya 1,300 na 1,400 kipigiti Kilisto hanavumbuka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Mwanduso kina mbuli bwando za kuwataza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kuzitanga mbuli ziyagwe za Bibilia kulawa Mdilagano da Umwaka na Mdilagano da Isambi. Chotulagusa vija vilozo vuvingile muulumwengu na sulukila ya wanhu kumpata Mkombola, vivija chogubula ngelegeza za Mulungu za kuwakombola wanhu. Gano gokoneka kulawa muuhokozi wa ichanduso umulonga Yesu (3:15), na mkilagano cha Mulungu ha Ablaham mmbuli ya kuwamoteza wanhu wose wa muulumwengu (12:3).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mulungu kaulumba ulumwengu abaho kawalumba Adamu na Hawa kamba vuzilonga sula ya 1 na ya 2.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Muisula ya 3 mbaka ya 5, kitabu cha Mwanduso chowasimulila Adamu na Hawa, vilozo vao, na lukolo lwao.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Muisula ya 6 mbaka ya 9, kitabu kino cha Mwanduso cholonga mbuli za Nuhu na mmemelo wa mazi.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Muisula ya 10 mbaka ya 11, kitabu cha Mwanduso chosimulila kija kilawilile hagatigati ya kipigiti cha Nuhu mbaka kipigiti cha Ablaham, hamoja na ulingo wa Babeli.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Muisula ya 12 mbaka ya 50, kitabu kino chomulonga Ablaham, mulango wake, hamoja na mwanduso wa wanhu wa Islaeli.</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Ukazi wa Ablaham na mtwanzi wake Sala wandikigwa muisula ya 12 mbaka ya 25 ya ikitabu cha Mwanduso.</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Ukazi wa Isaka na mtwanzi wake Lebeka wandikigwa muisula ya 21 mbaka ya 28, na ifa ya Isaka yosimulilwa muisula ya 35.</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Ukazi wa Yakobo na wanage hamoja na uhami wao wa kulawa Kanaani mbaka Misili wandikigwa muisula ya 25 mbaka ya 50 ya ikitabu cha Mwanduso.</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Ukazi wa Usufu, mwana iyanogeligwe ng'hani na Yakobo tataake, na vija viyawile mtawala muisi ya Misili wandikigwa muisula ya 37 mbaka ya 50 ya ikitabu cha Mwanduso.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Ulumwengu Wolumbigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1"/>Haichanduso Mulungu kalumba ulanga na isi. <verse eid="GEN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2"/>Isi ikala mzanyamzanya na ikala bule kinhu, na ziza dikala digubike vilindi va mazi, na Loho wa Mulungu kakala yaituzile uchana ya igamazi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Ulawilile mulangaza,” na mulangaza ulawilila. <verse eid="GEN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4"/>Mulungu kanogelwa na uja umulangaza. Avo kaugola umulangaza kulawa mdiziza. <verse eid="GEN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5"/>Mulungu kaukema mulangaza “Imisi,” na ziza kadikema “Ikilo.” Iwa ichungulo, iwa imitondo, zua da ichanduso.<verse eid="GEN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Na kuwe na ubenhu hagatigati ya igamazi, ugagole mazi ga kuulanga na mazi ga muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7"/>Avo Mulungu katenda ubenhu, na kugagola igamazi, gayagwe hasi na gayagwe uchana. Na ilawilila kamba viyalongile. <verse eid="GEN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8"/>Mulungu kaukema uja uubenhu “Ulanga.” Iwa ichungulo, iwa imitondo, zua da ikabili.<verse eid="GEN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Mazi gali hasi ya ulanga gaiting'hane hanhu hamwe, giladi hanhu hanyalile honeke.” Na ilawilila kamba viyalongile. <verse eid="GEN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10"/>Mulungu kahakema hanhu hanyalile “Isi,” na kahakema hanhu hali na igamazi “Bahali.” Mulungu kanogelwa na kija kiyatendile. <verse eid="GEN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Isi na yoteze mijani ya namna zose, miche ilela mbeyu na mibiki ilela mijo ili na mbeyu mgati yake.” Na ilawilila kamba viyalongile. <verse eid="GEN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12"/>Avo isi yoteza mijani ya namna zose, miche ilela mbeyu na mibiki ilela mijo ili na mbeyu mgati yake. Na Mulungu kanogelwa na kija kiyatendile. <verse eid="GEN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13"/>Iwa ichungulo, iwa imitondo, zua da ikadatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Na iwe milangaza kuulanga iigole imisi na ikilo, iwe kamba vilaguso vondavilaguse vipigiti, mazua, na milao, <verse eid="GEN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15"/>imwemwese kuulanga ilave mulangaza muisi.” Na ilawilila kamba viyalongile. <verse eid="GEN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16"/>Avo Mulungu kaitenda milangaza mikulu mibili, mulangaza mkulu ng'hani umwemwese imisi na umulangaza mdodo umwemwese ikilo. Vivija kazitenda na nhondo. <verse eid="GEN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17"/>Mulungu kaika kuulanga ija imilangaza giladi ilave mulangaza muisi, <verse eid="GEN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18"/>imwemwese imisi na ikilo, na uugole mulangaza kulawa mdiziza. Na Mulungu kanogelwa na kija kiyatendile. <verse eid="GEN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19"/>Iwa ichungulo, iwa imitondo, zua da ikane.<verse eid="GEN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Mazi na gameme vinhu vili na ugima. Na ndege waguluke kuulanga.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21"/>Avo Mulungu kawalumba wang'onyo wakulu wa m'bahali na kila kinhu kili na ugima kitembela mmazi na ndege wa kila namna. Na Mulungu kanogelwa na kija kiyatendile. <verse eid="GEN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22"/>Mulungu kawamoteza na kulonga, “Leleni mkongezeke muimemeze bahali, na ndege wongezeke muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23"/>Iwa ichungulo, iwa imitondo, zua da tano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Wang'onyo wa kila namna wene ugima nawalawilile muisi, wang'onyo wofugigwa na wang'onyo wa kumuhulo, wakulu na wadodo.” Ilawilila kamba viyalongile. <verse eid="GEN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25"/>Avo Mulungu kawatenda wang'onyo hiwo wose, na kanogelwa na kija kiyatendile.<verse eid="GEN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Na tuwatende wanhu wawe kamba tweye na walinge na tweye. Wakatawale somba, ndege, na wang'onyo wose wofugigwa na ulumwengu wose, wakatawale vinhu vose vilumbigwe na Mulungu vitembela muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27"/>Avo Mulungu kamulumba munhu yalingile na heyo mwenyego. Kawalumba mtwanzi na mbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28"/>Mulungu kawamoteza, na kawalongela, “Leleni mkongezeke, giladi muimemeze isi na muitawale. Muwatawale somba, ndege, na kila kinhu kili na ugima kitembela muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Lola, niwagwelela miche ilela mbeyu muisi yose, na mibiki ilele mujo uli na mbeyu mgati yake. Vinhu hivo vowa mandia genu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30"/>Wang'onyo wose wa mmuhulo, na ndege wose, na kila kinhu kili na ugima, niwagwelela usoti na mibiki ili na mijani viwe mandia gao.” Na ilawilila kamba viyalongile. <verse eid="GEN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31"/>Mulungu kavilola vinhu vose viyavitendile, na kanogelwa navo ng'hani. Iwa ichungulo, iwa imitondo, zua da sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1"/>Avo ulanga na isi na vinhu vose vili mgati yake vimambukizwa kulumbigwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2"/>Na mdizua da saba Mulungu kakala yamambukize sang'hano yake iyakalile yoisang'hana, na mdizua hijo kahumula. <verse eid="GEN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3"/>Avo Mulungu kadimoteza zua da saba na kaditenda diwe zua ding'alile, kwavija mdizua hijo Mulungu kakala yamambukize sang'hano yake ya kulumba, na kahumula. <verse eid="GEN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4"/>Avo vino vivo ulanga na isi vuvilumbigwe.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 2:4">Mbuli Ziyagwe Zisimulila Uumbi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">MNDEWA Mulungu viyalumbile ulanga na isi, <verse eid="GEN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5"/>hakukalile na mche muna iisi na hakukalile na mbeyu zotile, kwavija MNDEWA Mulungu kakala hanaitenda mvula itoe, na hakukalile na munhu yoyose yailimile iisi. <verse eid="GEN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6"/>Ila nzokwe za mazi zilawa hasi na kuitapagiza isi yose.<verse eid="GEN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7"/>Abaho MNDEWA Mulungu kamulumba munhu kulawa mditimbwisi da isi, na kumuhumulila mmhula yake mhumuzi igela ugima, na ija imunhu kawa na ugima.<verse eid="GEN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8"/>Abaho MNDEWA Mulungu kahanda kihati ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua, hanhu hokemigwa Edeni. Na himo kamwika ija imunhu iyamulumbile. <verse eid="GEN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9"/>Na MNDEWA Mulungu kaitenda mibiki ya namna zose ikule kulawa muisi, mibiki inogeza meso na inogile sama ya mandia. Hagatigati ya ikihati kukala na m'biki ulava ugima na m'biki uwatenda wanhu wagatange ganogile na gehile.<verse eid="GEN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10"/>Lwanda lukuluma kulawa Edeni, lukitapagiza ikihati, abaho lukiigola mianza mine. <verse eid="GEN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11"/>Lwanda lwa ichanduso lokemigwa Pishoni, alo lukuluma muisi yose ya Havila, ako kuli na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12"/>Na zahabu ya isi ija ing'ala. Ako vivija kukalile na mavuta ga kunung'hila na namna za mabwe gokemigwa shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13"/>Lwanda lwa ikabili lokemigwa Gihoni, alo lukuluma muisi yose ya Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14"/>Lwanda lwa ikadatu lokemigwa Tigilisi, alo lukuluma mwambu wa ulawilo wa zua wa wambo da Ashulu. Na lwanda lwa ikane lokemigwa Yuflati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15"/>MNDEWA Mulungu kamwika ija imunhu mgati ya kija Ikihati cha Edeni yakihalile na kukilola goya. <verse eid="GEN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16"/>Na MNDEWA Mulungu kamulongela ija imunhu, “Dia mujo kulawa mum'biki wowose uli mkihati, <verse eid="GEN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17"/>ila mujo wa m'biki uwatenda wanhu wagatange ganogile na gehile sambiuje, kwavija kipigiti vondauje mujo hiwo, kodanganhika.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18"/>Abaho MNDEWA Mulungu kalonga, “Havilumbile munhu ino kukala yeiyeka. Nomtendela wa kumtaza yalumbile kumwake heyo.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19"/>Avo MNDEWA Mulungu kasola ulongo kulawa muisi na kawatenda wang'onyo wose na ndege wose. Abaho kawagala ha ija imunhu giladi yawagwelele matwaga. Twaga jojose ija imunhu diyamgwelele kila mwene ugima dikala dijo twaga jake. <verse eid="GEN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20"/>Avo ija imunhu kawagwelela matwaga ndege wose na wang'onyo wose. Ila hakukalile na wa kumtaza yalumbile kumwake heyo.<verse eid="GEN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21"/>Abaho MNDEWA Mulungu kamtenda ija imunhu yakuluze, na kipigiti viyakalile yokuluza, kalubabazula lubavu lumwe lwa ija imunhu na kuhagubika hanhu haja na nyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22"/>Abaho MNDEWA Mulungu kamtenda mtwanzi kulawa mulubavu luja na kumgala ha ija imunhu. <verse eid="GEN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23"/>Na ija imunhu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">“Ino iyo zege mmizege yangu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">na lukuli mulukuli lwangu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 2:23">Avo kokemigwa mtwanzi kwavija kababazuligwa kulawa mwa mbigalo.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24"/>Sama ya kilamso kino mbigalo kowaleka tataake na mamaake na kuilumba na mtwanzi wake, na hewo wowa lukuli lumwe.<verse eid="GEN 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25"/>Ija imbigalo na mtwanzi wake wose wakala mwazi, na hawonile kinyala.<verse eid="GEN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Udulu wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1"/>Nyoka kakala m'bala ng'hani kubanza wang'onyo wose wa kumuhulo yaawalumbile MNDEWA Mulungu. Nyoka kamuuza ija imtwanzi, “Kweli Mulungu kawalongela kamba sambimuje mujo wa m'biki wowose uli mkihati?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2"/>Ija imtwanzi kamwidika, “Todaha kuja mujo wa m'biki wowose uli mkihati, <verse eid="GEN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3"/>ila Mulungu kalonga, ‘Sambimuje mujo wa m'biki uli hagatigati ya ikihati ama kuukwasa. Kamba muhatenda avo, modanganhika.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4"/>Nyoka kamulongela ija imtwanzi, “Hamdanganhika, <verse eid="GEN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5"/>kwavija Mulungu kovitanga kamba kipigiti vondamje mujo uno, meso genu gogubuligwa, na mowa kamba Mulungu, mogatanga ganogile na gehile.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6"/>Ija imtwanzi viyawene kamba mujo wa m'biki uja unoga kudigwa, na wonogeza meso, na vivija wosulukilwa mkongeza ng'hungwe, kasola mujo wake kauja. Kamgwelela mbigalo wake, na heyo vivija kaja. <verse eid="GEN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7"/>Kipigiti kikija viweshile kuja, meso gao gagubuligwa, na wavitanga kamba wakala mwazi. Avo washona mijani ya m'biki wa mtini wakiivaza.<verse eid="GEN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8"/>Abaho ija imbigalo na mtwanzi wake wadihulika dizwi da MNDEWA Mulungu viyakalile yotembela mkihati mkipigiti cha zua kuhonga, wakiifisa mmibiki ili mkihati giladi MNDEWA Mulungu sambiyawone. <verse eid="GEN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9"/>Ila MNDEWA Mulungu kamkema ija imunhu, na kumuuza, “Kwa kwahi?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10"/>Ija imunhu kedika, “Nikuhulika vuutembela mkihati, nidumba, kwavija nie nikala mwazi, avo nikiifisa.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11"/>MNDEWA Mulungu kamulongela, “Yalihi yakulongele kamba gweye kwa mwazi? Kuja mujo uja unikulagize sambiuje?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12"/>Ija imunhu kedika, “Ija imtwanzi yuunigwelele yawe hamoja na nie, iyo yanigwelele mujo uja, na nie nija.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13"/>MNDEWA Mulungu kamuuza ija imtwanzi, “Habali utendile vino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Kedika kalonga, “Nyoka kanibulunya, na nie nija.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhaguso ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14"/>Abaho MNDEWA Mulungu kamulongela nyoka, “Kwavija kutenda vino, gweye wiyeka kudukumizwa mmwanza wa wang'onyo wose, wofugigwa na wa kumuhulo. Kotambala na inda yako, na koja timbwisi mazua gose ga ugima wako. <verse eid="GEN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15"/>Nokwika udumuka hagatigati yako na ija imtwanzi, hagatigati ya wanago na wanage. Heyo kokuhonda ditwi jako, na gweye komulumiza kisiginho chake.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16"/>Abaho kamulongela ija imtwanzi, “Nowongeza usungu wako wa kulela, na gweye kolela na usungu, hata avo sulukila yako yowa ha mbigalo wako, na heyo kokutawala.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17"/>Abaho kamulongela ija imbigalo, “Kwavija gweye kumtegeleza mtwanzi wako, na kuja mujo uja unikulongele sambiuje, isi yodukumizwa. Kopata mandia gako mkugaya ng'hani mkuilima isi mmazua gose ga ugima wako. <verse eid="GEN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18"/>Isi yokulelela miba na mijani, na mandia gako gowa mijani ya kumgunda. <verse eid="GEN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19"/>Koja mandia gako mkusang'hanika ng'hani mbaka vondauibwelele isi ija iulumbigwe nayo. Kwavija kulumbigwa na timbwisi, na kobweleganya kuwa timbwisi kabili.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20"/>Adamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Adamu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">munhu yakalile yalumbigwe kulawa mditimbwisi da isi.</char></note> kamkema mtwanzi wake Hawa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hawa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ugima.</char></note> kwavija kowa mama wa wanhu wose. <verse eid="GEN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21"/>Abaho MNDEWA Mulungu kawatendela Adamu na mtwanzi wake vivalo va ng'hwembe za wang'onyo na kawavaza.<verse eid="GEN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu na Hawa Wowingigwa Kulawa Mkihati cha Edeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22"/>Abaho MNDEWA Mulungu kalonga, “Lola, munhu ino sambi kalinga na tweye, kogatanga ganogile na gehile. Vivija sambiyagolose mkono wake na kubawa mujo kulawa mum'biki ulava ugima, na kuuja, na kuwa mgima mazua gose.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23"/>Avo MNDEWA Mulungu kamuwinga kulawa Mkihati cha Edeni na kumtenda yakailime isi ija iyalumbigwe nayo. <verse eid="GEN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24"/>Viyeshile kuwawinga waja iwanhu, keka Makelubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Makelubi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wao wene ugima wali kuulanga walumbigwe na Mulungu wali na mabawa.</char></note> ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua wa Ikihati cha Edeni na kwika zele dili na moto dimeluka dihindukahinduka kuno na kuno kwiimiliza nzila ya kuchola hana um'biki ulava ugima.<verse eid="GEN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1"/>Adamu kawasa na mtwanzi wake Hawa, na Hawa kapata inda. Kamulela mwana mbigalo, kalonga, “MNDEWA kanitaza, nilela mwana mbigalo.” Avo kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Kaini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nipata.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2"/>Abaho kamulela mwana iyagwe mbigalo kamkema Abeli. Abeli kakala mchunga ng'hondolo, na Kaini kakala mulimi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3"/>Kipigiti cha kuhuna vikivikile, Kaini kagala fungu da vakuja vake na kudilava nhosa ha MNDEWA. <verse eid="GEN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4"/>Abeli nayo kagala wana ng'hondolo wa udele kulawa mdidale jake, kawachinja, na kulava fungu da nyama zinonile ha MNDEWA. MNDEWA kanogelwa na Abeli na nhosa yake, <verse eid="GEN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5"/>ila kamulema Kaini hamoja na nhosa yake. Kaini kona lusango ng'hani, na kihanga chake kikala kisifukila. <verse eid="GEN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6"/>Abaho MNDEWA kamulongela Kaini, “Habali wona lusango? Habali kihanga chako kisifukila? <verse eid="GEN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7"/>Kamba uhatenda ganogile, hutogoligwa? Ila kamba uhatenda gehile, vilozo vokubeta hana ulwivi lwako, vokusulukila gweye, ila kolondigwa uvihume.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8"/>Abaho Kaini kamulongela mdodo wake Abeli, “Tuchole kumgunda.” Kipigiti viwakalile kumgunda, Kaini kamvamhila mdodo wake na kumkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9"/>Abaho MNDEWA kamuuza Kaini, “Kakwahi mdodo wako Abeli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Na heyo kamwidika, “Sivimanya. Nie iyo mwimilizi wa mdodo wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10"/>MNDEWA kamulongela, “Kutenda choni? Tegeleza! Mulopa wa mdodo wako wonililila kulawa muna iisi. <verse eid="GEN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11"/>Gweye kudukumizwa na kuwingigwa kulawa muisi, isi ayo igubule mulomo wake na kubokela mulopa wa mdodo wako yuumkomile na makono gako. <verse eid="GEN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12"/>Kipigiti uhailima, isi haikulelela vakuja. Kowa munhu yalibule kae na kwanga muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13"/>Kaini kamulongela MNDEWA, “Nhaguso ino iwa ng'hulu ng'hani kumwangu kubanza vinidaha kuyazaganya. <verse eid="GEN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14"/>Gweye kuniwinga nie kulawa muisi, na kunika kutali kulawa haulongozi wako. Nowa munhu nilibule kae na kwanga muisi, na munhu yoyose yondayanyone nie kong'homa.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15"/>Ila Mulungu kamulongela, “Bule. Kamba munhu yoyose yokukoma gweye, kobwelezeligwa mianza saba.” Avo MNDEWA kamwika utango Kaini giladi kumzuma kila munhu sambiyamkome. <verse eid="GEN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16"/>Avo Kaini kasegela haulongozi wa MNDEWA na kukala muisi ya Nodi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Nodi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kwanga.</char></note> ili ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua wa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukolo lwa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17"/>Kaini kawasa na mtwanzi wake, na ija imtwanzi kapata inda na kamulela Henoko. Kaini kadizenga wambo na kudikema twaga da mwanage Henoko. <verse eid="GEN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18"/>Henoko kakala na mwana twaga jake Iladi, ayo yakalile tata wa Mehuyaeli, na Mehuyaeli kakala na mwana twaga jake Metushaeli, ayo yakalile tata wa Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19"/>Lameki kasola watwanzi wabili, imwe twaga jake Ada na iyagwe Zila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20"/>Ada kamulela Yabali, ayo yakalile muhenga wa awo wakalile wofuga wang'onyo na kukala mmahema. <verse eid="GEN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21"/>Mdodo wake kakala Yubali, ayo yakalile muhenga wa awo wose wakalile wotoa bango<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bango</char><char style="ft" closed="false">kicho kia cha kutoela nyila.</char></note> <figure style="fig" alt="harp, stringed instrument" file="C-042.BMP" size="col" loc="4:21" copy="NTM" ref="4:21">Bango</figure> na filimbi. <verse eid="GEN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22"/>Zila kamulela Tubali-Kaini, ayo yatendile via va namna zose kulawa muna ishaba na chuma. Lumbu ja Tubali-Kaini kakala yokemigwa Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23"/>Lameki kawalongela watwanzi zake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Tegelezeni mweye Ada na Zila, tegelezeni mbuli zangu mweye watwanzi wa Lameki. Nimkoma munhu kwavija heyo kanigela milonda, mmhale sama ya kunitoa.<verse eid="GEN 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24"/>Kamba munhu yondayamkome Kaini kotagusigwa mianza saba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:24">na munhu yondayanikome nie kotagusigwa mianza malongo saba na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Seti na Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25"/>Adamu kawasa na mtwanzi wake kabili na wapata mwana iyagwe mbigalo. Hawa kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Seti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Seti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mulungu kalava.</char></note> Kwavija Hawa kalonga, “Mulungu kanigwelela nie mwana mbigalo kusola hanhu ha Abeli, ayo Kaini yamkomile.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26"/>Seti kapata mwana kamgwelela twaga Enoshi. Mkipigiti hicho wanhu baho wasongile kumtambikila MNDEWA.<verse eid="GEN 4:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Lukolo lwa Adamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1Vipig. 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1"/>Uno uwo msululu wa lukolo lwa Adamu. Kipigiti Mulungu viyamulumbile munhu, kamulumba kamba viyali heyo mwenyego. <verse eid="GEN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2"/>Kawalumba mtwanzi na mbigalo, kawamoteza, na kawakema “Munhu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3"/>Adamu viyakalile na milao mia na malongo madatu, kapata mwana mbigalo yalingile kamba heyo mwenyego, na heyo kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4"/>Viyeshile kumulela Seti, Adamu kakala milao mia nane. Kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo <verse eid="GEN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5"/>na kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia tisa na malongo madatu.<verse eid="GEN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6"/>Seti viyakalile na milao mia na mitano, kamulela Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7"/>Viyeshile kumulela Enoshi, Seti kakala milao mia nane na saba. Kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo <verse eid="GEN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8"/>na kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia tisa na longo dimwe na mibili.<verse eid="GEN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9"/>Enoshi viyakalile na milao malongo tisa, kamulela Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10"/>Viyeshile kumulela Kenani, Enoshi kakala milao mia nane na longo dimwe na mitano. Kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo <verse eid="GEN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11"/>na kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia tisa na mitano.<verse eid="GEN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12"/>Kenani viyakalile na milao malongo saba, kamulela Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13"/>Viyeshile kumulela Mahalaleli, Kenani kakala milao mia nane na malongo mane. Kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo <verse eid="GEN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14"/>na kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia tisa na longo dimwe.<verse eid="GEN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15"/>Mahalaleli viyakalile na milao malongo sita na matano, kamulela Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16"/>Viyeshile kumulela Yaledi, Mahalaleli kakala milao mia nane na malongo madatu. Kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo <verse eid="GEN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17"/>na kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia nane na malongo tisa na matano.<verse eid="GEN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18"/>Yaledi viyakalile na milao mia na malongo sita na mabili, kamulela Henoko. <verse eid="GEN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19"/>Viyeshile kumulela Henoko, Yaledi kakala milao mia nane. Kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20"/>Yaledi kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia tisa na malongo sita na mabili.<verse eid="GEN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21"/>Henoko viyakalile na milao malongo sita na matano, kamulela Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22"/>Viyeshile kumulela Metusela, Henoko kakala mwende wa Mulungu mkipigiti cha milao mia ndatu na kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23"/>Henoko kakala milao mia ndatu na malongo sita na matano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24"/>Henoko kakala mwende wa Mulungu, abaho kayangayuka, kwavija Mulungu kamsola.<verse eid="GEN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25"/>Metusela viyakalile na milao mia na malongo manane na saba, kamulela Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26"/>Viyeshile kumulela Lameki, Metusela kakala milao mia saba na malongo manane na mabili. Kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo <verse eid="GEN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27"/>na kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia tisa na malongo sita na tisa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28"/>Lameki viyakalile na milao mia na malongo manane na mabili, kamulela mwana mbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29"/>Kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Nuhu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Nuhu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kuhozwa moyo.</char></note> yolonga, “Mwana ino iyo yondayatuhoze imioyo muna isang'hano yetu ngaga ituisang'hana na makono getu muna iisi idukumizwe na MNDEWA.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30"/>Lameki viyeshile kumulela Nuhu, kakala milao mia tano na malongo tisa na matano. Kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo <verse eid="GEN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31"/>na kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia saba na malongo saba na saba.<verse eid="GEN 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32"/>Nuhu viyeshile kuwa na milao mia tano, kawalela wana wadatu, waichanduso kakala Shemu, abaho Hamu, na hakimambukizo Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Wiho wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1"/>Wanhu viwasongile kongezeka muna iisi na kulela wandele, <verse eid="GEN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2"/>wana wa Mulungu wawona waja iwandele wa wanhu kamba wanoga, avo wamsola yoyose iwamsagule. <verse eid="GEN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3"/>MNDEWA kalonga, “Loho yangu haikala mzing'huli zidanganhika kipigiti kitali kamba kino, kwavija hewo walumbigwa na nyama, Avo kipigiti chao cha kukala muisi hakibanza milao mia na malongo mabili.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4"/>Mkipigiti hicho, na mkipigiti kidodo hamwande, Wanefili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wanefili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wakala mizinhu mikulu.</char></note> wakala muisi, kipigiti wana wa Mulungu viwacholile ha wandele wa wanhu na kulela nao wana. Wakala wanhu magalu na wali na matwaga makulu mkipigiti cha umwaka.<verse eid="GEN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5"/>MNDEWA kona kamba wiho wa wanhu ukala ubanzile muisi, na kamba mazua gose mbuli ziwakalile wogelegeza na kuzigesa mmioyo yao zikala zihile. <verse eid="GEN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6"/>MNDEWA kona giogio sama ya kuwalumba wanhu muisi, na moyo wake umema usungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7"/>Avo MNDEWA kalonga, “Nowabananga wanhu iniwalumbile, wahalawe muisi hamoja na wang'onyo wose, na vinhu inivilumbile vili muisi, na ndege wa kuulanga. Kwavija nie nokona giogio sama ya kuwalumba hewo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8"/>Ila Nuhu kanogelwa na MNDEWA.<verse eid="GEN 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9"/>Luno lulo lukolo lwa Nuhu. Nuhu kakala munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye, kakala bule mbuli na munhu mmwanza wa wanhu wa kipigiti chake, na heyo kakala mwende wa Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10"/>Nuhu kakala na wana wa kimbigalo wadatu, Shemu, Hamu, na Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11"/>Mulungu kona kamba isi ibanangika na imema na ukaini. <verse eid="GEN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12"/>Mulungu kalola na kona vija ulumwengu vuubanangike, kwavija wanhu wose muulumwengu wakala ukazi wa kutenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="GEN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13"/>Mulungu kamulongela Nuhu, “Nowabananga wanhu wose walumbigwe, kwavija ulumwengu umemezwa na ukaini sama yao, avo nowabananga hewo hamoja na ulumwengu. <verse eid="GEN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14"/>Itendele mwenyego safina <figure style="fig" alt="building the ark" file="GN06V22.TIF" size="col" loc="6:14-16" copy="The Bible Society of Papua New Guinea, New Reader Books – Genesis Series" ref="6:14">Safina</figure> ya mbamha za m'vinje, tenda magati mgati yake na uibakaze lami mgati na hanze giladi mazi sambigengile mgati. <verse eid="GEN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15"/>Vino vivo vondauizenge, utali wake meta 133, na ugazi wake meta 22, na wimo wake kuchola uchana meta 13. <verse eid="GEN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16"/>Itendele kiswili na uleke nafasi ya utali wa sentimeta 44 hagatigati ya ikiswili na iviwambaza. Izenge iwe na golofa ndatu, na uikile na lwivi mkiwambaza. <verse eid="GEN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17"/>Nogala mmemelo wa mazi muisi kukibananga kila kinhu kili na mhumuzi ya ugima. Kila kinhu muisi chodanganhika, <verse eid="GEN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18"/>ila nokwika lagano na gweye. Kokwingila muisafina gweye na mtwanzi wako, na wanago, na watwanzi zao. <verse eid="GEN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19"/>Uvingize muisafina vinhu vose inivilumbile vili na ugima, uvingize vibilivibili, mtwanzi na mbigalo, giladi gweye na hewo muwe na ugima. <verse eid="GEN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20"/>Wengize muisafina wabiliwabili, mtwanzi na mbigalo, namna zose za ndege, namna zose za wang'onyo, na vinhu vose vili na ugima vitembela muisi, weze kumwako uwemilize sambiwadanganhike. <verse eid="GEN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21"/>Kosola vakuja va namna zose vija vidigwa na kuvika ngama viwe vakuja venu na vakuja va wang'onyo hiwo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22"/>Nuhu katenda kila kinhu kamba Mulungu viyamulagize.<verse eid="GEN 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmemelo wa Mazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1"/>Abaho MNDEWA kamulongela Nuhu, “Ingila muisafina hamoja na mulango wako wose, kwavija nyona kamba gweye wiyeka iyo munhu ulibule uzenzeleganye haulongozi wangu mmwanza wa wanhu wa mulelo uno. <verse eid="GEN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2"/>Wengize wang'onyo wa namna zose, wang'onyo walumbile kulavigwa nhosa sabasaba, mtwanzi na mbigalo, na wang'onyo hawalumbile kulavigwa nhosa wabiliwabili, mtwanzi na mbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3"/><figure style="fig" alt="animals entering the ark" file="GN07V08.TIF" size="col" loc="7:1-3" copy="The Bible Society of Papua New Guinea, New Reader Books – Genesis Series" ref="7:3">Wang'onyo wengila muisafina wabiliwabili.</figure> Vivija wengize ndege sabasaba wa namna zose, mtwanzi na mbigalo. Tenda vino giladi wang'onyo wa namna zose na ndege wawe wagima na walele kabili muisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4"/>Mazua saba songela sambi noitenda mvula itoe mkipigiti cha mazua malongo mane imisi na ikilo, giladi nivibanange vinhu vose vili na ugima vija inivitendile.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5"/>Na Nuhu katenda kila kinhu kamba MNDEWA viyamulagize.<verse eid="GEN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6"/>Nuhu kakala na milao mia sita mmemelo wa mazi vuwizile muisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7"/>Heyo na mtwanzi wake na wanage na watwanzi zao wengila muisafina, kuukimbila ummemelo wa mazi. <verse eid="GEN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8"/>Kila namna ya wang'onyo waja hawalumbile kulavigwa nhosa na waja walumbile kulavigwa nhosa, ndege, na wang'onyo wotambala muisi, <verse eid="GEN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9"/>wengila muisafina wabiliwabili mtwanzi na mbigalo hamoja na Nuhu, kamba Mulungu viyalagize. <verse eid="GEN 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10"/>Vigabitile mazua saba mmemelo wa mazi wiza muisi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11"/>Mmulao wa mia sita wa ugima wa Nuhu, mdizua da longo dimwe na saba da mulenge wa ikabili, mdizua dija nzokwe zose za mazi bwando zili muisi zitulika, na imizonzo ya mazi ya kuulanga ifunguligwa, <verse eid="GEN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12"/>na mvula itoa muisi mmazua malongo mane imisi na ikilo. <verse eid="GEN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13"/>Mdizua didija mvula viisongile kutoa, Nuhu na mtwanzi wake, hamoja na wana zao wadatu, Shemu, Hamu, na Yafeti, na watwanzi zao, wengila muisafina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14"/>Wengila hamoja na wang'onyo wa kumuhulo wa namna zose, wang'onyo wofugigwa wa namna zose, kila kilumbigwe kitambala muisi, na ndege wa namna zose, kila kinhu kili na mabawa. <verse eid="GEN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15"/>Wose wali na ugima weza ha Nuhu na kwingila muisafina wabiliwabili, <verse eid="GEN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16"/>mtwanzi na mbigalo, kamba Mulungu viyamulagize. Abaho MNDEWA kawahindila ulwivi.<verse eid="GEN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17"/>Ummemelo wa igamazi ugendelela mmazua malongo mane, na igamazi vigongezeke gaiinula isafina uchana ng'hani ya iisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18"/>Mazi gamema na kongezeka ng'hani muisi, na ija isafina iengeluka uchana ya igamazi. <verse eid="GEN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19"/>Mazi gakala gongezeke ng'hani muisi na kuigubikiza imigongo yose mitali, <verse eid="GEN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20"/>gakala gamemile mbaka gakala gavikile utali wa meta saba kulawa uchana ya imigongo. <verse eid="GEN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21"/>Kila kinhu kili na ugima kili muisi kidanganhika, ndege wa namna zose, wang'onyo wofugigwa wa namna zose, wang'onyo wa kumuhulo wa namna zose, kila kinhu kilumbigwe kitembela muisi, na wanhu wose. <verse eid="GEN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22"/>Vinhu vose vili na mhumuzi vikala muisi vidanganhika. <verse eid="GEN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23"/>Mulungu kavikoma vinhu vose vili na ugima vikalile muisi. Wanhu wose wadanganhika hamoja na wang'onyo, ndege, na kila kinhu kilumbigwe kitembela muisi. Nuhu hamoja na waja wakalile muisafina wao wasigale. <verse eid="GEN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24"/>Mazi gakala gamemile muisi mkipigiti cha mazua mia na malongo matano.<verse eid="GEN 7:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Kimambukizo cha Ummemelo wa Mazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1"/>Ila Mulungu kamgelegeza Nuhu na wang'onyo wose wa kumuhulo na wofugigwa waja wakalile hamoja na heyo muna isafina. Mulungu kadigala beho muisi yose, na igamazi gasonga kuhunguka. <verse eid="GEN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2"/>Nzokwe za mazi zili muisi na imizonzo ya mazi ya kuulanga vihindigwa, na mvula ileka kutoa. <verse eid="GEN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3"/>Vigabitile mazua mia na malongo matano mazi gakala gahunguka lugaluga muisi, <verse eid="GEN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4"/>na mdizua da longo dimwe na saba da mulenge wa saba isafina ima hachana ya imigongo ya Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5"/>Igamazi gahunguka, na mdizua da ichanduso da umulenge wa longo dimwe, sota za imigongo zoneka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6"/>Vigeshile mazua malongo mane Nuhu kadivugula idizonzo diyatendile muisafina <verse eid="GEN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7"/>na kumulava hanze bondwa, nayo habwelile, ila kaguluka kuno na kuno mbaka igamazi viganyalile. <verse eid="GEN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8"/>Abaho Nuhu kamulava hanze hua yalole kamba igamazi gahungula muisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9"/>Ila ija ihua hapatile hanhu ha kwima kwavija kukala na mazi muisi yose, avo kabwela ha Nuhu muisafina. Nuhu kaugolosa mkono wake kamsola ija ihua na kum'bweza kumwake muisafina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10"/>Kabeta mbaka mazua saba gayagwe, abaho kamulava ihua kabili. <verse eid="GEN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11"/>Ija ihua viyabweleganye mkipigiti cha ichungulo, mmulomo wake kakala na jani bisi da mzaituni, avo Nuhu kavitanga kamba mazi gahunguka muisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12"/>Abaho kabeta mazua saba gayagwe, kamulava hanze ija ihua. Kipigiti kino habwelile kabili kumwake.<verse eid="GEN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13"/>Nuhu viyakalile na milao mia sita na umwe, mdizua da mwanduso da umulenge wa mwanduso, igamazi ganyala. Nuhu kakisegeza ikigubiko cha isafina, kasungulila, na kona kamba isi ikala inyalile. <verse eid="GEN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14"/>Vuuvikile mulenge wa ikabili na mazua malongo mabili na saba, isi ikala inyalile kabisa.<verse eid="GEN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15"/>Abaho Mulungu kamulongela Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16"/>“Lawa hanze ya isafina, gweye na mtwanzi wako, na wanago na watwanzi zao. <verse eid="GEN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17"/>Walave hanze kila kinhu kilumbigwe kili na ugima kili hamoja na gweye, ndege, wang'onyo, na kila kinhu kilumbigwe kitembela muisi giladi wenele muisi na kulela na kongezeka.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18"/>Avo Nuhu kalawa muisafina hamoja na mtwanzi wake, na wanage, na watwanzi zao. <verse eid="GEN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19"/>Wang'onyo wose, kila kinhu kilumbigwe kitembela muisi, na ndege wose walawa muisafina, kulingana na namna zao.<verse eid="GEN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhosa ya Kulukuzwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20"/>Nuhu kamzengela MNDEWA kilingo cha kulavila nhosa. Kamsola mng'onyo imwe na ndege imwe kulawa ha wang'onyo na ndege wa namna zose walumbile kulavigwa nhosa, kawalava nhosa mkuwasoma na moto hana ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa. <verse eid="GEN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21"/>Mnung'ho wa inhosa umnogela <figure style="fig" alt="altar for animal sacrifice" file="LB00253B.TIF" size="col" loc="8:20-21" copy="Louise Bass © The British and Foreign Bible Society 1994." ref="8:20">Kilingo cha Kulavila Nhosa</figure> MNDEWA, na heyo kailongela mwenyego mmoyo wake, “Siidukumiza isi kabili sama ya gaja gawatendile wanhu, hata kamba ngelegeza zao zikala zihile songela haudodo wao. Na sivibananga kabili vinhu vose vilumbigwe vili na ugima kamba vinitendile. <verse eid="GEN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22"/>Milao yose isi vondaikale, vipigiti vino haviziga, kipigiti cha kuhanda na kuhuna, kipigiti cha kihuhe na keakea, kipigiti cha zua na mvula, na kipigiti cha imisi na ikilo.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Kokwika Lagano na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1"/>Mulungu kawamoteza Nuhu na wanage, mkuwalongela, “Leleni mkongezeke, mkaimemeze isi. <verse eid="GEN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2"/>Wang'onyo wose, ndege wose, somba wose, na kila kilumbigwe kitembela muisi wowadumba mweye. Wose wekigwa mmakono genu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3"/>Kila kinhu kili na ugima kitembela muisi chowa mandia genu. Kamba viniwagwelele mboga, sambi nowagwelela kila kinhu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4"/>Nyama ili na mulopa mgati yake hamulondigwa kuija, kwavija ugima wa mmulopa. <verse eid="GEN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5"/>Nomkoma munhu yoyose yomkoma munhu iyagwe. Kamba mng'onyo yahamkoma munhu, na heyo kolondigwa yakomigwe, na munhu yoyose yomkoma miyage, na heyo kolondigwa yakomigwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6"/>Munhu kalumbigwa muiningo ya Mulungu, avo munhu yoyose yomkoma munhu, na heyo kokomigwa na wanhu.<verse eid="GEN 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7"/>“Leleni mkongezeke, mwenele muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8"/>Abaho Mulungu kawalongela Nuhu na wanage, <verse eid="GEN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9"/>“Sambi nokwika lagano jangu na gweye na lukolo lwako, <verse eid="GEN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10"/>na vinhu vose vili na ugima vikalile hamoja na gweye, ndege wose, wang'onyo wose wofugigwa, wang'onyo wose wa kumuhulo, na kila kinhu chuulawilenacho muisafina, kila kinhu kili na ugima kilumbigwe muisi. <verse eid="GEN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11"/>Nokwika lagano jangu na gweye, kamba vinhu vose vili na ugima havibanangigwa kabili na ummemelo wa mazi. Na ummemelo wa mazi hauubananga kabili iisi.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12"/>Abaho Mulungu kalonga, “Kino kicho kilaguso cha lagano dinitenda na gweye na kila kilumbigwe kili na ugima, lagano sama ya milelo yose ikwiza, <verse eid="GEN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13"/>nokwika pindamulungu jangu muna gamawingu. Dowa kilaguso cha lagano jangu na ulumwengu. <verse eid="GEN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14"/>Kipigiti nihaugubika ulanga na mawingu, pindamulungu dolawila mmawingu, <verse eid="GEN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15"/>donitenda nikikumbukile kilagano changu kinitendile na gweye na vinhu vose vilumbigwe vili na ugima va namna zose. Mmemelo wa mazi hauvibananga kabili vinhu vose vili na ugima. <verse eid="GEN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16"/>Kipigiti pindamulungu dihakoneka muna gamawingu, nojona na kukumbukila lagano jangu da digunge hagatigati yangu na vinhu vose vili na ugima vili muisi. <verse eid="GEN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17"/>Kino kicho kilaguso cha lagano dinitendile hagatigati yangu na vinhu vose vili na ugima.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nuhu na Wanage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18"/>Wanage Nuhu walawile hanze ya isafina wakala Shemu, Hamu, na Yafeti. Hamu kakala tata wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19"/>Wana wano wadatu wa Nuhu wakala wahenga wa wanhu wose wali muisi.<verse eid="GEN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20"/>Nuhu, ayo yakalile mulimi, kakala munhu wa ichanduso kuhanda mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21"/>Nuhu kang'wa ugimbi, kakoligwa, kawasa mwazi mdihema jake. <verse eid="GEN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22"/>Hamu, tata wa Kanaani, viyonile kamba tataake kakala mwazi, kalawa hanze kawalongela wakulu zake. <verse eid="GEN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23"/>Abaho Shemu na Yafeti wasola kivalo na kukibasika mmaega gao. Abaho wabwela kisengelenyuma na kumgubika tataao. Wakala wavihinduse vihanga vao giladi sambiwone mwazi wa tataao. <verse eid="GEN 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24"/>Ugimbi vuumsegele, Nuhu kalamuka na kukitanga kija mwanage mdodo kiyamtendele, <verse eid="GEN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25"/>kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">“Yadukumizwe Kanaani!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:25">Kowa nyakadala wa nyakadala ha ndugu zake.<verse eid="GEN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26"/>Yatogolwe MNDEWA, Mulungu wa Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani yawe nyakadala wa Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27"/>Mulungu yautanule undewa wa Yafeti!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Yafeti yakale mdihema da Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaani yawe nyakadala wa Yafeti.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28"/>Vuwishile ummemelo wa igamazi, Nuhu kakala milao mia ndatu na malongo matano <verse eid="GEN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29"/>abaho kadanganhika kuno yali na milao mia tisa na malongo matano.<verse eid="GEN 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Ndewa Zilawile Mng'holo za Wanage Nuhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:4-23">1Vipig. 1:4-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1"/>Uno uwo msululu wa wana wa Nuhu, wakala Shemu, Hamu, na Yafeti, wanhu wano wadatu walela wana vuwishile ummemelo wa mazi.<verse eid="GEN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2"/>Wana wa Yafeti wakala Gomeli, Magogu, Madai, Yavani, Tubali, Meshaki, na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3"/>Wana wa Gomeli wakala Ashikenazi, Lifati, na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4"/>Wana wa Yavani wakala Elisha, Talishishi, Kitimu, na Lodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5"/>Wana wa Yavani wakala wahenga wa wanhu awo wakalile wokala mhwani na m'visiwa. Wano wao wana wa Yafeti, wakalile wapwililike muisi mmadale na kuigola mmitala na mzindewa, na kila dale dikala na ulonzi wake. <verse eid="GEN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6"/>Wana wa Hamu wakala Kushi, Misili, Puti, na Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7"/>Wana wa Kushi wakala Seba, Havila, Sabita, Laama, na Sabiteka. Wana wa Laama wakala Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8"/>Kushi kakala na mwana iyagwe yakemigwe Nimlodi, ayo yakalile munhu wa ichanduso muulumwengu kuwa galu wa ng'hondo. <verse eid="GEN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9"/>Heyo kakala galu wa kusaka wang'onyo mkutazigwa na MNDEWA, na kija kicho kilamso cha wanhu kulonga, “MNDEWA yakutende kuwa galu wa kusaka wang'onyo kamba Nimlodi!” <verse eid="GEN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10"/>Miwambo ya ichanduso ya undewa wake ikala Babeli, Eleki, Akadi na Kaline, miwambo ino yose ikala muisi ya Shinali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Shinali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iyo isi ya Babelonia.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11"/>Kalawa muisi ija kachola mbaka Ashulu na kuizenga miwambo ya Ninawi, Lehoboti-Ili, Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12"/>na Leseni, ili hagatigati ya Ninawi na wambo kulu da Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13"/>Wana wa Misili wakala Waludi, Waanamu, Walehabi, Wanafutuhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14"/>Wapatilusi, Wakasiluhi awo wakalile sina da Wafilisti, na Wakafitoli.<verse eid="GEN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15"/>Mwana mkulu wa Kanaani kakala Sidoni, muhenga wa Wasidoni. Kanaani vivija kakala muhenga wa Wahiti, <verse eid="GEN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16"/>Wayebusi, Waamoli, Wagiligashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17"/>Wahivi, Waaliki, Wasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18"/>Waalivadi, Wasemali, na Wahamati. Abaho madale ga Wakanaani gapwililika, <verse eid="GEN 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19"/>mbaka muna izimbaka za Wakanaani kulawa mwambu wa kusi wa Sidoni mbaka Gelali behi na Gaza, na mwambu wa ulawilo wa zua mbaka Sodoma, Gomola, Adima, na Seboimu behi na Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20"/>Wano wao wana wa Hamu, wakalile wapwililike mmadale gakalile na ulonzi wao wenyego, isi zao wenyego, na ndewa zao wenyego.<verse eid="GEN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21"/>Shemu, mkulu wake Yafeti, yakalile muhenga wa lukolo lose lwa Ebeli, kakala na wana. <verse eid="GEN 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22"/>Wana wa Shemu wakala Elamu, Ashulu, Alufaksadi, Ludi, na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23"/>Wana wa Alamu wakala Uzi, Huli, Geteli, na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24"/>Alufaksadi kamulela Shela, Shela kamulela Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25"/>Ebeli kakala na wana wabili, waichanduso kakemigwa Pelegi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Pelegi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wokiigola.</char></note> kwavija kipigiti cha ugima wake wanhu wa ulumwengu wakala waigolile. Mdodo wake kakemigwa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26"/>Wana wa Yokitani wakala Alimodadi, Shelefu, Hazamaweti, Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27"/>Hadolamu, Uzali, Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28"/>Obali, Abimaeli, Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29"/>Ofili, Havila, na Yobabu. Wano wose wakala wana wa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30"/>Isi iwakalile wokala ikala yolawa Mesha mbaka Sefali, muisi ya vigongovigongo ili ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua. <verse eid="GEN 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31"/>Wano wao wana wa Shemu, wakalile wapwililike mmadale gakalile na ulonzi wao wenyego, isi zao wenyego, na ndewa zao wenyego.<verse eid="GEN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32"/>Gano gago madale ga wanage Nuhu, kulingana na ng'holo zao mgati ya ndewa zao. Ndewa zose za ulumwengu zilawa muno kipigiti vuumalile ummemelo wa igamazi.<verse eid="GEN 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Ulingo wa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1"/>Haichanduso, wanhu wose muulumwengu wakala na ulonzi umwe na nongelo imwe. <verse eid="GEN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2"/>Wanhu viwacholile ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua, wona hanhu tambalale muisi ya Shinali,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Shinali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iyo isi ya Babelonia.</char></note> wakala hiko. <verse eid="GEN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3"/>Wailongela, “Izoni tutende matofali, abaho tugoke gawe madala.” Avo wakala na matofali na lami ya kuzengela. <verse eid="GEN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4"/>Abaho walonga, “Izoni tukiizengele wambo na ulingo wondauvike kuulanga, giladi tukiitendele twaga tweye wenyego, giladi sambitupwililike muisi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5"/>MNDEWA kahumuluka hasi giladi yalole idiwambo na uulingo uzengigwe na wanhu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6"/>MNDEWA kalonga, “Wanhu wano wailumba hamoja kamba munhu imwe na kulonga ulonzi umwe, wasonga kutenda vino, avo haduhu mbuli yondawalonde kutenda yondaileke kudahika kumwao. <verse eid="GEN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7"/>Izoni, tuhumuluke hasi na kuutibula ulonzi wao giladi sambiwaitegeleze wenyego kwa wenyego.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8"/>Avo kulawa haja MNDEWA kawapwililisa muisi yose, na hewo waleka kudizenga idiwambo. <verse eid="GEN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9"/>Kija kicho kilamso cha wambo dija kukemigwa Babeli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Babeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kutibula.</char></note> kwavija haja MNDEWA kautibula ulonzi wa ulumwengu wose. Kulawa haja MNDEWA kawapwililisa muisi yose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wana wa Shemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1Vipig. 1:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10"/>Wano wao wana wa Shemu. Milao mibili songela vuwishile ummemelo wa igamazi, kipigiti Shemu viyakalile na milao mia, kamulela Alufaksadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11"/>Na viyeshile kumulela Alufaksadi, Shemu kakala milao mia tano, kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12"/>Alufaksadi viyakalile na milao malongo madatu na mitano, kamulela Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13"/>Viyeshile kumulela Shela, Alufaksadi kakala milao mia nne na midatu, kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo.<verse eid="GEN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14"/>Shela viyakalile na milao malongo madatu, kamulela Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15"/>Viyeshile kumulela Ebeli, Shela kakala milao mia nne na midatu, kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16"/>Ebeli viyakalile na milao malongo madatu na mine, kamulela Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17"/>Viyeshile kumulela Pelegi, Ebeli kakala milao mia nne na malongo madatu, kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18"/>Pelegi viyakalile na milao malongo madatu, kamulela Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19"/>Viyeshile kumulela Leu, Pelegi kakala milao mia mbili na tisa kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20"/>Leu viyakalile na milao malongo madatu na mibili, kamulela Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21"/>Viyeshile kumulela Selugi, Leu kakala milao mia mbili na saba, kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22"/>Selugi viyakalile na milao malongo madatu, kamulela Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23"/>Viyeshile kumulela Naholi, Selugi kakala milao mia mbili, kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24"/>Naholi viyakalile na milao malongo mabili na tisa, kamulela Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25"/>Viyeshile kumulela Tela, Naholi kakala milao mia na longo dimwe na tisa, kapata wana wayagwe wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo.<verse eid="GEN 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26"/>Tela viyavikize milao malongo saba, kawalela Ablam, Naholi, na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wana wa Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27"/>Wano wao wana wa Tela. Tela kawalela Ablam, Naholi, na Halani. Na Halani kamulela Loti. <verse eid="GEN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28"/>Halani kadanganhika kipigiti Tela tataake viyakalile yang'hali mgima, kadanganhikila muisi ya Ulu, ikalile isi ya Wakaldayo, isi yaavumbukile. <verse eid="GEN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29"/>Ablam na Naholi wasola watwanzi. Mtwanzi wa Ablam kakemigwa Salai, na mtwanzi wa Naholi kakemigwa Milka. Milka kakala mndele wa Halani, ayo yakalile tata wa Milka na Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30"/>Salai kakala bule sambo, avo kakala bule wana.<verse eid="GEN 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31"/>Tela kamsola Ablam mwanage, Loti mzukulu wake, ayo yakalile mwanage Halani, na Salai mkwe yake, mtwanzi wa mwanage Ablam, wose hamoja wahalawa muisi ya Ulu, ikalile isi ya Wakaldayo, wachola Kanaani. Ila viwavikile muisi ya Halani, wakala haja. <verse eid="GEN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32"/>Tela kakala milao mia mbili na mitano, abaho kadanganhika muisi ya Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Komkema Ablam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1"/>MNDEWA kamulongela Ablam, “Uhalawe kulawa muisi yako mwenyego, uwaleke ndugu zako na wanhu wa mng'anda ya tataako, uchole muisi yondanikulagusile. <verse eid="GEN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2"/>Nokutenda gweye uwe undewa mkulu. Nokumoteza na kuditenda twaga jako diwe kulu, avo kowa motelo ha wanhu wayagwe.<verse eid="GEN 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3"/>Nowamoteza awo wokumoteza gweye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:3">Ila nowadukumiza awo wokudukumiza gweye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 12:3">Na kubitila gweye nowamoteza wanhu wa isi zose.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4"/>Avo Ablam kachola kamba MNDEWA viyamulongele, na Loti kachola hamoja na heyo. Ablam kakala na milao malongo saba na mitano kipigiti viyasegele kulawa Halani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5"/>Kamsola Salai mtwanzi wake, Loti mwana wa ndugu yake, na vinhu vose viyakalile navo na wanhu wose iyakalile nao ako Halani, wahalawa wachola Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Kipigiti viwavikile Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6"/>Ablam kabita hagatigati ya isi mbaka Shekemu. Ako kuyekile ng'hambi yake hamgwazo wa biki kulu da mwaloni wa Mole. Kipigiti kija Wakanaani wakala wokala muisi ija. <verse eid="GEN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7"/>Viyakalile Shekemu, MNDEWA kamulawilila Ablam kamulongela, “Ino iyo isi yondanilugwelele lukolo lwako.” Avo hanhu haja Ablam kamzengela MNDEWA kilingo cha kulavila nhosa, MNDEWA ayo yamulawilile. <verse eid="GEN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8"/>Kulawa haja kagendelela na mwanza wake mbaka isi ya vigongovigongo ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua wa Beteli na kwika ng'hambi yake hagatigati ya Beteli na Ai. Beteli ikala ng'ambu ya uswelo wa zua, na Ai ikala ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua. Hanhu haja kamzengela MNDEWA kilingo cha kulavila nhosa na kumtambikila. <verse eid="GEN 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9"/>Abaho Ablam kahalawa, kagendelela na mwanza wake, kachola Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablam Muisi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10"/>Kipigiti hicho kukala na nzala muisi, Ablam kachola Misili na kukala mkipigiti kiguhi kamba muhenza, kwavija nzala ikala mpamanho. <verse eid="GEN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11"/>Viwakalile behi kwingila Misili, Ablam kamulongela Salai mtwanzi wake, “Nivitanga kamba gweye kwa mtwanzi unogile ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12"/>Wamisili wahakona gweye, wolonga, ‘Ino mtwanzi wake.’ Abaho nie wong'homa, ila gweye wokuleka uwe mgima. <verse eid="GEN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13"/>Walongele kamba gweye kwa lumbu jangu, avo sama yako gweye wondeka niwe mgima na kunhendele ganogile.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14"/>Ablam viyavikile Misili, Wamisili wamona Salai kamba kakala mtwanzi yanogile ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15"/>Na salange wa Falao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Falao </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mndewa wa Misili.</char></note> viwamuwene, wamtogola haulongozi wake. Avo Falao kamsola kamgala kuding'anda jake da kindewa giladi yawe imwe wa watwanzi zake. <verse eid="GEN 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16"/>Sama yake, Falao kamtendela Ablam ganogile, kamgwelela madale ga ng'hondolo, menhe, ng'ombe, mhunda, nyakadala, na ngamia.<verse eid="GEN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17"/>Ila MNDEWA kamtoa Falao na mitamu ihile ng'hani, heyo hamoja na wanhu wa ng'anda yake, sama ya Falao kumsola Salai mtwanzi wa Ablam. <verse eid="GEN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18"/>Avo Falao kamkema Ablam, kamulongela, “Choni kino chuunitendele? Habali hunilongele kamba heyo kakala mtwanzi wako? <verse eid="GEN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19"/>Habali ulongile kamba kakala lumbu jako, na kunileka nie nimsole yawe mtwanzi wangu? Mtwanzi wako ino hano, msole uchole!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20"/>Abaho Falao kawalagiza wanhu zake wamsegeze Ablam na kumulava hanze ya isi ija, heyo hamoja na mtwanzi wake na kila kinhu kiyakalilenacho.<verse eid="GEN 12:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Ablam na Loti Wokiinega</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1"/>Avo Ablam kahalawa Misili kachola Negebu, heyo hamoja na mtwanzi wake na kila kinhu kiyakalilenacho, na Loti kachola hamoja na heyo. <verse eid="GEN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2"/>Ablam kakala munhu mgoli ng'hani, kakala na ng'hondolo, menhe, ng'ombe, na madini ga feza na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3"/>Kulawa Negebu kabita hanhu hamwe mbaka hayagwe na kuvika Beteli, hagatigati mwa Beteli na Ai ako kuikalile hema yake kipigiti kibitile, <verse eid="GEN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4"/>hanhu hayazengile kilingo cha kulavila nhosa haichanduso. Ablam kamtambikila MNDEWA haja.<verse eid="GEN 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5"/>Loti, ayo yacholile hamoja na Ablam, vivija kakala na madale ga ng'hondolo, menhe, ng'ombe na mahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6"/>Avo isi haiwatoshile hewo wabili kukala hamoja, kwavija wakala na madale makulu ng'hani ga wang'onyo. <verse eid="GEN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7"/>Na ngomba izuka hagatigati ya wachunga wang'onyo wa Ablam na wachunga wang'onyo wa Loti. Kipigiti hicho Wakanaani na Wapelizi vivija wakala wokala muisi ija. <verse eid="GEN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8"/>Avo Ablam kamulongela Loti, “Sambikuwe na ngomba hagatigati yangu nie na gweye, ama hagatigati ya wachunga wako na wangu, kwavija tweye twa ndugu. <verse eid="GEN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9"/>Isi ino yose ya haulongozi wako. Natuinege. Kamba uhachola mkono wa ukumoso, nie nochola mkono wa ukulume. Na kamba uhachola mkono wa ukulume, nie nochola mkono wa ukumoso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10"/>Loti kalola na kujona bawe da Yolodani dikala na mazi bwando kila hanhu, mnzila ya kuchola mkiwambo cha Soali, dikala kamba kihati cha MNDEWA,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kihati cha MNDEWA</char><char style="ft" closed="false">kicho Kihati cha Edeni.</char></note> ama kamba isi ya Misili. Mbuli ino ilawilila kipigiti MNDEWA viyakalile yang'hali hanavibananga viwambo va Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11"/>Avo Loti kasagula bawe jose da Yolodani, avo kachola ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua. Vino vivo wanhu wano wabili viwaigolile. <verse eid="GEN 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12"/>Ablam kakala muisi ya Kanaani, na Loti kakala hagatigati ya miwambo ya idibawe na kwika ng'hambi yake behi na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13"/>Wanhu wa Sodoma wakala wehile ng'hani na wakala womtendela MNDEWA vilozo vikulu ng'hani.<verse eid="GEN 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablam Kochola Hebloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14"/>Loti viyasegele, MNDEWA kamulongela Ablam, “Lola kulawa aho hauli, ulole ng'ambu zose. <verse eid="GEN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15"/>Isi ino yose iuyona nokugwelela gweye na lukolo lwako, na yowa yako mazua gose. <verse eid="GEN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16"/>Nolutenda lukolo lwako luwe kamba timbwisi da isi, avo kamba munhu yoyose yodaha kudipeta timbwisi, vivija lukolo lwako lodahika kupetigwa. <verse eid="GEN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17"/>Genda, ubite muisi yose ulole utali wake na ugazi wake, kwavija nie nokugwelela isi ino yose.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18"/>Avo Ablam kaikunza hema yake kachola kukala behi na mibiki mikulu ya mwaloni ya munhu imwe yakemigwe Mamle ako mkiwambo cha Hebloni, ako kuyamzengele MNDEWA kilingo cha kulavila nhosa.<verse eid="GEN 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ablam Komkombola Loti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1"/>Mkipigiti cha mndewa Amlafeli wa Shinali,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Shinali</char><char style="ft" closed="false">iyo isi ya Babelonia.</char></note> mndewa Alioki wa Elasali, mndewa Kedolaomeli wa Elamu, na mndewa Tidali wa Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2"/>wandewa wano watenda ng'hondo na mndewa Bela wa Sodoma, mndewa Bilisha wa Gomola, mndewa Shinabi wa Adima, mndewa Shemeba wa Seboimu, na mndewa wa Bela ama mtwaga diyagwe Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3"/>Wandewa wano watano wawaduganya hamoja asikali zao Mdibonde da Sidimu, ajo dikemigwe Bahali ya Munyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4"/>Wakala hasi ya utawala wa mndewa Kedolaomeli mkipigiti cha milao longo dimwe na mibili, ila mmulao wa longo dimwe na midatu, wainega na heyo. <verse eid="GEN 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5"/>Mmulao wa longo dimwe na mine, mndewa Kedolaomeli na wandewa wakalile hamoja na heyo weza na kuwahuma Walefai ako Ashitelosi-Kalinaimu, Wazuzi ako Hamu, Waemi ako Shawe-Kiliasaimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6"/>na Waholi muisi ya vigongovigongo ya Seili mbaka Eli-Palani behi na luwala. <verse eid="GEN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7"/>Abaho wahinduka kukisogo na kuchola Kadeshi, itangigwe mtwaga diyagwe Eni-Mishipati. Waisola isi yose ya Waamaleki, na kuwahuma Waamoli wakalile wokala mkiwambo cha Hasasoni-Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8"/>Abaho wandewa wa Sodoma, Gomola, Adima, Seboimu, na Bela wawaduganya asikali zao sama ya kutenda ng'hondo Mdibonde da Sidimu na kugomba na <verse eid="GEN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9"/>Kedolaomeli mndewa wa Elamu, Tidali mndewa wa Goimu, Amlafeli mndewa wa Shinali, na Alioki mndewa wa Elasali. Wandewa wane wagomba na wandewa watano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10"/>Bonde da Sidimu dikala dimemile mikolongo ya lami, na iwandewa wa Sodoma na Gomola hamoja na asikali zao viwakimbile kulawa hana ing'hondo, wanhu wayagwe walagalila mmikolongo hiyo, na wanhu wasigale wakimbilila kuvigongo. <verse eid="GEN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11"/>Waja iwandewa wane wasola kila kinhu kulawa Sodoma na Gomola, wasola na vakuja, abaho wachola. <verse eid="GEN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12"/>Loti, mwana wa ndugu yake Ablam, kakala yokala Sodoma, avo wamsola heyo na vinhu vake vose.<verse eid="GEN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13"/>Abaho munhu imwe yakalile yahonyokwe, keza na kumulongela Ablam Mueblania. Ablam kakala yokala behi na mibiki mikulu ya mwaloni ya munhu imwe yakemigwe Mamle Mwamoli, ndugu wa Eshikoli na Aneli, awo wose wakalile hamoja na Ablam. <verse eid="GEN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14"/>Ablam viyahulike kamba ndugu yake kagogigwa, kawakema wanhu wa ng'hondo mia ndatu na longo dimwe na wanane hang'hambi yake, wanhu waleligwe mng'anda yake, kawakoleleza waja iwandewa wane mbaka mkiwambo cha Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15"/>Viwavikile haja Ablam kawagola wanhu zake mmadalemadale. Viivikile ikilo, wawavamhila waja iwandewa wane na kuwahuma. Kawawinga mbaka kiwambo cha Hoba, kasikazi ya wambo da Damaski. <verse eid="GEN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16"/>Avo kavibweza vinhu vose vikalile visoligwe, na kum'bweza Loti ndugu yake na vinhu vake, hamoja na watwanzi na wanhu wayagwe.<verse eid="GEN 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Melikizedeki Kommoteza Ablam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17"/>Ablam viyabwelile kipigiti viyeshile kumuhuma Kedolaomeli na wandewa wayagwe wakalile na heyo, mndewa wa Sodoma keza kuiting'hana na heyo Mdibonde da Shawe, ajo vivija dikemigwe Bonde da Mndewa. <verse eid="GEN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18"/>Na Melikizedeki, mndewa wa Salemu na mkulu wa nhambiko wa Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani, kamgalila Ablam mkate na divai, <verse eid="GEN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19"/>kammoteza, na kumulongela, “Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani, heyo yalumbile ulanga na isi, yammoteze Ablam! <verse eid="GEN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20"/>Yayenzigwe Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani, ayo yakutendile gweye uwahume wadumuka zako!” Na Ablam kamgwelela Melikizedeki zaka ya vinhu vose viyabwelile navo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21"/>Mndewa wa Sodoma kamulongela Ablam, “Nigwelele wanhu zangu, ila vinhu vuupatile hiko sigala navo.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22"/>Ila Ablam kamulongela mndewa wa Sodoma, “Nimduilila MNDEWA, Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani, yalumbile ulanga na isi, <verse eid="GEN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23"/>kamba sisola kinhu chako chochose, luzi ama luzabi lwa kilatu, giladi sambiulonge, ‘Nie iyo nimtendile Ablam yawe mgoli.’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24"/>Nie mwenyego sisola kinhu chochose, ila notogola kija kiwadile wanhu zangu, na dija idifungu da wanhu wacholile kung'hondo hamoja na nie, kina Aneli, Eshikoli, na Mamle.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Lagano da Mulungu na Ablam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1"/>Abaho usenga wa MNDEWA umwizila Ablam muinzozi, wolonga, “Sambiudumbe, Ablam! Nie nokwimiliza, nhunza yako yowa ng'hulu ng'hani.”<verse eid="GEN 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2"/>Ila Ablam kalonga, “MNDEWA Mulungu, nhunza yaki inogile yondaunigwelele? Kwavija nie nabule mwana, na muhazi wa ng'anda yangu iyo Eliezeli munhu wa Damaski. <verse eid="GEN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3"/>Kwavija hunigwelele wana, avo nyakadala imwe yali mng'anda yangu iyo yondayawe muhazi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4"/>Abaho usenga wa MNDEWA umwizila mwanza wa ikabili, ulonga, “Nyakadala ino Eliezeli hawa muhazi wa mali gako, ila mwanago mwenyego iyo yondayawe muhazi wako.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5"/>MNDEWA kamsola kamulava hanze, kamulongela, “Lola uchana kuulanga, uzipete zinhondo kamba uhadaha. Avo, vino vivo lukolo lwako vondaluwe.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6"/>Ablam kamtamanila MNDEWA, na sama ya nhamanila yake, MNDEWA kampeta heyo kamba kabule uzenzeleganye.<verse eid="GEN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7"/>Abaho kamulongela, “Nie iyo MNDEWA nikulavile kulawa isi ya Ulu, ikalile isi ya Wakaldayo, nikugwelele isi ino iwe yako.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8"/>Ila Ablam kalonga, “Gweye, MNDEWA Mulungu, novitangaze kamba isi ino yowa yangu?” <verse eid="GEN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9"/>Avo MNDEWA kamulongela, “Nigalile bogwa wa ng'ombe yali na milao midatu, bogwa wa menhe yali na milao midatu, na songolomi wa ng'hondolo yali na milao midatu, hamoja na hua na nziwa.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10"/>Ablam kawagala wang'onyo wano wose ha Mulungu, kawakanha nyenza mbilimbili na kuzika mminhongo mibili, na kila lwenza lukiilola na miyage. Ila ndege kawachinja ila hawakanhile mzinyenza. <verse eid="GEN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11"/>Vimhungu waihumulukila imitufi, ila Ablam kawawinga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12"/>Zua vidiswile, Ablam kawasa utulo kakuluza, ziza na bwembe vimgubika. <verse eid="GEN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13"/>MNDEWA kamulongela, “Uvitange kamba lukolo lwako lowa wahenza muisi ya wanhu wayagwe. Ako wowa nyakadala na wotendeligwa gehile mkipigiti cha milao mia nne. <verse eid="GEN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14"/>Ila nousuna undewa uja wondauwatende hewo wawe nyakadala, abaho wolawa na mali bwando. <verse eid="GEN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15"/>Ila gweye koilumba hamoja na wahenga zako mditindiwalo kuno uli na milao bwando. <verse eid="GEN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16"/>Mulelo wa ikane wa lukolo lwako wobwela hano na kutawala isi ino, kwavija kipigiti kino Waamoli bado hawanatenda vilozo vivikile hanhu ha hewo kutagusigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17"/>Zua vidiswile na kilo vikingile, nongo dilava yosi na wenge da moto ukwaka vibita hagatigati ya izinyenza za izinyama. <verse eid="GEN 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18"/>Mdizua dija MNDEWA katenda lagano na Ablam, kamulongela, “Nowagwelela lukolo lwako isi ino, kulawa lwanda lwa Misili mbaka Lwanda lwa Yuflati, <verse eid="GEN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19"/>isi ya Wakeni, Wakenizi, Wakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20"/>Wahiti, Wapelizi, Walefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21"/>Waamoli, Wakanaani, Wagiligashi, na Wayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Hajili na Sumaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1"/>Salai, mtwanzi wa Ablam, hamulelele wana. Ila Salai kakala na nyakadala wa kitwanzi Mmisili yakemigwe Hajili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2"/>Avo kamulongela Ablam, “MNDEWA kanizuila nie sambiniwe na wana. Genda ukawase na nyakadala wangu, siku nopata wana kubitila heyo.” Ablam kakitogola kija kiyamulongele Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3"/>Avo Ablam viyeshile kukala milao longo dimwe muisi ya Kanaani, Salai mtwanzi wa Ablam kamsola Hajili Mmisili nyakadala wake wa kitwanzi, kamgwelela Ablam yawe mtwanzi wake. <verse eid="GEN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4"/>Ablam kamwingilila Hajili, na kapata inda. Ila viyavitangile kamba kana inda, Hajili kasonga kumzabuza Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5"/>Abaho Salai kamulongela Ablam, “Gweye iyo kilamso cha gaja gehile gonigaya. Nikugwelela nyakadala wangu, sambi kovitanga kamba kana inda, avo kosonga kunizabuza. MNDEWA yawe mulamula hagatigati yako gweye na nie.”<verse eid="GEN 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6"/>Ablam kamulongela Salai, “Nyakadala wako ka mmakono gako, tenda chochose chuugelegeza kamba kinoga kumtendela.” Abaho Salai kamtendela gehile Hajili, avo Hajili kamkimbila Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7"/>Msenga wa MNDEWA wa kuulanga kam'vika Hajili behi na nzokwe ya mazi mkiwala ikalile hamgwazo wa inzila ya kuchola Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8"/>Ija imsenga wa MNDEWA wa kuulanga kamuuza, “Hajili, nyakadala wa Salai, kolawa kwahi na kochola kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Hajili kamwidika, kamulongela, “Nomkimbila bibi yangu Salai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9"/>Ija imsenga wa MNDEWA wa kuulanga kamulongela Hajili, “Bwela ha Salai, uwe nyakadala wake.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10"/>Abaho kamulongela, “Nokugwelela ng'holo bwando, haduhu munhu yondayadahe kuzipeta. <verse eid="GEN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11"/>Kopata mwana, komkema Sumaili,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sumaili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mulungu kohulika.</char></note> kwavija MNDEWA kakihulika kililo cha mgayo wako. <verse eid="GEN 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12"/>Ila mwanago kowa kamba mhunda wa kumuhulo, kwavija haduhu munhu yondayadahe kumulongoza. Kowa mdumuka wa kila munhu, na kila munhu kowa mdumuka wake. Heyo kokala kutali na ndugu zake wose.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13"/>Hajili kamgwelela twaga MNDEWA, ayo yalongile na heyo twaga dikemigwa, “Gweye iyo Mulungu unyona nie.” Kwavija kalonga, “Nimona Mulungu yonyona nie” <verse eid="GEN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14"/>Kino kicho kilamso cha sima dija kukemigwa Beeli-Lahai-Loi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Beeli-Lahai-Loi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sima da mwene ugima, ayo yonyona nie.</char></note> sima hijo da hagatigati ya Kadeshi na Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15"/>Hajili kamulelela mwana Ablam, na Ablam kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Sumaili. <verse eid="GEN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16"/>Ablam kakala na milao malongo manane na sita kipigiti Hajili viyamulelile Sumaili.<verse eid="GEN 16:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Kumbi Utango wa Lagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1"/>Ablam viyakalile na milao malongo tisa na tisa, MNDEWA kamulawilila, kamulongela, “Nie iyo Mulungu Mwene Mhiko. Nitegeleze nie na sambiuwe na mbuli na munhu. <verse eid="GEN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2"/>Noditenda lagano jangu hagatigati yangu nie na gweye, na nie nolongeza lukolo lwako.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3"/>Ablam kagwa kingubanguba. Abaho Mulungu kamulongela, <verse eid="GEN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4"/>“Noditenda lagano dino na gweye. Nokwika kilagano kamba gweye kowa tata wa ndewa bwando. <verse eid="GEN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5"/>Twaga jako hadikemigwa Ablam,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ablam</char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tata yenuligwe.</char></note> ila Ablaham,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ablaham </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tata wa ndewa bwando.</char></note> kwavija nokutenda gweye kuwa tata wa ndewa bwando. <verse eid="GEN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6"/>Nokutenda wongezeke ng'hani. Lukolo lwako lokwiza kuwa ndewa bwando, na wandewa wolawa kumwako.<verse eid="GEN 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7"/>“Nodigoga lagano jangu diniilagane na gweye hamoja na lukolo lwako londalwize kulawa mulelo umwe mbaka mulelo uyagwe, na kino chowa kilagano cha gunge na gunge. Mazua gose nie nowa Mulungu wako gweye na Mulungu wa lukolo lwako londalwize. <verse eid="GEN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8"/>Nokugwelela gweye na lukolo lwako isi ino yuukala sambi kamba muhenza. Isi yose ya Kanaani yowa ya lukolo lwako milongo yose, na nie nowa Mulungu wao.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9"/>Mulungu kamulongela Ablaham, “Gweye vivija kolondigwa udigoge lagano jangu, wose gweye na lukolo lwako londalwize. <verse eid="GEN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10"/>Dino dijo lagano jangu na gweye na lukolo lwako londalwize. Kila mbigalo mmwanza wenu kolondigwa yengile kumbi. <verse eid="GEN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11"/>Molondigwa mwingizigwe kumbi, na chowa kilaguso cha lagano hagatigati yangu nie na mweye. <verse eid="GEN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12"/>Kulawa sambi kolondigwa umwingize kumbi kila mwana mbigalo kipigiti yahavikiza mazua manane, nyakadala yaleligwe mng'anda yako na nyakadala yaguligwe kulawa ha wahenza awo walekile kulawa mulukolo lwako. <verse eid="GEN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13"/>Kila mbigalo kolondigwa yengizigwe kumbi, na mbuli ino yowa kilaguso cha lukuli kulagusa kamba lagano jangu diniilagane na gweye dowa lagano da digunge. <verse eid="GEN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14"/>Mbigalo yalekile kwingila kumbi, heyo hapetigwa kuwa munhu wangu, kwavija hadigogile lagano jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15"/>Vivija Mulungu kamulongela Ablaham, “Kulawa sambi sambiumkeme mtwanzi wako twaga dikemigwa Salai, ila twaga jake dowa Sala.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sala </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mndele wa mndewa.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16"/>Nommoteza, na nokugwelela mwana kubitila heyo. Nommoteza, na heyo kowa mama wa ndewa bwando, na wandewa wa wanhu wolawa kumwake.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17"/>Ablaham kagwa kingubanguba, kaseka, na kuilongela mwenyego, “Munhu yali na milao mia kodaha kulela mwana? Sala yali na milao malongo tisa kodaha kulela mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18"/>Ablaham kamulongela Mulungu, “Habali sambiumuleke Sumaili yawe muhazi wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19"/>Ila Mulungu kamulongela, “Bule, mtwanzi wako Sala kokulelela mwana, na gweye komgwelela twaga Isaka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Isaka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kiseko.</char></note> Lagano jangu noditenda na heyo hamoja na lukolo lwake londalwize. Dino dowa lagano da digunge. <verse eid="GEN 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20"/>Mmbuli ya Sumaili, nigahulika gaja gaulondile, avo nommoteza na kumgwelela wana bwando na lukolo bwando. Heyo kowa tata wa wana wa mndewa longo dimwe na wabili, na lukolo lwake lowa undewa mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21"/>Ila lagano jangu noditenda na Isaka, ayo Sala yondayakulelele gweye mkipigiti kamba kino cha mulao ukwiza.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22"/>Viyeshile kulonga na heyo, Mulungu kachola uchana kulawa ha Ablaham.<verse eid="GEN 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23"/>Mdizua didija Ablaham kamsola mwanage Sumaili na wambigalo wose waleligwe mng'anda yake na waja waguligwe, kawengiza kumbi, kamba Mulungu viyamulongele. <verse eid="GEN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24"/>Ablaham kakala na milao malongo tisa na tisa kipigiti viyengizigwe kumbi, <verse eid="GEN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25"/>na mwanage Sumaili kakala na milao longo dimwe na midatu. <verse eid="GEN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26"/>Ablaham na mwanage Sumaili, wose wabili wengizigwa kumbi mdizua dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27"/>Na kila mbigalo yali mmulango wa Ablaham, nyakadala yaleligwe mng'anda yake na nyakadala yaguligwe kulawa ha wahenza, wengila kumbi hamoja na heyo.<verse eid="GEN 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Ablaham Kokwikiligwa Kilagano cha Kupata Mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1"/>MNDEWA kamulawilila Ablaham behi na mibiki mikulu ya mwaloni ya munhu imwe yakemigwe Mamle kipigiti viyakalile hanhu ha kwingilila muihema yake mkipigiti cha keakea da imisi. <verse eid="GEN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2"/>Ablaham kenula meso gake, kawona wanhu wadatu wema behi na heyo. Viyawawene, hima kalawa hanhu ha kwingilila muihema yake kawakimbilila na kuwafugamila mavindi kainamila mbaka hasi haulongozi wao. <verse eid="GEN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3"/>Kalonga, “Mndewa wangu, kamba nipata ngekewa hameso gako, sambiunibite mtumigwa wako. <verse eid="GEN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4"/>Beta niwalagizile mazi mnave magulu genu, na muhumule hasi ya m'biki uno, <verse eid="GEN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5"/>niwagwelele kinhu cha kuja mpate mhiko abaho mgendelele na mwanza wenu, kwavija mmwizila mtumigwa wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Na hewo walonga, “Tenda kamba vuulongile.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6"/>Ablaham hima kengila mdihema kamulongela Sala, “Hima, sola gunia da usage wako unogile woke mikate.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7"/>Abaho Ablaham kakimbila kuchola mdidale da ng'ombe, kasola mwanang'ombe yanonile na kumgwelela mtumigwa, na heyo kamchinja himahima na kumsasala. <verse eid="GEN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8"/>Ablaham kasola mtindi, matombo ga ng'ombe, na nyama ya mwanang'ombe iyamsasale, kawekila haulongozi wao. Kipigiti viwakalile woja, Ablaham kema behi nao, hasi ya um'biki.<verse eid="GEN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9"/>Abaho wamuuza, “Kakwahi mtwanzi wako Sala?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Na heyo kawedika, “Ka haja mgati ya idihema.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10"/>Imwe mmwanza wao kamulongela Ablaham, “Kweli nokubwelela mkipigiti kamba kino cha mulao ukwiza, na mtwanzi wako Sala kowa na mwana.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sala kakala hachugu chake yotegeleza, hanhu ha kwingilila mdihema. <verse eid="GEN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11"/>Ablaham na Sala wakala wavyele ng'hani, na kipigiti cha Sala kupata wana kikala kimalile. <verse eid="GEN 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12"/>Avo Sala kaseka munda kwa munda, yolonga, “Vodahikaze kikongwe kamba nie mhate ndeng'ha ino, ihawa na mbigalo wangu vivija m'vyele ng'hani?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13"/>Abaho MNDEWA kamuuza Ablaham, “Habali Sala yoseka na kulonga, ‘Kweli nie nodaha kupata mwana kipigiti kino cha uvyele?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14"/>Hana mbuli ileka kudahika ha MNDEWA? Nokubwelela mkipigiti kamba kino cha mulao ukwiza, na Sala kowa na mwana.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15"/>Sala kadumba, avo kabela na kulonga, “Nie sisekile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Ila heyo kamulongela, “Ona, kuseka.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablaham Koditambikila Wambo da Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16"/>Abaho waja iwanhu wenuka haja hawakalile, walongoza nzila ya Sodoma, na Ablaham kachola hamoja na hewo giladi yawasindikize. <verse eid="GEN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17"/>Abaho MNDEWA kalonga mngelegeza, “Nimfise Ablaham kija kinilonda kutenda? <verse eid="GEN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18"/>Kwavija lukolo lwake lowa undewa wene mhiko, na kubitila heyo ndewa zose zili muisi zomotezwa. <verse eid="GEN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19"/>Nie nimsagula heyo giladi yawafundize wanage na wanhu wali mng'anda yake na waja wondawavumbuke hamwande kuigoga nzila yangu mkugatenda ganogile na galibule uzenzeleganye, giladi nie, MNDEWA, nizitende mbuli zose ziniilagane nayo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20"/>Abaho MNDEWA kamulongela Ablaham, “Mbuli zihile za Sodoma na Gomola zibanza ng'hani na vilozo vao viwa vikulu ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21"/>Nohumuluka hasi nilole kamba sang'hano zao zowotenda ziha kamba vija vinihulike. Kamba ihawa sio, novitanga.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22"/>Abaho waja iwanhu wabili wahalawa wachola Sodoma, ila MNDEWA kasigala na Ablaham. <verse eid="GEN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23"/>Ablaham kamkwenhukila MNDEWA kamuuza, “Kweli kom'bananga munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye hamoja na munhu yali na uzenzeleganye? <verse eid="GEN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24"/>Kamba hana wanhu malongo matano mdiwambo walibule uzenzeleganye, kodibananga wambo jose? Huleka kudibananga idiwambo giladi wanhu waja malongo matano wakomboligwe? <verse eid="GEN 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25"/>Sambiutende kamba avo, kumkoma munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye hamoja na munhu yali na uzenzeleganye, ama kumtendela munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye galingile na gaja ga munhu yali na uzenzeleganye. Sambiutende avo, Mulamula wa ulumwengu wose halondigwa yawebule uzenzeleganye?”<verse eid="GEN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26"/>MNDEWA kalonga, “Kamba nihawavika wanhu malongo matano walibule uzenzeleganye mdiwambo da Sodoma, wambo jose nodileka kudibananga sama yao.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27"/>Ablaham kamuuza mwanza uyagwe, “Chonde, Mndewa, nigele kumgongo avija vinigendelela kukuuza, nie si kinhu, ila timbwisi na mitozi. <verse eid="GEN 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28"/>Ila kamba uhawavika wanhu malongo mane na watano walibule uzenzeleganye, kodibananga idiwambo kwavija viwahunguke wanhu watano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">MNDEWA kamwidika, “Kamba nihawavika wanhu malongo mane na watano walibule uzenzeleganye, sidibananga.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29"/>Ablaham kamuuza mwanza uyagwe, “Vilihi kamba uhawavika wanhu malongo mane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">MNDEWA kamwidika, “Sidibananga idiwambo kamba nihawavika wanhu malongo mane.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30"/>Ablaham kalonga, “Chonde, sambiwone lusango, Mndewa, ila leka nikuuze mwanza uyagwe. Vilihi kamba uhawavika wanhu malongo madatu weiyeka walibule uzenzeleganye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">MNDEWA kamwidika, “Sidibananga idiwambo kamba nihawavika wanhu malongo madatu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31"/>Ablaham kalonga, “Chonde, Mndewa, nigele kumgongo avija vunigendelela kukuuza. Vilihi kamba uhawavika wanhu malongo mabili walibule uzenzeleganye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">MNDEWA kamwidika, “Sidibananga idiwambo kamba nihawavika wanhu malongo mabili walibule uzenzeleganye.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32"/>Ablaham kalonga, “Chonde, sambiwone lusango, Mndewa, nokuuza mwanza uno tu. Vilihi kamba uhawavika wanhu longo dimwe weiyeka walibule uzenzeleganye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">MNDEWA kamwidika, “Sidibananga idiwambo kamba nihawavika wanhu longo dimwe walibule uzenzeleganye.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33"/>Viyeshile kulonga na Ablaham, MNDEWA kachola, na Ablaham kabwela ukae.<verse eid="GEN 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Vilozo va Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1"/>Wasenga wabili wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wavika Sodoma mkipigiti cha ichungulo, na Loti kakala yakalile hana ulwivi lwa idiwambo. Loti viyawawene, kenuka kachola kuwabokela, kafugama mavindi kainamila mbaka hasi. <verse eid="GEN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2"/>Kalonga, “Chonde, wandewa zangu, bagukeni kuing'anda ya mtumigwa wenu mganave magulu genu abaho muwase, na ihavika imitondo mogendelela na mwanza wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Na hewo wamwidika, “Bule, towasa bahano hana ulubuga.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3"/>Ila kawagong'ondeza ng'hani, hakimambukizo, wachola hamoja na heyo na kwingila mng'anda yake. Loti kawalongela watumigwa zake wawatendele mandia iwahenza, avo wawokela mikate ilibule mela, na hewo waja.<verse eid="GEN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4"/>Kipigiti iwahenza hawanachola kuwasa, wanhu wose kulawa ng'ambu zose za idiwambo da Sodoma waizunguluka ing'anda, wadodo na wakulu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5"/>Wamkema Loti na kumuuza, “Wakwahi wanhu wezile kumwako ichungulo ino? Walave hanze kumwetu giladi tuwawase.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6"/>Loti kalawa hanze, kahinda ulwivi hachugu chake. <verse eid="GEN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7"/>Kawalongela, “Viha hivo, wambwiga zangu, sambimtende mbuli zino zihile! <verse eid="GEN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8"/>Loleni, nna wandele zangu wabili wang'hali hawanawasa na mbigalo. Beteni niwalavile hanze muwatendele vumulonda. Ila sambimuwatende mbuli wanhu wano. Kwavija weza mng'anda yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9"/>Ila hewo wamulongela Loti, “Segele hano.” Abaho wailongela, “Munhu ino keza hano kamba muhenza na sambi kolonda kuwa mulamula!” Abaho wamulongela Loti kabili, “Tokutenda gweye gehile kubanza hewo.” Wamkunhiza Loti na kum'bweza kisengelenyuma wakala behi na kulubomola ulwivi. <verse eid="GEN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10"/>Ila waja iwanhu wabili wakalile mng'anda wauvugula ulwivi wagolosa makono gao na kumkwenhela Loti mng'anda abaho wahinda ulwivi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11"/>Waja iwanhu wakalile hanze ya ulwivi lwa ing'anda wageligwa umbugumbugu giladi sambiwadahe kulona ulwivi, wose wadodo na wakulu.<verse eid="GEN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Loti Kosegela Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12"/>Waja iwanhu wabili wamulongela Loti, “Hana ndugu yako hano mdiwambo? Wakwe zako, wanago wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo, ama munhu yoyose yali ndugu yako? Walave kunze ya idiwambo, <verse eid="GEN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13"/>kwavija tohabananga hanhu hano. MNDEWA kahulika mbuli zihile ng'hani zowotenda wanhu wa wambo dino, avo katulagiza tweye tudibanange.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14"/>Avo Loti kachola na kuwalongela wakwe zake, awo wakalile wakasono wa wandele zake, kawalongela, “Hima, laweni hanhu hano, kwavija MNDEWA ka mmabehi kudibananga wambo dino.” Ila wakwe zake wagiza kotenda uponela.<verse eid="GEN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15"/>Mkipigiti cha nzogolo zikwika, wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wamulopoza Loti, walonga, “Lopola, msole mtwanzi wako na wandele zako wabili wali hano, ama kokwangama kipigiti idiwambo dihabanangigwa.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16"/>Loti kasinhasinha. Ila waja iwanhu wabili wamgoga mkono wake, na mkono wa mtwanzi wake, na wandele zake wabili na kuwalava hanze ya idiwambo, kwavija MNDEWA kakala yowonela bazi. <verse eid="GEN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17"/>Abaho imwe wa wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kamulongela, “Kimbila uuhonye ugima wako! Sambiulole kukisogo ama sambiwime hanhu hohose kubonde. Kimbilila kumigongo, giladi sambiukomigwe.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18"/>Ila Loti kawalongela, “Bule, chonde, wandewa zangu! <verse eid="GEN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19"/>Mtumigwa wenu kapata ngekewa hameso genu. Mweye mundagusila nie unozi mkulu mkuukombola ugima wangu. Ila migongo ya kutali ng'hani, mwangalo uno wonivika na nodanganhika kipigiti sinavika kuja. <verse eid="GEN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20"/>Lola, hana kiwambo hano kili behibehi. Beta nikimbilile hiko. Kiwambo kidodo ng'hani, nihonye ugima wangu!”<verse eid="GEN 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21"/>Kamulongela, “Vinoga ng'hani, nikuhulika. Sikibananga ikiwambo chuulonga. <verse eid="GEN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22"/>Hima! Kimbilila! Kwavija sitenda kinhu chochose mbaka vondauvike hiko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:22">Kwavija Loti kakikema kidodo, avo kiwambo kija kikemigwa Soali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Soali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kidodo.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miwambo ya Sodoma na Gomola Yobanangigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23"/>Zua dikala disimbuke kipigiti Loti viyavikile mkiwambo cha Soali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24"/>Abaho MNDEWA kauhumulusa moto na baluti kulawa kuulanga mmiwambo ya Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25"/>Kaibananga imiwambo na idibawe jose, hamoja na wanhu wose wakalile muja mmiwambo na miche yose ikalile muja mdibawe. <verse eid="GEN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26"/>Ila mtwanzi wa Loti kahinduka kukisogo, avo kagaluka nguzo ya munyu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27"/>Imitondo iyagwe Ablaham hima kachola hanhu hayakalile yemile haulongozi wa MNDEWA. <verse eid="GEN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28"/>Kalola ng'ambu ya Sodoma na Gomola na idibawe jose, kona yosi dofuka kulawa muisi, kamba yosi da tanuli. <verse eid="GEN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29"/>Ila Mulungu viyaibanange imiwambo ya kudibawe ako kuyakalile yokala Loti, kazigelegeza nhambiko za Ablaham, na kumkombola Loti kulawa mdihekaheka da ubananzi.<verse eid="GEN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Simbuko da Wamoabu na Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30"/>Loti na wandele zake wabili wahalawa mkiwambo cha Soali na kukala muisi ya migongo, kwavija kadumba kukala Soali. Heyo na wandele zake wabili wakala mmhango. <verse eid="GEN 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31"/>Ija imndele mkulu kamulongela mdodo wake, “Tata wetu m'vyele, na haduhu munhu muulumwengu wose wa kutusola tweye giladi tupate wana kamba viili ha wanhu wose. <verse eid="GEN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32"/>Avo izo tumng'weze ugimbi tata wetu, abaho tuwase nayo, giladi tupate wana kubitila heyo, na lukolo lwetu lugendelele.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33"/>Avo wamng'weza tataao ugimbi ikilo ija, na ija imndele mkulu kengila mmhango na kuwasa na tataake. Ila tataake havitangile kipigiti mndele wake viyatambalale ama viyenuke.<verse eid="GEN 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34"/>Zua diyagwe ija imndele mkulu kamulongela mdodo wake, “Ikilo ibitile niwasa na tataangu. Beta tumng'weze ugimbi kabili tataetu ikilo ya lelo, na gweye uwase nayo, giladi tupate wana kubitila heyo.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35"/>Avo vivija wamng'weza ugimbi tataao ikilo ija, na ija imndele mdodo kengila mmhango na kuwasa na tataake. Vivija tataake havitangile kipigiti mndele wake viyatambalale ama viyenuke. <verse eid="GEN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36"/>Avo wandele wose wabili wa Loti wapata inda kubitila tataao. <verse eid="GEN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37"/>Ija imndele mkulu kapata mwana mbigalo, kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Moabu. Heyo iyo muhenga wa Wamoabu wa lelo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wamoabu wa lelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wamoabu wa kipigiti vichandikigwe kitabu kino.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38"/>Vivija na ija imndele mdodo kapata mwana mbigalo, kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Ben-Ami. Heyo iyo muhenga wa Waamoni wa lelo.<verse eid="GEN 19:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Ablaham na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1"/>Ablaham kasegela kulawa Mamle kachola muisi ya Negebu na kukala hagatigati ya isi za Kadeshi na Shuli. Abaho kasegela kachola kukala mdiwambo da Gelali mkipigiti kidodo, <verse eid="GEN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2"/>hanhu haja Ablaham kuyamulongile Sala mtwanzi wake, “Ino iyo lumbu jangu.” Abaho Abimeleki mndewa wa Gelali kamsola Sala na kumtenda kuwa mtwanzi wake. <verse eid="GEN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3"/>Ila ikilo imwe Mulungu kamulawilila Abimeleki muinzozi, kamulongela, “Kodanganhika sama ya imtwanzi yuumsolile, kwavija kumsola mtwanzi wa munhu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4"/>Abimeleki hamkwenhukile ija imtwanzi, avo kalonga, “Mndewa, kolonda kuwabananga wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye? <verse eid="GEN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5"/>Ablaham mwenyego kalonga kamba heyo kakala lumbu jake, na imtwanzi kalonga vivija. Nitenda vino na nia inogile, na sitendile mbuli ihile.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6"/>Abaho Mulungu kamulongela muinzozi, “Ona, nivitanga kamba kutenda vino na nia inogile, avo nikwimiliza giladi sambiunitende vilozo. Kino kicho kilamso kamba sikulekile umkwase. <verse eid="GEN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7"/>M'bweze mtwanzi wa munhu, kwavija mbigalo wake muhokozi, na heyo kokutambikila na gweye kowa mgima. Ila kamba hum'bwezile, uvitange kamba gweye na wanhu zako wose modanganhika.” <verse eid="GEN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8"/>Imitondo ng'hani ya zua diyagwe, Abimeleki kawakema wakulu zake wose na kuwalongela gaja galawilile, na hewo wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9"/>Abaho Abimeleki kamkema Ablaham, kamulongela, “Kututendela choni? Mbuli yaki ihile inikutendile mbaka kugala nhaguso ng'hulu kumwangu nie na muundewa wangu? Kunitendela vinhu havilondigwe kutendeka. <verse eid="GEN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10"/>Habali utendile gano?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11"/>Ablaham kamwidika, kamulongela, “Nitenda vino kwavija nigelegeza kamba wanhu wa isi ino wabule kidumbo cha Mulungu, avo wodaha kung'homa sama ya mtwanzi wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12"/>Kweli heyo lumbu jangu, kwavija tweye twa wana wa tata imwe, ila kila munhu kana mamaake. Na nie nimsola heyo yawe mtwanzi wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13"/>Mulungu viyanikemile kulawa mng'anda ya tataangu, nimulongela mtwanzi wangu, ‘Kamba uhaninogela nie, kila hanhu hatuchola, mulongele kila munhu kamba nie iyo lumbu jako.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14"/>Abaho Abimeleki kasola ng'hondolo na ng'ombe, na nyakadala wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo kamgwelela Ablaham, na kum'bwezela Sala mtwanzi wake. <verse eid="GEN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15"/>Abimeleki kamulongela Ablaham, “Isi ino yose yangu nie, kala hanhu hohose haulonda.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16"/>Abaho kamulongela Sala, “Nimgwelela lumbu jako vidanga alufu imwe va feza haulongozi wa wanhu wose wali hamoja na gweye, giladi kugubika mbuli zihile zinikutendele, na kila munhu kovitanga kamba hutendile mbuli ihile.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17"/>Abaho Ablaham katambika ha Mulungu. Mulungu kamuhonya Abimeleki na mtwanzi wake na nyakadala zake wa kitwanzi giladi wadahe kupata wana kabili. <verse eid="GEN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18"/>Kwavija MNDEWA kakala yazifungile inda za wanhu wose wali mng'anda ya Abimeleki sama ya Sala, mtwanzi wa Ablaham.<verse eid="GEN 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Mvumbuka ya Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1"/>MNDEWA kamgwelela Sala ngekewa kamba viyalongile, na kamtendela Sala kija kiyamwikile kilagano. <verse eid="GEN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2"/>Sala kapata inda na kumulelela Ablaham mwana mbigalo muuvyele wake, mkipigiti kikija Mulungu kiyamwikile kilagano. <verse eid="GEN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3"/>Ablaham kamgwelela imwana twaga dikemigwa Isaka,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Isaka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kiseko.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4"/>na Isaka viyakalile na mazua manane, Ablaham kamwingiza kumbi, kamba Mulungu viyamulagize. <verse eid="GEN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5"/>Ablaham kakala na milao mia kipigiti Isaka viyavumbuke. <verse eid="GEN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6"/>Sala kalonga, “Mulungu kanigalila kiseko, na kila munhu yohulika mbuli ino koseka hamoja na nie. <verse eid="GEN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7"/>Yalihi yahadahile kumulongela Ablaham kamba Sala yahakong'heze wana? Ila nimulelela mwana muuvyele wake.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8"/>Mwana kakula, na kulekezwa kong'ha, na mdizua diyalekezwe kong'ha, Ablaham katenda lusona lukulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hajili na Sumaili Wowingigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9"/>Ila Sala kamona mwanage Ablaham, yalelile na Hajili Mmisili, yotenda uponela. <verse eid="GEN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10"/>Avo kamulongela Ablaham, “Muwinge nyakadala ino hamoja na mwanage, kwavija mwana wa nyakadala ino halondigwa kuhala hamoja na mwanangu Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11"/>Mbuli ino ikala ihile ng'hani hameso ga Ablaham, kwavija Sumaili vivija kakala mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12"/>Ila Mulungu kamulongela Ablaham, “Sambiwone giogio sama ya imwana na nyakadala wako Hajili. Tegeleza kila chondayakulongele Sala mtwanzi wako, kwavija lukolo lwako unikile kilagano nagwe lolawilila kubitila Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13"/>Vivija nomtenda mwana wa nyakadala wako yawe undewa. Kwavija heyo vivija mwanago.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14"/>Imitondo iyagwe, Ablaham kasola mandia na kibuyu cha mazi kitendigwe na kwembe, kamgwelela Hajili. Kavibasika mmaega gake na kumuleka yachole hamoja na imwana. Kachola na kuzungulukazunguluka mkiwala cha Beeli-Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15"/>Mazi vugamalile, kamwika imwana mkitutua <verse eid="GEN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16"/>na kukala hasi utali wa kwasa msale kulawa haja hayakalile imwana. Kalonga munda kwa munda, “Silonda kumona mwanangu viyodanganhika.” Kipigiti viyakalile haja, kasonga kulila na dizwi kulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17"/>Na Mulungu kadihulika dizwi da immhale, na msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kamkema Hajili kamulongela, “Hajili, kolilila choni? Sambiudumbe kwavija Mulungu kadihulika dizwi da immhale haja hayali. <verse eid="GEN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18"/>Mwinule imwana, umgoge mkono kwavija kulawa kumwake wolawa wanhu bwando wondawawe undewa mkulu.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19"/>Abaho Mulungu kagagubula meso gake, kachona kisima cha mazi. Avo kachola na kukimemeza mazi ikibuyu na kumgwelela imwana yang'we. <verse eid="GEN 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20"/>Mulungu kakala hamoja na ija imwana, kipigiti cha makuzi gake. Kakala mkiwala na kakala galu wa kusaka wang'onyo na mhinde na misale. <verse eid="GEN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21"/>Viyakalile yokala mkiwala cha Palani, mamaake kamsolela mtwanzi kulawa muisi yake ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablaham na Abimeleki Wokwika Lagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22"/>Kipigiti kija Abimeleki na Fikoli, mkulu wa asikali zake, wamulongela Ablaham, “Mulungu ka hamoja na gweye mmbuli zose zuutenda. <verse eid="GEN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23"/>Avo niduilile hano haulongozi wa Mulungu, kamba hunivwizila nie, ama wanangu, ama lukolo lwangu. Nilagusile nie na wanhu wose wa isi yuukala kamba muhenza unhu uuja unikulagusile gweye.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24"/>Ablaham kalonga, “Noiduila.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25"/>Abaho Ablaham kamtwanganikila Abimeleki mmbuli ya sima da mazi diwadibokonye watumigwa wa Abimeleki. <verse eid="GEN 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26"/>Abimeleki kalonga, “Simtangile yatendile mbuli ino, gweye hunilongele, uno uwo mwanza wangu wa ichanduso kuihulika mbuli ino.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27"/>Abaho Ablaham kamgwelela Abimeleki ng'hondolo, menhe, na ng'ombe, na wanhu wano wabili watenda lagano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28"/>Ablaham kabagula mabogwa saba ga ng'hondolo kulawa mdidale jake da wang'onyo. <verse eid="GEN 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29"/>Abimeleki kamuuza Ablaham, “Nhegulo yake choni mabogwa gano saba ga ng'hondolo yuuwabagule?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30"/>Ablaham kamwidika Abimeleki, kamulongela, “Wabokele ng'hondolo wano saba kulawa mumkono wangu, wawe usindila kamba sima dino nidihimba nie.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31"/>Avo hanhu haja hakemigwa Beeli-Sheba,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Beeli-Sheba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sima da kiduilo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ama </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sima da saba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kwavija Ablaham kaiduila kumgwelela Abimeleki ng'hondolo saba.</char></note> kwavija wanhu wabili watenda kiduilo.<verse eid="GEN 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32"/>Viweshile kutenda lagano haja Beeli-Sheba, Abimeleki na Fikoli, mkulu wa asikali zake, wabwela kuisi ya Wafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33"/>Abaho Ablaham kahanda mdai ako Beeli-Sheba na kumtambikila MNDEWA, Mulungu wa digunge. <verse eid="GEN 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34"/>Na Ablaham kakala kamba muhenza muisi ya Wafilisti mkipigiti kitali.<verse eid="GEN 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Ablaham Kogezigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1"/>Vuzimalile mbuli zino, Mulungu kamgeza Ablaham, kamulongela, “Ablaham!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Na heyo kedika, “Nie hano.”<verse eid="GEN 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2"/>Mulungu kamulongela, “Msole mwanago Isaka, ayo yaleligwe yeiyeka, ayo yuumnogele ng'hani, uchole kuna iisi ya Molia, ukamulave nhosa ya kulukuza kuna idigongo dondanikulagusile.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3"/>Avo Ablaham kalamuka imitondo ng'hani, kakanha ngodi za kulukuzila ija inhosa. Katandika mhunda wake, na kuwasola watumigwa zake wabili hamoja na mwanage Isaka. Kahalawa na kuchola hanhu hayamulongele Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4"/>Zua da ikadatu Ablaham kalola na kuhona haja ihanhu kutalitali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5"/>Abaho Ablaham kawalongela waja iwatumigwa zake, “Kaleni hano na iwamhunda. Nie na immhale tochola haja, totambika abaho towabwelela.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6"/>Ablaham kasola ngodi za inhosa ya kulukuza na kumdikwa mwanage Isaka, na heyo mwenyego kasola moto na zele. Viwakalile wochola, <verse eid="GEN 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7"/>Isaka kamuuza tataake, yolonga, “Tata.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Ablaham kamwidika, “Nie hano, mwanangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka kalonga, “Moto tunao na ngodi tunazo, ila kakwahi ing'hondolo wa kumulava nhosa ya kulukuza?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8"/>Ablaham kamulongela, “Mwanangu, Mulungu mwenyego komulava ng'hondolo wa nhosa ya kulukuza.” Avo wabili waja wagendelela na mwanza hamoja.<verse eid="GEN 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9"/>Viwavikile hanhu Mulungu hayamulagusile, Ablaham kazenga kilingo cha kulavila nhosa, na kuziwandika zingodi, kamfunga Isaka mwanage na kumtambalika mkilingo cha kulavila nhosa uchana ya izingodi. <verse eid="GEN 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10"/>Abaho kagolosa mkono wake kasola zele jake giladi yamchinje mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11"/>Ila msenga wa MNDEWA wa kuulanga kamkema na kumulongela, “Ablaham, Ablaham!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Na heyo kedika, “Nie hano.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12"/>Kalonga, “Sambiumgolosele mkono wako imwana ama kumtendela kinhu chochose kihile, kwavija sambi novimanya kamba komdumba Mulungu, avija vuulekile hata kunizuilila mwanago, mwanago yeiyeka.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13"/>Ablaham kahinduka kamona ng'hondolo mhembe zake zinamate mkitutua. Ablaham kachola na kumsola ija ing'hondolo na kumulava yawe nhosa ya kulukuza na kumuleka mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14"/>Avo Ablaham kahakema hanhu haja Yahweh-Yileh, nhegulo yake “MNDEWA iyo yalavaga.” Na wanhu woulonga ulonzi uno mbaka lelo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka lelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti vichandikigwe kitabu kino.</char></note> kamba, “Hakigongo cha MNDEWA, kalavaga.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15"/>Msenga wa MNDEWA wa kuulanga, kamkema Ablaham mwanza wa ikabili kulawa kuulanga, <verse eid="GEN 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16"/>na kulonga, “Noiduila mditwaga jangu mwenyego kwavija kuitenda mbuli ino, na hunizuilile hata mwanago, mwanago yeiyeka, <verse eid="GEN 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17"/>kweli nokumoteza na kulutenda lukolo lwako longezeke luwe kamba nhondo za kuulanga na kamba misenga ya kumgwazo wa ibahali. Lukolo lwako loibokonya miwambo ya wadumuka zao, <verse eid="GEN 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18"/>na kubitila lukolo lwako gweye ndewa zose muisi zomotezwa, kwavija kunitegeleza nie.” <verse eid="GEN 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19"/>Avo Ablaham kabweleganya ha watumigwa zake, na wose hamoja wabweleganya Beeli-Sheba, na Ablaham kagendelela kukala Beeli-Sheba.<verse eid="GEN 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukolo lwa Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20"/>Kipigiti kidodo hamwande Ablaham kalongeligwa kamba Milka vivija kamulelela mdodo wako Naholi wana wanane. <verse eid="GEN 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21"/>Waichanduso kokemigwa Uzi, iyagwe Buzi, abaho Kemueli tata wa Alamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22"/>Kesedi, Hazo, Pilidashi, Jidilafi, na Betueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23"/>Betueli iyo tata wa Lebeka. Wana wano wanane iwo Milka iyamulelele Naholi, mdodo wake Ablaham. <verse eid="GEN 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24"/>Vivija Naholi kakala na wana wane iyawalelile na mtwanzi wa kunze yakalile yokemigwa Leuma. Na gano gago matwaga gao, Teba, Gaham, Tahashi, na Maka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Sala Kodanganhika na Kuzikigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1"/>Sala kakala milao mia na malongo mabili na saba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2"/>Sala kadanganhikila hanhu hokemigwa Kiliasi-Aliba, sambi hokemigwa Hebloni, muisi ya Kanaani, na Ablaham kachola kumulilila.<verse eid="GEN 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3"/>Ablaham kenuka kulawa hamgwazo wa mwehe wake yadanganhike na kuchola kuwalongela waja Iwahiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4"/>“Nie na muhenza nikala hano mmwanza wenu. Niguzileni hanhu ha kumzikila mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5"/>Wahiti wamulongela Ablaham, <verse eid="GEN 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6"/>“Tutegeleze mndewa, kumwetu tweye gweye kwa munhu mkulu ng'hani. Mzike mtwanzi wako hana gamapanga gogose gondausagule kulawa mgamapanga getu, haduhu munhu yoyose mmwanza wetu yondayakugomese gweye sambiumzike mwehe wako mdipanga jake.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7"/>Abaho Ablaham kenuka na kainamila haulongozi wa waja Iwahiti. <verse eid="GEN 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8"/>Kawalongela, “Kamba mtogola nie nimzike mwehe wangu hano avo nitegelezeni na muyalalileni Efloni mwanage Zohali sama yangu nie, <verse eid="GEN 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9"/>yaniguzile mhango ili ako Makipela mumgwazo wa umgunda wake. Mulongeleni yaniguzile dimwe kwa dimwe hano haulongozi wenu iwe hanhu hangu ha kuzikila.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10"/>Efloni mwenyego kakala yakalile haja hamting'hano hamoja na Wahiti wayagwe, hana idizivi da kwingilila mdiwambo, kamwidika Ablaham haulongozi wa Wahiti wose. <verse eid="GEN 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11"/>Kalonga, “Si vivo, mndewa, nitegeleze, nokugwelela uja umgunda, na nokugwelela ija imhango ili mumgunda uja, nokugwelela haulongozi wa wanhu zangu, kazike mwehe wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12"/>Ablaham kainamila kabili haulongozi wa Wahiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13"/>kamulongela Efloni haulongozi wa Wahiti wose, yolonga, “Nitegeleze, nokuliha hela ya umgunda wose, nokuyalalila uibokele giladi nikamzike mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14"/>Efloni kamwidika Ablaham, yolonga, <verse eid="GEN 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15"/>“Nitegeleze, mndewa, mgunda uja woguzigwa vidanga mia nne va feza. Kino kinhu kidodo ng'hani kumwangu nie na gweye! Mzike mwehe wako.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16"/>Ablaham kazitogola mbuli za Efloni, avo kampimila Efloni vidanga va feza viyalondile, haulongozi wa Wahiti, vidanga mia nne va feza zipimigwe kulingana na vipimilo va soko da kipigiti kija.<verse eid="GEN 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17"/>Avo mgunda wa Efloni uli Makipela ukalile ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua wa Mamle, na ija imhango ikalile mumgunda, na mibiki yose ikalile muja, kaguziligwa Ablaham. <verse eid="GEN 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18"/>Viwa vake dimwe kwa dimwe haulongozi wa Wahiti wose wezile haja hadizivi da idiwambo.<verse eid="GEN 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19"/>Abaho Ablaham kamzika Sala mwehe wake muimhango ikalile mumgunda wa Makipela behi na Mamle, ukalile Hebloni muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20"/>Avo Wahiti wamguzila Ablaham uja umgunda na imhango ikalile mumgunda, hawe hanhu hake ha kuzikila.<verse eid="GEN 23:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Mwehe wa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1"/>Ablaham kakala m'vyele ng'hani, na MNDEWA kakala yammoteze Ablaham m'vinhu vose viyatendile. <verse eid="GEN 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2"/>Ablaham kamulongela mtumigwa wake ayo yakalile mvyele kuwabanza watumigwa zake wose wayagwe, ayo yakalile mkulu wa vinhu vake vose viyakalile navo, “Tenda kiduilo mkwika mkono wako hasi ya haza jangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3"/>Nokulonda gweye uiduile mditwaga da MNDEWA, Mulungu wa isi na ulanga, kamba humsagulila mwehe mwanangu kulawa mwa wandele wa Kikanaani muisi ino inikala, <verse eid="GEN 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4"/>ila genda kuisi yangu ha ndugu zangu, ukamsagulile mwehe mwanangu Isaka.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5"/>Ija imtumigwa kamulongela, “Yowaze kamba ija imndele yahalema kwiza na nie hano? Nimsole mwanago nichole nayo kuja kuna iisi yuulawile?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6"/>Ablaham kamulongela, “Lola Sambiumsole mwanangu umgale kuja, <verse eid="GEN 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7"/>MNDEWA, Mulungu yali kuulanga, yanilavile nie kulawa mng'anda ya tataangu na kulawa muisi inivumbuke ayo yalongile na nie na ayo yaniduilile yolonga, ‘Isi ino nowagwelela lukolo lwako,’ komtuma msenga wake wa kuulanga yakulongole giladi ukamgalile mwanangu mwehe kulawa kuja. <verse eid="GEN 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8"/>Ila kamba ija imndele yahalema kukukoleleza, basi kozuluhuka kulawa mkiduilo kino, kinhu kimwe kinikugong'ondeza, sambiumsole mwanangu uchole nayo kuja.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9"/>Avo ija imtumigwa keka mkono wake hasi ya haza da Ablaham mndewa wake, na kumduilila kugatenda gaja gayamulongele.<verse eid="GEN 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10"/>Abaho ija imtumigwa kasola ngamia longo dimwe wa mndewa wake na kuchola, kuno yosola namna zose za vinhu vinogilenogile kulawa ha mndewa wake. Kalawa kachola Alamu-Nahalaimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Alamu-Nahalaimu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ya ako Kaskazi na Uswelo wa zua wa isi ya Mesopotamia.</char></note> kudiwambo da Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11"/>Viyavikile, kawafugamiza mavindi waja iwangamia hanze ya idiwambo hamgwazo wa idisima da mazi, ikala ichungulo kipigiti chowocholaga watwanzi kudeha mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12"/>Katambika yolonga, “MNDEWA, Mulungu wa mndewa wangu Ablaham, lelo ungwelele kija kiniwinzile, ulaguse unozi wako ha mndewa wangu Ablaham. <verse eid="GEN 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13"/>Lola, nokwima hano behi ya idisima da igamazi, na wandele wa wanhu wa mkiwambo wokwiza hano kudeha mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14"/>Ija imndele yondanimulongele, ‘Humulusa nongo yako ning'we,’ yondayalonge, ‘Ing'wa na vivija nowang'weza na ngamia zako,’ hiyo iyo yuumsagulile mtumigwa wako Isaka. Mkutenda vino novitanga kamba kuulagusa unozi wako ha mndewa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15"/>Viyakalile hanamambukiza kutambika, Lebeka keza na nongo yake mdiega. Kakala mwana wa Betueli, Betueli kakala mwana wa Naholi, mdodo wake Ablaham, na mtwanzi wake kakemigwa Milka. <verse eid="GEN 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16"/>Lebeka kakala yanogile ng'hani, mhambe, haduhu mbigalo yakalile yawasile nayo. Kahumuluka hadisima, kamemeza nongo yake, na kubweleganya. <verse eid="GEN 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17"/>Abaho ija imtumigwa kamkimbilila na kumulongela, “Ngwaa mazi kidogo kulawa mnongo yako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18"/>Kamulongela, “Ing'wa, mndewa wangu,” hima kanenula nongo yake na kumgwelela mazi ga kung'wa. <verse eid="GEN 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19"/>Viyamambukize kumgwaa mazi ija imtumigwa, kalonga, “Vivija nowadehela na ngamia zako mbaka wose vondawamambukize kung'wa.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20"/>Hima kagela mazi mkia cha kung'wila wang'onyo na kukimbilila kabili kusima kudeha mazi mwanza uyagwe na kuwang'weza ngamia wose wasigale. <verse eid="GEN 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21"/>Bila kulonga kinhu, ija imtumigwa kamulola ng'hani ija imndele, yone kamba MNDEWA iyo yamtendile mndele ija yawe mtwanzi wa mwana wa mndewa wake ama sio.<verse eid="GEN 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22"/>Waja iwangamia viwamambukize kung'wa, ija imunhu kasola kipini cha zahabu cha hela bwando, kakigela mmhula yake na bangili mbili za zahabu za hela bwando mmakono gake. <verse eid="GEN 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23"/>Abaho kalonga, “Nilongele gweye kwa mwana wa munhu yalihi? Nilongele kuna gati mng'anda ya tataako ditulumba nie na wanhu zangu kuwasa ikilo ya lelo?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24"/>Kamulongela, “Nie na mwana wa Betueli mwanage Naholi, iyalelile na Milka, mtwanzi wake. <verse eid="GEN 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25"/>Kuna mibelege bwando na mijani ya kuja ngamia zenu, vivija hana gati da kuwasa wahenza.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26"/>Abaho ija imtumigwa kafugama mavindi kainamila na kumtambikila MNDEWA, <verse eid="GEN 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27"/>na kulonga, “Yayenzigwe MNDEWA, Mulungu wa Ablaham mndewa wangu, ayo yadigendeleze noge jake na vija viyagendelele kukigoga kilagano chake ha mndewa wangu Ablaham. MNDEWA kanilongoza dimwe kwa dimwe mbaka kung'anda ya ndugu wa mndewa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28"/>Abaho ija imndele kakimbila kachola kuwalongela wanhu wa ng'anda ya mamaake mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="GEN 24:28"/><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29-30"/>Lebeka kakala na lumbu yakalile yokemigwa Labani. Labani kamuhulika Lebeka yolonga gaja gayalongile ija imtumigwa, na kuchona ikipini na izibangili ziyavalile. Avo Labani kakimbila kachola ha mtumigwa wa Ablaham, ayo yakalile yemile hamgwazo wa iwangamia behi na idisima. <verse eid="GEN 24:29-30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31"/>Kalonga, “Izo ukae kumwetu, gweye umotezwe na MNDEWA, habali wimile hano hanze ya ikiwambo? Ng'anda isasaligwa na hanhu ha kukala ngamia hasasaligwa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32"/>Avo ija imtumigwa kachola kuna ing'anda na waja iwangamia wanenuligwa. Mibelege na mijani igaligwa na kugweleligwa iwangamia waje, na mazi gagaligwa sama yake na waja wakalile hamoja na heyo wagele magulu gao. <verse eid="GEN 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33"/>Mandia vigepile, ija imtumigwa kalonga, “Sija mbaka nilonge gaja ganilonda kulonga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Labani kamulongela, “Longa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34"/>Kalonga, “Nie na mtumigwa wa Ablaham. <verse eid="GEN 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35"/>MNDEWA kammoteza mndewa wangu ng'hani na kumtenda yawe mgoli, kamgwaa heyo ng'hondolo na ng'ombe, feza na zahabu, nyakadala wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo, na ngamia na mhunda. <verse eid="GEN 24:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36"/>Na Sala, mwehe wa mndewa wangu, kamulelela mndewa wangu mwana mbigalo kipigiti cha uvyele wake na kamgwelela kila kinhu kiyalinacho. <verse eid="GEN 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37"/>Na mndewa wangu kaniduiza na kiduilo, yolonga, ‘Sambiumsolele mtwanzi mwanangu kulawa mwa wandele wa Kikanaani, hano muisi inikala, <verse eid="GEN 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38"/>ila uchole kung'anda ya tataangu, ha ndugu zangu, ukamsolele mwehe mwanangu,’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39"/>Nimuuza mndewa wangu, ‘Yowaze kamba yahalema kwiza hamoja na nie?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40"/>Ila heyo kalonga, ‘MNDEWA initembela haulongozi wake komulagiza msenga wake wa kuulanga yachole hamoja nagwe na kutenda sambiubwele bule mmwanza wako. Ukamsolele mwanangu mtwanzi kulawa ha ndugu zangu kung'anda ya tataangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41"/>Kozuluhuka kulawa mkifungo cha kiduilo changu, ahaja vondauchole ha ndugu zangu. Hata kamba hawakugwelele mndele sama ya mwanangu, kozuluhuka kulawa mkiduilo changu.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42"/>“Lelo vunivikile hadisima, nitambika nilonga, ‘MNDEWA, Mulungu wa mndewa wangu Ablaham, kamba vihakunogela, uutende mwanza wangu uno univikize hano sambimbwele bule. <verse eid="GEN 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43"/>Nokwima hano hamgwazo wa idisima, na mndele yondayeze kudeha mazi, nompula yanigwelele mazi kidogo kulawa mnongo yake ning'we, <verse eid="GEN 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44"/>na yondayanilongele ning'we, na vivija kowadehela na ngamia zangu. Ino iyo yawe mtwanzi iyamsagule MNDEWA wangu yawe mwehe wa mwana wa mndewa wangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45"/>Kipigiti sinamambukiza kutambika mmoyo wangu, Lebeka keza na nongo yake ya mazi mdiega jake, kahumuluka hadisima na kudeha mazi. Nimulongela, ‘Ngwelela mazi ning'we.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46"/>Hima kanenula nongo yake kulawa mdiega jake, na kulonga, ‘Ing'wa na vivija nowang'weza na ngamia zako.’ Avo ning'wa na vivija kawang'weza iwangamia. <verse eid="GEN 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47"/>Abaho nimuuza, ‘Gweye kwa mndele wa munhu yalihi?’ Kalonga, ‘Nie na mndele wa Betueli, mwana wa Naholi iyalelile na Milka mtwanzi wake.’ Avo nim'vaza kipini mmhula yake, na bangili mmakono gake. <verse eid="GEN 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48"/>Abaho nifugama mavindi niinamila nimtambikila MNDEWA, na nimuyenzi MNDEWA, Mulungu wa mndewa wangu Ablaham, yanilongoze nie mnzila ilondigwe kumpata mndele kulawa ndugu za mndewa wangu sama ya mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49"/>Avo kamba vihawanogela kulagusa noge na unozi ha mndewa wangu, nilongeleni, na kamba haviwanogele, vivija nilongeleni giladi nivitange nihindukile nzila ilihi.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50"/>Abaho Labani na Betueli wamulongela, “Mbuli zino zilawa ha MNDEWA, avo tweye twabule kinhu cha kulonga. <verse eid="GEN 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51"/>Lola, Lebeka ka haulongozi wako, msole uchole nayo, yakawe mwehe wa mwana wa Mndewa wako kamba MNDEWA viyalongile.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52"/>Ija imtumigwa wa Ablaham viyahulike gaja gawalongile, kafugama mavindi kainamila mbaka hasi, haulongozi wa MNDEWA. <verse eid="GEN 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53"/>Ija imtumigwa kalava vinhu va feza na zahabu na vivalo, na kumgwelela Lebeka. Vivija kamgwelela lumbu na mamaake Lebeka nhunza za hela bwando.<verse eid="GEN 24:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54"/>Abaho heyo na wanhu iyakalile nao waja na kung'wa na wawasa haja. Imitondo viwalamuke ija imtumigwa wa Ablaham kalonga, “Nilekeni nichole ha mndewa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55"/>Mamaake na lumbu jake Lebeka walonga, “Muleke tanhu ino imndele yakale hamoja na tweye walau mazua longo dimwe, abaho kochola hamoja na gweye.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56"/>Ila ija imtumigwa kalonga, “Sambimng'hawize kwavija MNDEWA hanibwezile bule mmwanza wangu, nilekeni nichole, nibweleganye ha mndewa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57"/>Walonga, “Natumkeme imndele tumuuze.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58"/>Wamkema Lebeka, na kumuuza, “Kochola na munhu ino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Na heyo kalonga, “Nochola.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59"/>Avo wamuleka lumbu jao Lebeka hamoja na yaya yamulelile Lebeka kipigiti viyakalile mdodo yachole na ija imtumigwa wa Ablaham hamoja na wanhu iwezile nao. <verse eid="GEN 24:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60"/>Wammoteza Lebeka na kumulongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">“Gweye, lumbu jetu, uwe mama wa wanhu bwando, maalufu kwa maalufu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 24:60">Wanago wawe na mhiko na wabokonye miwambo ya wadumuka zao.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61"/>Abaho Lebeka na watumigwa zake wa kitwanzi wenuka wakwela mngamia na kumkoleleza ija imtumigwa, avo ija imtumigwa kamsola Lebeka na kuchola.<verse eid="GEN 24:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62"/>Kipigiti kija Isaka kakala yasegele Beeli-Lahai-Loi na kachola kukala muisi ya Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63"/>Isaka kakala yotembela mmigunda, na kipigiti cha ichungulo, viyenule gameso, kona ngamia wokwiza. <verse eid="GEN 24:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64"/>Na Lebeka kenula meso gake, na viyamonile Isaka, kahumuluka kulawa mngamia, <verse eid="GEN 24:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65"/>kamuuza ija imtumigwa wa Ablaham, “Ija iyo munhu yalihi, yotembele mumgunda yokwiza kutuli tweye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Ija imtumigwa kamulongela, “Ija iyo mndewa wangu.” Avo kasola kiziweziwe chake na kuigubika.<verse eid="GEN 24:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66"/>Avo ija imtumigwa kamulongela Isaka gose gayatendile. <verse eid="GEN 24:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67"/>Isaka kamwingiza Lebeka mdihema da Sala, mamaake. Kamsola Lebeka na kuwa mwehe wake, na kamnogela ng'hani. Avo Isaka kahozigwa umoyo sama ya ifa ya mamaake.<verse eid="GEN 24:67"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Lukolo Luyagwe lwa Ablaham</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1Vipig. 1:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1"/>Ablaham kasola mtwanzi iyagwe, twaga jake dikala dikemigwa Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2"/>Ketula kamulelela wana Ablaham, wakalile wokemigwa Zimulani, Yokshan, Medani, Midiani, Ishibaki, na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3"/>Yokshan kawalela Sheba na Dedani, na lukolo lwa Dedani lukala Waashulu, Waletushi, na Waleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4"/>Na wanage Midiani wakala Efa, Efeli, Hanoki, Abida, na Elida. Wana wose wano wakala lukolo lwa Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5"/>Ablaham kalonga kamba yahadanganhika, Isaka iyo yondayahale vinhu vose viyalinavo. <verse eid="GEN 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6"/>Ila kipigiti Ablaham viyakalile hanadanganhika, kawagwelela nhunza wana iyawalelile na watwanzi zake wa kunze na kuwasegeza wachole kuulawilo wa zua kutali na mwanage Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7"/>Ablaham kakala muulumwengu milao mia na malongo saba na tano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8"/>Ablaham kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile m'vyele ng'hani, kakala na ulazi wa milao bwando. Kadanganhika na kuilumba hamoja na wahenga zake. <verse eid="GEN 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9"/>Isaka na Sumaili, wanage Ablaham, wamzika tataao muimhango ya Makipela, ili mwambu wa ulawilo wa zua wa Mamle mumgunda wa Efloni mwanage Zohali Muhiti, <verse eid="GEN 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10"/>mgunda awo Ablaham uyaugulile kulawa ha Muhiti, baho hawazikigwe Ablaham na Sala mtwanzi wake. <verse eid="GEN 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11"/>Ablaham viyadanganhike, Mulungu kammoteza Isaka mwanage, ayo yacholile kukala behi na sima da Beeli-Lahai-Loi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukolo lwa Sumaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12"/>Luno lulo lukolo lwa Sumaili, mwanage Ablaham, ayo Hajili, nyakadala wa Sala kulawa Misili, iyamulelele Ablaham. <verse eid="GEN 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wana wa Sumaili, gandikigwe songela waichanduso kuvumbuka mbaka waikimambukizo. Nebayoti kakala waichanduso kuvumbuka ha Sumaili, abaho kavumbuka Kedali, Abidieli, na Mibusamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14"/>Mishima, Duma, Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15"/>Hadadi, Tema, Yetuli, Nafishi, na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16"/>Wano wao wana longo dimwe na wabili wa Sumaili, viwambo vao na ng'hambi zao vitangigwa na matwaga gao. <verse eid="GEN 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17"/>Sumaili kakala muulumwengu milao mia na malongo madatu na saba. Kadanganhika na kuilumba hamoja na wahenga zake <verse eid="GEN 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18"/>Lukolo lwa Sumaili lukala lukalile hagatigati ya isi za Havila na Shuli, behibehi na mbaka ya Misili nzila ya kuchola Ashulu. Wakala wainegile na wana wayagwe wa Ablaham.<verse eid="GEN 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumbuka kwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19"/>Luno lulo lukolo lwa Isaka mwanage Ablaham. <verse eid="GEN 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20"/>Isaka viyakalile na milao malongo mane, kamsola Lebeka mwanage Betueli, Mwalamu kulawa isi ya Padani-Alamu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:20 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Padani-Alamu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ya ako Kaskazi na Uswelo wa zua wa isi ya Mesopotamia.</char></note> lumbu jake Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21"/>Isaka kamtambikila MNDEWA sama ya mtwanzi wake, kwavija Lebeka kakala bule sambo. Na MNDEWA kazibokela nhambiko zake, na mtwanzi wake kapata inda. <verse eid="GEN 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22"/>Kakala na ubasa muinda yake na kipigiti hawanavumbuka wakala wogomba muinda yake, avo kalonga, “Habali vinhu kamba vino vindawilile nie?” Avo kachola kumuuza MNDEWA.<verse eid="GEN 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23"/>MNDEWA kamulongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“Ndewa mbili za muinda yako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">na wanhu wabili kulawa muinda yako woihasanya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Imwe kowa na mhiko kum'banza iyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">na ija imkulu komsang'hanikila ija imdodo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24"/>Kipigiti cha Lebeka kulela vikivikile, kalela wana ubasa wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25"/>Waichanduso kuvumbuka kakala mdung'hu, na lukuli lwake lose lukala na mvili, na wamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Esau.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania</char><char style="fk" closed="false">Esau </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">yali na mvili lukuli lose.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26"/>Hakimambukizo, mdodo wake kavumbuka kuno mkono wake ugogile kisiginho cha Esau, avo wamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Yakobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:26</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yakobo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kugoga kisiginho </char><char style="ft" closed="false">na vivija </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">m'vwizi.</char></note> Isaka kakala na milao malongo sita kipigiti Lebeka viyawalelile.<verse eid="GEN 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau Koguza Kija Choyolondigwa Kwing'higwa Sama ya Kuvumbuka wa Ichanduso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27"/>Waja iwana wakula, Esau kawa msakaji galu wa wang'onyo, munhu yanogelwe kukala kumuhulo, ila Yakobo kakala munhu yaholile yanogelwe kukala hakae. <verse eid="GEN 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28"/>Isaka kamnogela Esau kwavija kakala yoja nyama zayakomile, ila Lebeka kanogelwa na Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29"/>Zua dimwe Yakobo viyakalile yoteleka dengu, Esau kengila kulawa kusaka kuno yali na nzala ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30"/>Esau kamulongela Yakobo, “Hima, nigwelele mandia higo madung'hu ndie, nie nofa nzala.” Kino kicho kilamso cha Esau kukemigwa Edomu, nhegulo yake ndung'hu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Edomu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dilinga na ulonzi wa Kieblania uli na nhegulo ya </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ndung'hu.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31"/>Yakobo kamulongela, “Tanhu uniguzile nie vija viulondigwa kwing'higwa gweye sama ya kuvumbuka wa ichanduso.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32"/>Esau kalonga, “Lola, nie na mmabehi kudanganhika, vija vinilondigwa kwing'higwa sama ya kuvumbuka wa ichanduso novitendela choni?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33"/>Yakobo kamulongela, “Tanhu niduilile kamba konigwelela vija viulondigwa kwing'higwa sama ya kuvumbuka wa ichanduso.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:33">Esau kaiduila na kumgwelela Yakobo vija voyolondigwa kwing'higwa sama ya kuvumbuka wa ichanduso. <verse eid="GEN 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34"/>Yakobo kamgwelela Esau mkate na dengu, kaja na kung'wa, abaho kenuka kasegela. Vino vivo Esau viyazabuze vija viyalondigwe kwing'higwa sama ya kuvumbuka wa ichanduso.<verse eid="GEN 25:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Isaka ako Gelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1"/>Abaho kulawilila nzala iyagwe muisi ija, mbali na ija ikalile kipigiti cha Ablaham. Na Isaka kachola ha Abimeleki mndewa wa Wafilisti ako Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2"/>MNDEWA kamulawilila Isaka na kamulongela, “Sambiuchole Misili, kala muisi yondanikulongele. <verse eid="GEN 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3"/>Kala hano kamba muhenza, nie nowa hamoja na gweye na kukumoteza. Isi zino nokugwelela gweye na lukolo lwako. Nokigoga kilagano kiniilagane na tataako Ablaham. <verse eid="GEN 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4"/>Kweli nokumoteza na kulutenda lukolo lwako longezeke luwe kamba nhondo za kuulanga. Na isi zino zose nolugwelela lukolo lwako. Na kubitila lukolo lwako ndewa zose za ulumwengu zomotezwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5"/>Nokumoteza kwavija Ablaham kanitegeleza nie na kugagoga malagizo gangu gose na kuzigoga ndagizi zangu zose.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6"/>Avo Isaka kakala ako Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7"/>Wambigalo wa isi ija viwamuuzile mbuli za mtwanzi wake, heyo kalonga, “Ino lumbu jangu.” Kwavija kadumba kulonga “Ino mtwanzi wangu,” kwavija kagiza kamba wanhu wa isi ija womkoma na kumsola Lebeka, kwavija Lebeka kakala yanogile ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8"/>Isaka viyakalile kuja mkipigiti kitali, Abimeleki mndewa wa Wafilisti kasungulila hasi hadizonzo, kamona Isaka yomkumbatila Lebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9"/>Abimeleki kamgalila usenga Isaka na kulonga, “Kweli ino mtwanzi wako, habali kulonga ino lumbu jako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isaka kamwidika kalonga, “Kwavija nigelegeza kamba nihadanganhike kamba nihalongile ino mtwanzi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10"/>Abimeleki kalonga, “Mbuli yaki ino yuututendele? Munhu imwe yahawasile na mtwanzi wako, na gweye uhatubakile tweye tose kilozo kino.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11"/>Avo Abimeleki kawazuma wanhu wose, yolonga, “Munhu yoyose yondayamtendele gehile munhu ino ama mtwanzi wake, kokomigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12"/>Isaka kahanda mbeyu muisi ija, na mulao uja kahuna mianza mia ya mbeyu zayahandile, kwavija MNDEWA kammoteza. <verse eid="GEN 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13"/>Isaka kawa mgoli, na ugoli wake ugendelela kukula, na kawa mgoli mkulu ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14"/>Kakala na madale bwando ga ng'hondolo na ng'ombe, kakala na watumigwa bwando, avo Wafilisti wamonela migongo. <verse eid="GEN 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15"/>Avo Wafilisti wagasila gamasima gose gawahimbile watumigwa wa Ablaham tataake Isaka, kipigiti viyakalile mgima.<verse eid="GEN 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16"/>Abimeleki kamulongela Isaka, “Uhalawe muisi yetu, kwavija gweye sambi kuna mhiko kubanza tweye.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17"/>Avo Isaka kasegela hiko, na kwika ng'hambi Mdibonde da Gelali, na kakala hiko. <verse eid="GEN 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18"/>Isaka kagahimbula kabili gaja igamasima ga mazi gakalile gahimbigwe mkipigiti cha tataake Ablahamu, kwavija Wafilisti wakala wagasile Ablahamu viyeshile kudanganhika, na kagagwelela matwaga gagaja gayagagwelele tataake.<verse eid="GEN 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19"/>Watumigwa wa Isaka wahimba sima mdibonde na wapata mazi gaholile. <verse eid="GEN 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20"/>Wachunga ng'hondolo wa haja Gelali wagomba na wachunga ng'hondolo wa Isaka walonga, “Mazi gano getu tweye.” Avo Isaka kadikema sima dija twaga dikemigwa “Ezeki.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ezeki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngomba.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21"/>Abaho watumigwa wa Isaka wahimba sima da ikabili, na dino vivija wadigombela, Isaka kadikema twaga jake “Sitna.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:21</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sitna </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngomba.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22"/>Abaho Isaka kachola hanhu hayagwe na kuhimba sima da ikadatu. Sima dino dikala bule ngomba, avo kadigwaa twaga dikemigwa “Lehoboti.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Lehoboti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gati.</char></note> Isaka kalonga, “MNDEWA sambi katugwelela ulegeho wa kukala muisi ino, na tweye tokongezeka.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23"/>Kulawa haja Isaka kachola Beeli-Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24"/>Ikilo iija MNDEWA kamulawila Isaka na kumulongela, “Nie iyo Mulungu wa tataako Ablaham. Sambiudumbe, kwavija nie na hamoja na gweye. Nokumoteza na kulutenda lukolo lwako longezeke, sama ya Ablaham mtumigwa wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25"/>Avo Isaka kazenga kilingo cha kulavila nhosa na kamtambikila MNDEWA haja. Kaiwamba hema yake, na watumigwa wake wahimba sima diyagwe.<verse eid="GEN 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilagano cha Isaka na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26"/>Zua dimwe Mndewa Abimeleki kulawa Gelali hamoja na Ahuzati mulonga masala wake na Fikoli, mkulu wa asikali zake, wamcholela Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27"/>Avo Isaka kawauza, “Habali mwiza hano hamwangu kuno mnihila nie, na kumwenu mniwinga?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28"/>Wamwidika walonga, “Tona kamba MNDEWA ka hamoja na gweye, avo togelegeza twike kiduilo na gweye. Tutende lagano na gweye, <verse eid="GEN 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29"/>giladi sambiututende tweye gehile, kamba tweye vitulekile kukutendela gehile. Hatukutendile kinhu kihile. Ila tukutendela ganogile. Nakukuleka uchole mmulegeho, lola sambi MNDEWA viyakumoteze.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30"/>Avo Isaka kawatendela lusona, na hewo waja na kung'wa hamoja. <verse eid="GEN 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31"/>Imitondo ng'hani zua da ikabili waiduilila. Abaho Isaka kawaleka wachole, na hewo wamuleka mmulegeho.<verse eid="GEN 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32"/>Zua didija watumigwa wa Isaka weza na kumulongela mbuli za sima diwahimbile, walonga, “Tupata mazi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33"/>Avo Isaka kadikema sima dija “Shiba.” Vino vivo wambo da Beeli-Sheba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Beeli-Sheba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sima da kiduilo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ama </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sima da saba, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kwavija Ablaham kaiduila kumgwelela Abimeleki ng'hondolo saba. Simulizi ino yolawa mkitabu cha Mwanduso 21:31. </char></note> vidipatile twaga jake.<verse eid="GEN 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau Kosola Watwanzi Wakihenza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34"/>Esau viyavikize milao malongo mane, kasola watwanzi wabili Wahiti, Yudisi mwanage Beeli, na Basemati mwanage Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35"/>Ila watwanzi wano wa Esau waitenda mioyo ya Isaka na Lebeka kuwa na giogio.<verse eid="GEN 26:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Isaka Kommoteza Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1"/>Isaka viyakalile m'vyele na meso gake vigasongile kuvulala, kamkema Esau, mwanage mkulu, kamulongela, “Mwanangu.” Na heyo kedika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">“Ona, tata.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2"/>Isaka kalonga, “Lola, nie na m'vyele, na zua jangu da kudanganhika siditanga. <verse eid="GEN 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3"/>Avo sola via vako va kusakila, mhinde zako na misale yako, genda kumuhulo ukanisakile mng'onyo. <verse eid="GEN 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4"/>Abaho unitelekele mandia galimwilile gaja ganilondaga, na ungalile. Nihesha kuja, nikumoteze ning'hali sinadanganhika.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5"/>Kipigiti Isaka viyakalile yomulongela Esau, Lebeka kakala yotegeleza. Avo Esau viyacholile kumuhulo kusaka, <verse eid="GEN 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6"/>Lebeka kamulongela Yakobo mwanage, “Tegeleza, nimuhulika tataako yomulongela Esau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7"/>‘Nigalile mng'onyo unitelekele. Nihesha kuja nikumoteze haulongozi wa MNDEWA ning'hali sinadanganhika.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8"/>Avo mwanangu, nitegeleze, tenda kija kinikulongela. <verse eid="GEN 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9"/>Genda mdidale da menhe ungalile wana menhe wabili wanonile, avo nomtendela tataako mandia galimwilile ng'hani gaja goyolondaga. <verse eid="GEN 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10"/>Abaho umgalile tataako yaje, giladi yakumoteze yang'hali hanadanganhika.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11"/>Avo Yakobo kamulongela Lebeka mamaake, “Lola, mkulu wangu Esau lukuli lwake luna mvili, na lukuli lwangu lwabule mvili. <verse eid="GEN 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12"/>Kamba tataangu yahanikwasa na kuvitanga kamba nom'vwizila, choni chondakilawilile? Nokona noigalila mwenyego ndukumiza na sio motelo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13"/>Mamaake kamulongela, “Mwanangu, leka ndukumiza imhate nie. Tenda vinikulongela, genda ungalile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14"/>Avo Yakobo kachola, kasola iwana menhe wabili kamgalila mamaake, na mamaake kateleka mandia galimwilile kamba viyolondaga tataake. <verse eid="GEN 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15"/>Abaho Lebeka kasola vivalo vinogile va Esau, mwanage mkulu, vivalo viyakalile navo mng'anda, na kam'vaza Yakobo, mwanage mdodo. <verse eid="GEN 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16"/>Vivija Lebeka kamfunga Yakobo mikwembe ya menhe mmakono gake na hanhu halibule mvili msingo yake. <verse eid="GEN 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17"/>Abaho kamgwelela mandia galimwilile, hamoja na mkate yautendile.<verse eid="GEN 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18"/>Avo Yakobo kamcholela tataake na kumulongela, “Tataangu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Na heyo kamwidika, “Ona nie hano. Gweye iyo mwanangu yalihi?”<verse eid="GEN 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19"/>Yakobo kamulongela, “Nie iyo mwanago mkulu Esau, nitenda kamba vuundagize. Avo gandamuka ukale uje mandia ganikugalile, abaho unimoteze.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20"/>Ila Isaka kamulongela mwanage, “Mwanangu, vilihi kupata himahima vino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobo kalonga, “Kwavija MNDEWA Mulungu wako iyo yanhazile kupata himahima.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21"/>Avo Isaka kamulongela Yakobo, “Kwenhuka behi nikubabase mwanangu, nivitange kamba kweli iyo mwanangu Esau ama sio.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22"/>Yakobo kamkwenhukila tataake Isaka, Isaka kam'babasa na kalonga, “Dizwi da Yakobo, ila makono ga Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23"/>Hamtangile kamba kakala Yakobo, kwavija makono gake gakala na mvili kamba za Esau. Avo Isaka kammoteza Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24"/>Isaka kamuuza kabili, “Gweye iyo kweli mwanangu Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Kamwidika “Ona.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25"/>Avo Isaka kalonga, “Mwanangu, nigalile nyama yuupatile. Nihesha kuja, nikumoteze.” Avo Yakobo kamgalila tataake mandia, na heyo kaja. Vivija kamgalila divai kaing'wa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26"/>Abaho Isaka kamulongela Yakobo, “Kwenhuka behi uninonele,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wayahudi wakala na nzowela ya kuwanonela wanao hata kamba wakala wakulu.</char></note> mwanangu.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27"/>Avo kamkwenhukila na kumnonela, Isaka viyahulike mnung'ho wa vivalo vake, kammoteza, na kulonga, “Mnung'ho wa mwanangu ulinga kamba mnung'ho wa mgunda yaaumoteze MNDEWA. <verse eid="GEN 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28"/>Mulungu yakugwelele tungwe kulawa kuulanga na ugoli wose wa isi, Mulungu yakugwelele vakuja bwando na divai bwando. <verse eid="GEN 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29"/>Ndewa zose ziwe watumigwa zako, na wanhu wa namna zose wainamile haulongozi wako. Uwe mtawala wa ndugu zako wose, na ndugu zako wainamile haulongozi wako. Munhu yondayakudukumize yadukumizwe heyo, na yondayakumoteze yamotezwe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau Kopula Motelo za Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30"/>Isaka viyeshile kummoteza Yakobo, na Yakobo viyakalile yolawa haulongozi wa tataake, Esau kabwela kulawa kusaka. <verse eid="GEN 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31"/>Na heyo vivija kasasala mandia galimwilile na kumgalila tataake. Abaho kalonga, “Tataangu, gandamuka ukale uje mandia ganikugalile, giladi unimoteze.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32"/>Tataake kamuuza, “Gweye iyo yalihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Esau kalonga “Nie iyo mwanago imkulu, Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33"/>Isaka kagudema ng'hani, na kalonga, “Ija iyo yalihi yangalile mandia nie? Na nie nija nisha kipigiti gweye hunakwiza. Nimgwelela heyo motelo, na kweli kamotezwa.” <verse eid="GEN 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34"/>Esau viyazihulike mbuli za tataake, kalila mdizwi kulu kuno yamemile usungu, na kumulongela tataake, “Nimoteze na nie, tataangu!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35"/>Ila Isaka kalonga, “Mdodo wako katenda uzenzeleganye na kasola motelo zako.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36"/>Esau kalonga, “Kanibulunya mianza mibili ino. Kileka mana twaga jake dikemigwa Yakobo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yakobo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">m'vwizi.</char></note> Kasola hanhu hangu ha kuvumbuka wa ichanduso, na sambi kasola motelo zangu?” Abaho kamuuza tataake, “Hunikile motelo yoyose?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37"/>Isaka kamulongela Esau, “Nimtenda Yakobo yawe mndewa wako, na nimgwelela ndugu zake kuwa watumigwa zake. Nimgwelela ngano na divai, nikugwelele choni, mwanangu?”<verse eid="GEN 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38"/>Esau kamulongela tataake, “Tata, kuna motelo imwe iiyeka? Nimoteze na nie, tata!” Abaho Esau kasonga kulila na dizwi kulu.<verse eid="GEN 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39"/>Abaho, tataake kamulongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“Lola, ukazi wako wowa kutali na ugoli wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">Kutali na tungwe dilawa kuulanga.<verse eid="GEN 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40"/>Kokala mkutamanila zele jako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Kowa mtumigwa wa mdodo wako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Uhamdulukila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Koisegeza kulawa muutawala wake.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41"/>Esau kamwihila Yakobo kwavija tataake kammoteza. Esau kasonga kugelegeza mmoyo wake, yolonga, “Kipigiti cha kumulilila tataangu kikwenhuka abaho nomkoma mdodo wangu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42"/>Lebeka viyalongeligwe gaja gayalongile mwanage mkulu Esau, katuma usenga ha mwanage mdodo Yakobo, yomulongela, “Mkulu wako Esau kouhoza moyo wake mkugelegeza kukukoma. <verse eid="GEN 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43"/>Avo mwanangu, tenda gano ganikulongela, hima kimbilila ha mjombaako Labani ako Halani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44"/>Kala kumwake mkipigiti kidodo, mbaka lusango lwa ndugu yako vondalumale, <verse eid="GEN 27:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45"/>na kaisemwa kija chuumtendile. Abaho nomtuma munhu yakubweze. Habali niwagize wanangu wose wabili mdizua dimwe?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isaka Komulongela Yakobo Yachole ha Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46"/>Lebeka kamulongela Isaka, nidonhezwa ng'hani na watwanzi wano Wahiti wa Esau. Kamba Yakobo yahasola mtwanzi imwe kulawa mwa watwanzi wa isi ino wa Kihiti kamba wano, vinoga nie nidanganhike.<verse eid="GEN 27:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1"/>Avo Isaka kamkema Yakobo, kammoteza, na kumulagiza, yolonga, “Sambiusole mtwanzi yoyose Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2"/>Hima genda Padani-Alamu, mng'anda ya Betueli tata wa mamaako, ukasole mtwanzi kulawa kwa wana wa Labani mjombaako. <verse eid="GEN 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3"/>Mulungu Mwene Mhiko yakumoteze giladi yakugwelele wana bwando. Lukolo lwako longezeke giladi uwe tata wa wanhu bwando. <verse eid="GEN 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4"/>Mulungu yakugwelele gweye na lukolo lwako motelo ziyagweleligwe Ablaham, giladi upate kuitawala isi yuukala sambi kamba muhenza, isi Mulungu iyamgwelele Ablaham.” <verse eid="GEN 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5"/>Abaho, Isaka kamtuma Yakobo yachole Padani-Alamu ha Labani mwanage Betueli Mwalamu, lumbu ja Lebeka, ayo yakalile mamaao Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau Kosola Mtwanzi Iyagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6"/>Esau kavitanga kamba Isaka kammoteza Yakobo na kamtuma yachole Padani-Alamu yakasole mtwanzi kuja. Na viyakalile yommoteza kamulagiza yolonga, “Sambiusole mtwanzi kulawa muisi ya Kanaani.” <verse eid="GEN 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7"/>Na vivija kavitanga kamba, Yakobo kawatogolela tataake na mamaake na kachola Padani-Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8"/>Avo Esau kavitanga kamba tataake Isaka hanogelwe na watwanzi wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9"/>Esau kachola ha Sumaili mwanage Ablaham, na kamsola Mahalati mwanage Sumaili, ayo yakalile lumbu ja Nebayoti, na kongeza hamoja na iwatwanzi iyakalile nao.<verse eid="GEN 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzozi ya Yakobo ako Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10"/>Yakobo kasegela Beeli-Sheba kachola Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11"/>Viivikile ichungulo kavika hanhu hanogile ha kwika ng'hambi na kuhumula, kwavija zua dikala diswile na kilo kingila. Kasola dibwe dimwe dikalile haja na kudika hasi ya ditwi jake na kawasa. <verse eid="GEN 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12"/>Kalota nzozi, kona ngwandala imile kulawa muisi mbaka kuulanga, na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wokwela na kuhumuluka mngwandala ija. <verse eid="GEN 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13"/>MNDEWA kema hamgwazo wake, na kulonga, “Nie iyo MNDEWA, Mulungu wa muhenga wako Ablaham, na Mulungu wa Isaka. Isi ino yuuiwasile, nokugwelela gweye na lukolo lwako. <verse eid="GEN 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14"/>Lukolo lwako lowa kamba timbwisi da isi, na mokwenela kulawa ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua na uswelo wa zua, kaskazi na kusi. Wanhu wose muisi womotezwa kubitila gweye na lukolo lwako. <verse eid="GEN 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15"/>Nie na hamoja na gweye na nokwimiliza kokose kondauchole, na nokubweza kabili muisi ino. Sikuleka mbaka vondanikitende kilagano kiniilagane na gweye.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16"/>Abaho, Yakobo kalamuka kulawa muutulo na kulonga, “Kweli MNDEWA ka hanhu hano, na nie nikala sivimanyile!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17"/>Yakobo kadumba na kulonga, “Hanhu hano hodumbiza ng'hani, hano baho hana ing'anda ya Mulungu, na luno lulo lwivi lwa kuulanga.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18"/>Imitondo ng'hani zua da ikabili Yakobo viyalamuke, kasola dibwe dikalile hasi ya ditwi jake, kadisimika kamba nguzo ya lukumbuso na uchana yake kadigidila mavuta ga mzaituni na kudibagula sama ya Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19"/>Hanhu haja kahakema Beteli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Beteli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ng'anda ya Mulungu.</char></note> ila twaga da wambo dija haichanduso dikala dikemigwa Luzi. <verse eid="GEN 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20"/>Abaho Yakobo katenda kiduilo, yolonga, “Kamba Mulungu uhawa hamoja na nie na kunimiliza nie mmwanza wangu, na kamba uhanigwelela mandia na vivalo, <verse eid="GEN 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21"/>na kamba nahabwela ukae ha tataangu nili na upile, avo kowa MNDEWA Mulungu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22"/>Na dibwe dino dinisimike kamba nguzo, dowa ng'anda ya Mulungu, na vinhu vose vondaunigwelele nie nokulavila gweye zaka.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Kovika Hakae ya Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1"/>Yakobo kagendelela na mwanza wake na kavika muisi ya wanhu wa ulawilo wa zua. <verse eid="GEN 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2"/>Hiko kona sima mumgunda, na madale madatu ga ng'hondolo gahumula hamgwazo wa idisima, kwavija madale gakala gong'wezigwa mazi kulawa mdisima dija. Na dibwe dikalile digubike idisima dija dikala kulu. <verse eid="GEN 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3"/>Ikala nzoela ya wachunga kuibeta mbaka kipigiti madale gose ga ng'hondolo vondagaiduganye, avo wachunga ng'hondolo wadibimbilisa idibwe kulawa hamulomo wa idisima, na kuwang'weza iwang'hondolo. Abaho wadibweza idibwe haja hadikalile hana umulomo wa idisima.<verse eid="GEN 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4"/>Yakobo kawauza iwachunga ng'hondolo, “Ndugu zangu, mweye molawa kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Wedika, “Tweye tolawa Halani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5"/>Kawauza, “Mumtanga Labani mzukulu wa Naholi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Wedika, “Tumtanga.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6"/>Yakobo kawauza, yolonga, “Mpile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Wedika, “Mpile.” Walonga, “Lola, mwanage ija haja kokwiza na dale jake da ng'hondolo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7"/>Yakobo kawalongela, “Loleni, zua hadinahonga, kipigiti cha ng'hondolo kuwasa hakinavika, wang'wezeni mazi iwang'hondolo na muwagale wakaje.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8"/>Avo hewo walonga, “Hatudaha kutenda avo, mbaka madale gose vondagaiduganye hamoja, na idibwe vondadibimbiliswe kulawa haumulomo wa idisima, abaho towang'weza mazi iwang'hondolo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9"/>Kipigiti Yakobo viyakalile yogendelela kuwalongela iwachunga, Laheli keza na ng'hondolo wa tataake, kwavija heyo kakala yowachunga. <verse eid="GEN 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10"/>Yakobo viyamonile Laheli mwanage Labani lumbu ja mamaake, na viyadiwene dale da ng'hondolo wa Labani, kachola kudibimbilisa idibwe kulawa haumulomo wa idisima, na kuwang'weza ng'hondolo wa mjombaake. <verse eid="GEN 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11"/>Abaho, Yakobo kamnonela Laheli, na kusonga kulila na dizwi kulu, <verse eid="GEN 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12"/>na kumpetela kamba, heyo kakala ndugu wa tataake, mwanage Lebeka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:12">Avo Laheli kakimbilila ukae kachola kumpetela tataake. <verse eid="GEN 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13"/>Labani viyahulike mbuli za Yakobo mwana wa lumbu jake, kamkimbilila kam'bokela, kamkumbatila na kumnonela, abaho wachola ukae yake. Yakobo kampetela Labani mbuli zose zimulawilile. <verse eid="GEN 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14"/>Abaho Labani kamulongela, “Kweli gweye nyama yangu na mulopa wangu.” Yakobo kakala na heyo mulenge umwe.<verse eid="GEN 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Komsang'hanikila Labani Sama ya Laheli na Lea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15"/>Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Kwavija gweye kwa ndugu yangu, havilumbile unisang'hanikile bule. Nongela choni chuulonda kiwe kitumetume chako.” <verse eid="GEN 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16"/>Labani kakala na wana wakitwanzi wabili, mkulu kokemigwa Lea na mdodo kokemigwa Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17"/>Lea kakala na meso gavulale, ila Laheli kakala yanogile mkiwiliwili na mkihanga.<verse eid="GEN 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18"/>Yakobo kanogelwa na Laheli, avo kamulongela Labani, “Nokusang'hanikila milao saba, sama ya kumsola mwanago mdodo Laheli.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19"/>Labani kamulongela, “Vinoga nikugwelele gweye umsole sio munhu iyagwe yoyose. Kala hano hamoja na nie.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20"/>Avo Yakobo kamsang'hanikila milao saba sama ya kumpata Laheli, Yakobo kachona kipigiti kija kiguhi kwavija viyanogelwe na Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21"/>Abaho Yakobo kamulongela Labani, “Nigwelele mtwanzi wangu, kipigiti changu kimala, na nolonda niwase nayo.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22"/>Avo Labani kawakema hamoja wanhu wose wa hanhu haja na kutenda lusona lwa zengele. <verse eid="GEN 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23"/>Viivikile ikilo, Labani kamsola Lea mwanage na kumgwelela Yakobo, na heyo kawasa nayo. <verse eid="GEN 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24"/>Labani kamulava Zilpa nyakadala wake yamsang'hanikile Lea. <verse eid="GEN 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25"/>Viivikile imitondo, kumbe kakala Lea! Avo Yakobo kamulongela Labani, “Choni kino kiunitendele?” Yakobo kamuuza Labani. “Nikusang'hanikila milao saba sama ya Laheli. Habali univwizile?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26"/>Labani kamulongela, “Ino sio nzoela yetu muisi yetu, yalongole kusoligwa mdodo abaho mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27"/>Mambukiza mazua gano saba ga lusona lwa zengele lwa ino imkulu, abaho nokugwelela Laheli kamba uhanisang'hanikila milao saba iyagwe.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28"/>Yakobo katogola, kamambukiza mazua saba ga Lea, abaho Labani kamgwelela Laheli yawe mtwanzi wake. <verse eid="GEN 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29"/>Labani kamulava Bilha nyakadala wake yamsang'hanikile Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30"/>Avo vivija Yakobo kawasa na Laheli, na kamnogela ng'hani Laheli kubanza Lea. Yakobo kamsang'hanikila Labani milao saba iyagwe.<verse eid="GEN 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31"/>MNDEWA viyawene kamba Lea hanogeligwe ng'hani, kamfungula inda yake kamgwelela wana, ila Laheli kakala bule sambo. <verse eid="GEN 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32"/>Lea kapata inda na kamulela mwana mbigalo, kamgwaa twaga dikemigwa Lubeni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Lubeni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mndewa kawona mgayo wangu.</char></note> kwavija kalonga, “MNDEWA kawona mgayo wangu. Kweli mbigalo wangu sambi konogelwa na nie.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33"/>Lea kapata inda kabili na kamulela mwana mbigalo, kamgwaa twaga dikemigwa Simioni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Simioni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tegeleza.</char></note> kwavija kalonga, “MNDEWA kahulika kamba nie sinogelwe, avo kanigwelela mwana iyagwe.” <verse eid="GEN 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34"/>Lea kapata inda iyagwe na kumulela mwana mbigalo, kamgwaa twaga dikemigwa Lawi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Lawi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mwandakana.</char></note> kwavija kalonga, “Sambi mbigalo wangu kowa behi ng'hani na nie, kwavija nimulelela wana mbigalo wadatu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35"/>Lea kapata inda iyagwe na kumulela mwana mbigalo, kamgwaa twaga dikemigwa Yuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yuda </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nhogolwa.</char></note> kwavija kalonga, “Mwanza uno nomuyenzi MNDEWA.” Abaho Lea kema kulela.<verse eid="GEN 29:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1"/>Laheli viyonile kamba hanamulelela wana Yakobo, kamonela migongo lumbu jake, na kumulongela Yakobo. “Nigwelele wana, kamba si hivo, nodanganhika!”<verse eid="GEN 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2"/>Yakobo kamonela lusango Laheli, kamulongela, “Nie iyo Mulungu, yakutendile gweye uwebule wana?”<verse eid="GEN 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3"/>Laheli kamulongela, “Msole nyakadala wangu Bilha, uwase nayo yanilelele wana. Kubitila heyo na nie vivija nowa mama.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4"/>Avo Laheli kamgwelela Yakobo Bilha nyakadala wake yawe mtwanzi wake, na heyo kawasa nayo. <verse eid="GEN 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5"/>Na Bilha kapata inda na kumulelela Yakobo mwana mbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6"/>Abaho Laheli kalonga, “Mulungu kalamula na kunyonela nie bazi, kazihulika nhambiko zangu na kunigwelela nie mwana mbigalo.” Avo kamkema twaga jake Dani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kalamula.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7"/>Bilha nyakadala wa Laheli kapata inda kabili na kamulelela Yakobo mwana mbigalo wa ikabili. <verse eid="GEN 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8"/>Abaho Laheli kalonga, “Nigomba ng'hani na lumbu jangu, mbaka nihuma.” Avo kamgwaa twaga dikemigwa Naftali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Naftali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kugomba.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9"/>Lea viyonile kamba kema kulela, kamsola Zilpa nyakadala wake na kumgwelela Yakobo yawe mtwanzi wake. <verse eid="GEN 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10"/>Zilpa nyakadala wa Lea kamulelela Yakobo mwana mbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11"/>Abaho, Lea kalonga, “Mhata mhome.” Avo kamkema twaga jake Gadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Gadi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mhome </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ama </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngekewa.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12"/>Zilpa nyakadala wa Lea kamulelela Yakobo mwana mbigalo wa ikabili. <verse eid="GEN 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13"/>Lea kalonga, “Nodeng'ha ng'hani, watwanzi wong'hema nie ndeng'ha.” Avo kamkema twaga jake Asheli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Asheli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">deng'ho.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14"/>Kipigiti cha kuhuna ngano, Lubeni kachola kumgunda na kubawa dudai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dudai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iyo dawa ya kumtenda mtwanzi kupata inda. </char></note> kamgalila mamaake Lea. Laheli kamulongela Lea, “Ngwelela dudai kidogo za mwanago.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15"/>Ila Lea kamulongela, “Kokwagiza mbuli ndodo kunisolela mbigalo wangu? Sambi kolonda kusola dudai za mwanangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Laheli kalonga, “Kamba uhanigwelela dudai za mwanago, ikilo ya lelo Yakobo kowasa na gweye.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16"/>Avo ichungulo ija Yakobo viyabwelile kulawa kumgunda, Lea kalawa kachola kum'bokela abaho kamulongela, “Kolondigwa wize kuwasa na nie ikilo ya lelo, kwavija nikulihila dudai za mwanangu.” Avo ikilo ija kawasa na Lea.<verse eid="GEN 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17"/>Mulungu kahulika nhambiko ya Lea, na Lea kapata inda na kamulelela Yakobo mwana mbigalo wa tano. <verse eid="GEN 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18"/>Lea kalonga, “Mulungu kanigwelela nhunza kwavija nimgwelela mbigalo wangu nyakadala wangu.” Avo Lea kamgwelela imwana twaga dikemigwa Isakali.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Isakali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nhunza.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19"/>Lea kapata inda kabili na kamulelela Yakobo mwana mbigalo wa sita. <verse eid="GEN 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20"/>Abaho Lea kalonga, “Mulungu kanigwelela nhunza inogile. Sambi mbigalo wangu konihishimila, kwavija nimulelela mwana mbigalo wa sita.” Avo kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Zabuloni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zabuloni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hishima.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21"/>Abaho kamulela mwana mtwanzi, na kamkema twaga jake Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22"/>Abaho Mulungu kamgelegeza Laheli, kazihulika nhambiko zake na kuifungula inda yake. <verse eid="GEN 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23"/>Laheli kapata inda na kalela mwana mbigalo, na kulonga, “Mulungu kanisegezela kinyala changu.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24"/>Kamgwelela twaga dikemigwa Usufu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Usufu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kodaha kongeza.</char></note> na kulonga, “MNDEWA kanigwelela mwana iyagwe mbigalo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo na Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25"/>Laheli viyamulelile Usufu, Yakobo kamulongela Labani, “Nileke nibwele ukae muisi yangu mwenyego. <verse eid="GEN 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26"/>Nigwelele watwanzi zangu na wanangu iniwapatile mkukusang'hanikila, nichole nao, kuvitanga vinikusang'hanikile ng'hani.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27"/>Labani kamulongela, “Nitegeleze, nie nilagula na kuvitanga kamba MNDEWA kanimoteza nie sama yako gweye. <verse eid="GEN 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28"/>Longa kitumetume chako nikulihe.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29"/>Yakobo kalonga, “Gweye mwenyego kuvitanga vija vinikusang'hanikile, na vija madale gako vugakalile hasi yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30"/>Kukala na mali kidogo kipigiti sinakwiza, ila sambi mali gako gongezeka ng'hani. MNDEWA kakumoteza gweye kubitila vinhu vose vinitendile nie. Ila sambi kicho kipigiti changu cha kutenda mbuli zangu mwenyego.”<verse eid="GEN 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31"/>Labani kamuuza, “Nikugwelele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Yakobo kalonga, “Sambiunigwelele kinhu chochose, ila kamba uhanitendela nie mbuli ino, nogendelela kukuchungila madale ga ng'hondolo zako. <verse eid="GEN 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32"/>Lelo leka nibite mmadale gako na kusegeza wana ng'hondolo wali na midewa ama minyela, wana menhe wali na midewa ama minyela, na wana ng'hondolo wose watitu. Unigwelele nie kamba kitumetume changu. <verse eid="GEN 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33"/>Mazua ga hamwande kovitanga kamba nie nabule uzenzeleganye, ahaja vondawize kulola kitumetume changu chuunilihile. Kamba uhavika menhe yalibule minyela ama midewa ama kamba hana ng'hondolo yalibule utitu mdidale jangu basi hiyo kebigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34"/>Labani kalonga, “Vinoga, na iwe kamba vuulongile.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35"/>Avo zua didija Labani kawasegeza waja iwamenhe songolomi na mabogwa wali na minyela na midewa, na wose wali na uzelu na wana ng'hondolo wose wali watitu, na kuwagwelela wanage. <verse eid="GEN 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36"/>Labani kachola mwanza wa mazua madatu kulawa hayakalile Yakobo, kipigiti Yakobo viyakalile yogendelela kuchunga ng'hondolo wa Labani wasigale.<verse eid="GEN 30:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37"/>Abaho Yakobo kasola mango mbisi kulawa mmibiki ya mulubuna, mulozi, na mwalamoni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mibiki ino ina uzelu mgati yake na udung'hu kunze.</char></note> kaziyua na kutenda mindandu mzimango zija mkuziyua vigome vake na katenda uzelu ukalile mgati ya izimango woneke. <verse eid="GEN 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38"/>Abaho kazisimika zija zimango ziyaziyuile kila hanhu ha kung'wela mazi ng'hondolo na menhe, giladi zoneke dimwe kwa dimwe haulongozi wa iwang'hondolo waheza kung'wa mazi, kipigiti ng'hondolo wahawa mkipigiti cha kukweligwa. <verse eid="GEN 30:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39"/>Na viwaikwelile haulongozi wa zija izimango, walela wana wali na minhongo mizelu, minyela, na midewa.<verse eid="GEN 30:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40"/>Yakobo kawabagula waja iwana ng'hondolo kulawa mdidale da Labani, ila mkipigiti cha kukweligwa kawatenda ng'hondolo wasigale wawalole ng'hondolo wa Labani awo wakalile watitu na wali na minhongo. Vino vivo Yakobo viyatendile dale jake jongezeke.<verse eid="GEN 30:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41"/>Kipigiti wang'onyo walibule nyondenyonde viwavikile kipigiti cha kukweligwa, Yakobo kazika zija zimango kila hanhu ha kung'wela mazi haulongozi wa iwang'onyo, giladi waikwele haulongozi wa izimango. <verse eid="GEN 30:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42"/>Ila kamba waja iwang'onyo wakala nyondenyonde, kazisegeza zija izimango haja. Avo wang'onyo wali nyondenyonde wakala wa Labani, na waja walibule nyondenyonde wakala wa Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43"/>Mkilamso kino Yakobo keza kuwa mgoli ng'hani. Kakala na madale makulu ga ng'hondolo, na menhe, nyakadala, ngamia, na mhunda.<verse eid="GEN 30:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Komkimbila Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1"/>Yakobo kawahulika walamu zake wana wa Labani wolonga, “Yakobo kasola vinhu vose vikalile va tataetu. Ugoli wake wose ulawa m'vinhu vayakalile navo tataetu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2"/>Yakobo kavitanga kamba Labani hanogelwe na heyo kamba viikalile haichanduso. <verse eid="GEN 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3"/>Abaho MNDEWA kamulongela Yakobo, “Bwela muisi ya wahenga zako na ndugu zako, nie nowa hamoja na gweye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4"/>Avo Yakobo katuma usenga kuwakema Laheli na Lea, weze kumgunda kuyakalile yochunga ng'hondolo zake. <verse eid="GEN 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5"/>Yakobo kawalongela, “Nokona kamba tataenu hanogelwa na nie kamba viikalile haichanduso, ila Mulungu wa tataangu ka hamoja na nie. <verse eid="GEN 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6"/>Movitanga kamba nimsang'hanikila tataenu na mhiko zangu zose. <verse eid="GEN 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7"/>Hata avo tataenu kanitendela uzenzeleganye mkugalula kitumetume changu mianza bwando. Ila Mulungu hamulekile yanhendele nie kinhu kihile. <verse eid="GEN 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8"/>Labani viyalongile, ‘Ng'hondolo wondawaleligwe wali na minyela wowa kitumetume chako,’ wose wasonga kulela wana wali na minyela. Na viyagalule na kulonga, ‘Wang'onyo wali na minhongo wowa kitumetume chako,’ ng'hondolo wose walela wana wali na minhongo. <verse eid="GEN 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9"/>Vino vivo Mulungu viyasolile wang'onyo wa tataenu na kunigwelela nie.<verse eid="GEN 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10"/>“Kipigiti cha wang'onyo kuikwela, nilota nyona songolomi wa menhe wakalile wokwela wose wakala na minhongo, minyela, na midewa. <verse eid="GEN 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11"/>Msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga kanikema nie muinzozi yolonga, ‘Yakobo,’ na nie nidika, ‘Nabaha.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12"/>Na heyo kanongela, ‘Lola songolomi wose wa menhe waja wokwela wana minhongo, minyela, na midewa. Nigatenda gano kwavija nyona vija Labani viyakutendele. <verse eid="GEN 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13"/>Nie iyo Mulungu nikulawilile kuja Beteli, hanhu haja haudigidile dibwe mavuta na haja haunitendele kiduilo. Avo segela hima muisi ino uchole muisi yako yuuleligwe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14"/>Laheli na Lea wamulongela Yakobo, “Tweye twabule kinhu ama uhazi wowose kulawa ha tataetu. <verse eid="GEN 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15"/>Avo katutenda tweye kamba wahenza. Katuguza na sambi kaja hela zose ziyatuguzile tweye. <verse eid="GEN 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16"/>Ugoli wose Mulungu uyam'bokile tataetu wetu tweye na wanetu. Avo sang'hana gaja Mulungu gondayakulongele.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17"/>Avo Yakobo kawakweleza watwanzi zake na wanage muna iwangamia, <verse eid="GEN 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18"/>na kugaswagiza madale gake gose galongole haulongozi wake hamoja na vinhu vose viyapatile Padani-Alamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:18 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Padani-Alamu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ya ako Kaskazi na Uswelo wa zua muisi ya Mesopotamia.</char></note> na kuchola ha tataake Isaka muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19"/>Kipigiti hicho Labani kakala yacholile kuwakanha mijusu ng'hondolo zake, avija viyakalile haduhu Laheli kapata nafasi ya kwiba vinyago avo vikalile miungu ya tataake. <verse eid="GEN 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20"/>Yakobo kam'vwizila Labani na hamulongele kamba kohalawa. <verse eid="GEN 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21"/>Yakobo kasola vinhu vake vose na kusegela hima. Kaloka Lwanda lwa Yuflati, kagalukila kuili isi ya Gileadi ili na vigongovigongo.<verse eid="GEN 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Labani Komkweleleza Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22"/>Mazua madatu vigabitile, Labani kalongeligwa kamba Yakobo kakimbila. <verse eid="GEN 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23"/>Avo Labani kawasola ndugu zake, wasonga kumkweleleza Yakobo kipigiti cha mazua saba, na wam'vika muisi ya vigongovigongo ya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24"/>Avo Mulungu kamulawilila Labani ikilo mnzozi na kumulongela, “Uteganye, sambiumulonge Yakobo mbuli yoyose ihile.” <verse eid="GEN 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25"/>Yakobo keka ng'hambi muisi ya vigongovigongo ya Gileadi, vivija Labani na ndugu zake weka ng'hambi yao behi na heyo.<verse eid="GEN 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26"/>Abaho Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Choni chuutendile? Kunivwizila na kusola wanangu kamba vija wagogigwe kung'hondo. <verse eid="GEN 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27"/>Habali usegele mkuifisa na kunivwizila? Habali hunongele giladi nikulage na ndeng'ha na nyila, na ngoma na bango? <figure style="fig" alt="harp" file="BK00176B.TIF" size="col" loc="31:27" copy="Horace Knowles, revised by Louise Bass © The British and Foreign Bible Society 1994." ref="31:27">Bango</figure> <verse eid="GEN 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28"/>Hata hunilekile niwanonela wanangu na wazukulu zangu na kuwalaga? Kweli kutenda ubozi. <verse eid="GEN 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29"/>Nodaha kukulumiza, ila Mulungu wa tataako kandawilila kilo ya lelo na kanongela, ‘Uteganye, sambiumulonge Yakobo mbuli yoyose ihile.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30"/>Novitanga kamba kosulukila kubwela mng'anda ya tataako, ila habali wibile miungu yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31"/>Yakobo kalonga, “Nidumba kwavija nigelegeza kamba uhanibokile wanago. <verse eid="GEN 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32"/>Ila kamba uham'vika munhu yoyose mmwanza wetu yali na miungu yako, nayadanganhike. Lolesa bahano haulongozi wa ndugu zetu, kamba nna kinhu chako chochose, kisole.” Yakobo havitangile kamba Laheli kakala yebile miungu ya Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33"/>Avo Labani kengila mdihema da Yakobo na kasonga kuzahila, abaho mdihema da Lea, na mdihema da waja nyakadala wabili wakitwanzi, ila hayonile miungu yake. Abaho kengila mdihema da Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34"/>Laheli kaisola ija imiungu na kuifisa mdisogi da kugwasikila mumgongo wa ngamia wake na kuikalila. Labani kazahila kila hanhu mdihema ila hayonile. <verse eid="GEN 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35"/>Laheli kamulongela tataake, “Tataangu, sambiunyonele lusango avija vinihila kwinuka haulongozi wako, kwavija notumika.” Avo Labani kazahila ila hayonile miungu yake.<verse eid="GEN 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36"/>Yakobo kehilwa ng'hani na kumuuza Labani, “Halihi hanihonyele? Choni kihile kinitendile kikutendile gweye unikoleleze?” <verse eid="GEN 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37"/>Kusakula m'vinhu vangu vose. Kinhu chaki chako kiupatile? Vike hano haulongozi wa wandugu zako na wandugu zangu, giladi watulamule. <verse eid="GEN 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38"/>Nikala hamoja na gweye milao malongo mabili sambi. Kipigiti chose ng'hondolo zako na menhe zako hawanatengula inda, na sinakuja songolomi wa ng'hondolo kulawa mdale jako. <verse eid="GEN 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39"/>Sikugalile ng'hondolo wako yakomigwe na wang'onyo wa kumuhulo. Hasala zose nizisola nie. Gweye kulonda nikulihe wang'onyo wose webigwe imisi ama ikilo.<verse eid="GEN 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40"/>Kipigiti kitali nigaya, imisi nilukuzwa na zua, na ikilo nibunhigwa na beho. Sipatile utulo. <verse eid="GEN 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41"/>Milao malongo mabili nikala mng'anda yako, nikusang'hanikila milao longo dimwe na mine sama ya Laheli na Lea, na milao sita sama ya madale ga wang'onyo. Kugalula kitumetume changu mianza longo dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42"/>Kamba Mulungu wa muhenga zangu, Mulungu wa Ablaham na Isaka, yahalekile kuwa hamoja na nie, uhaniwingile bila kinhu. Ila Mulungu kayona migayo yangu na sang'hano initendile, kileka mana kakukomhokela ikilo ibitile.<verse eid="GEN 31:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo na Labani Woikila Kilagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43"/>Labani kamwidika Yakobo na kumulongela, “Watwanzi wano wanangu nie, na wana zao wangu nie, wang'onyo wano wangu nie, na vose vuuvona vangu nie. Avo choni kinidaha kuwatendela wanangu, ama wana zao wawalelile? <verse eid="GEN 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44"/>Avo tutende lagano gweye na nie, diwe usindila wetu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45"/>Yakobo kasola dibwe, na kudisimika kamba nguzo giladi diwe lukumbuso. <verse eid="GEN 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46"/>Abaho Yakobo kawalongela wandugu zake, “Lundizeni mibwe.” Avo wadondola mabwe na kugalundiza kamba kisugulu. Abaho wakala hasi hamgwazo wa kija ikisugulu, waja mandia. <verse eid="GEN 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47"/>Labani kahakema hanhu haja Yegali-Sahadusa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yegali-Sahadusa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake muulonzi wa Kialamaiki </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lundi da usindila.</char></note> na Yakobo kahakema Galedi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Galedi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lundi da usindila.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48"/>Avo Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Kisugulu kino cha mibwe chowa usindila hagatigati yetu tweye.” Kino kicho kilamso cha hanhu haja kukemigwa Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49"/>Labani vivija kahakema hanhu haja Mizpa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:49</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mizpa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ulingo wa kwimilizila.</char></note> kwavija kalonga, “MNDEWA yatulole, giladi tudigoge lagano dino kipigiti gweye na nie tuhawa kutali na miage. <verse eid="GEN 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50"/>Kamba uhawagaza wanangu ama uhasola watwanzi wayagwe mbali na wanangu, hata kamba sivimanyile, ukumbukile kamba Mulungu kotulola.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51"/>Abaho Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Lola kisugulu kino cha mibwe, lola nguzo ino iniisimike hagatigati yako na yangu. <verse eid="GEN 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52"/>Kisugulu kino cha mibwe na nguzo ino zizo usindila, nie sikibanza kisugulu kino cha mibwe kwiza ng'ambu yako kukulumiza, na gweye sambiubanze kisugulu kino cha mibwe na nguzo ino wize ng'ambu yangu kunilumiza. <verse eid="GEN 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53"/>Mulungu wa Ablaham na mulungu wa Naholi wotulamula gweye na nie.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Avo Yakobo kaiduila mditwaga da Mulungu yakalile yotambikilwa na Isaka tataake kukigoga kilagano kija. <verse eid="GEN 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54"/>Abaho Yakobo kalava nhosa muisi ija ya vigongovigongo na kuwakema ndugu zake weze kuja mandia. Na viweshile kuja mandia wakala bahaja ikilo ngima. <verse eid="GEN 31:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55"/>Na imitondo ng'hani zua da ikabili Labani kawanonela wazukulu zake na wanage na kuwamoteza. Na abaho kabwela ukae yake.<verse eid="GEN 31:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Koisasala Kuiting'hana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1"/>Yakobo kagendelela na mwanza wake, na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga waiting'hana nayo. <verse eid="GEN 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2"/>Yakobo viyawawene kalonga, “Ino iyo ng'hambi ya asikali wa Mulungu.” Avo kahakema hanhu haja Mahanaimu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mahanaimu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ng'hambi mbili.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3"/>Avo Yakobo kawatuma wasenga wamulongole wachole ha Esau, mkulu wake, ako Seili muisi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4"/>Kawagwelela ndagizi, yolonga, “Mulongeleni mndewa wangu Esau mbuli zino, ‘Mtumigwa wako Yakobo kolonga, “Nikala na Labani na kusigala haja mbaka lelo. <verse eid="GEN 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5"/>Nna ng'ombe, mhunda, madale ga ng'hondolo na menhe, nyakadala wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo. Nokugalila usenga uno, mndewa wangu, mhate ngekewa haulongozi wako.” ’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6"/>Abaho waja iwasenga viwabwelile wamulongela Yakobo, “Tuchola ha mkulu wako Esau, na heyo kokwiza kukubokela yali hamoja na wambigalo mia nne.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7"/>Yakobo kadumba ng'hani na kudungwadungwa. Avo kawagola wanhu iyali nao, ng'hondolo, menhe, na ngamia mmadale mabili. <verse eid="GEN 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8"/>Yakobo kagelegeza, yolonga, “Kamba Esau yeheza na kudivamhila dale dimwe, dale diyagwe dosigala.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9"/>Abaho Yakobo katambika, yolonga, “Mulungu wa muhenga wangu Ablaham na Mulungu wa tataangu Isaka, MNDEWA, gweye unilongele nie nibwele muisi yangu na ha ndugu zangu, na kunongela konhendela ganogile. <verse eid="GEN 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10"/>Nie silumbile kutendeligwa unhu wose na kuwabule uzenzeleganye kuundagusile nie mtumigwa wako. Niloka Lwanda lwa Yolodani bila kinhu ila fimbo iiyeka na sambi nobwela na madale gano mabili. <verse eid="GEN 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11"/>Nokutambikila, nikombole kulawa mmakono ga mkulu wangu Esau, nodumba siku kokwiza kunivamhila nie na watwanzi zangu hamoja na wanangu. <verse eid="GEN 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12"/>Ila gweye kunongela kamba, konhendela ganogile mmbuli zangu zose, na kulongeza lukolo lwangu mbaka vondaluwe bwando kamba misenga ya mumgwazo wa ibahali vuileka kudahika kupetigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13"/>Ikilo ija Yakobo kawasa haja, na kasagula nhunza ya kumgwelela Esau mkulu wake kulawa m'vinhu vayakalile navo, <verse eid="GEN 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14"/>bogwa wa menhe mia mbili (200) na songolomi wa menhe malongo mabili (20), bogwa wa ng'hondolo mia mbili (200) na songolomi wa ng'hondolo malongo mabili (20), <verse eid="GEN 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15"/>ngamia malongo madatu (30) wokong'heza hamoja na wana zao, bogwa wa ng'ombe malongo mane (40) na songolomi longo dimwe (10), na bogwa wa mhunda malongo mabili (20) na songolomi longo dimwe (10). <verse eid="GEN 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16"/>Kawagola waja iwang'onyo mmadale na kila dale kamwika mtumigwa wake imwe kuwa kilangizi wa ididale. Abaho kawalongela waja iwatumigwa, “Longoleni na wano iwang'onyo ila ikeni nafasi kulawa dale dimwe mbaka dale diyagwe.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17"/>Kamulagiza ija yalongole, yolonga, “Uhaiting'hana na mkulu wangu Esau na yahakuuza, ‘Gweye kwa mtumigwa wa munhu yalihi? Kwahi kuuchola? Na wang'onyo wano walongole wa munhu yalihi?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18"/>Gweye mulongele, ‘Wang'onyo wano wa mtumigwa wako Yakobo, wano iwo nhunza iyomgalila mndewa wake Esau, na heyo ka kuchugu kokwiza.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19"/>Vivija kamulagiza imtumigwa wa ikabili na wa ikadatu na wose wakalile vilangizi wa igamadale. “Vino vivo vondammulongele Esau kipigiti vondamuiting'hane nayo. <verse eid="GEN 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20"/>Na mmulongele, ‘Mtumigwa wako Yakobo kokwiza kuchugu chetu.’ ” Yakobo kagelegeza, kalonga, “Nomuhoza na nhunza zino zinimulongozela, siku nahaiting'hana nayo, konibokela.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21"/>Yakobo kazilongoza izinhunza, na heyo mwenyego kasigala haja hang'hambi ikilo ija.<verse eid="GEN 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Koifida na Msenga wa Mulungu wa Kuulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22"/>Ikilo iija Yakobo kalamuka na kawasola watwanzi zake wabili, watwanzi zake wabili wa kunze, na wanage longo dimwe na imwe, abaho kaloka Lwanda lwa Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23"/>Viyeshile kuwalosa, kalosa na vinhu vose viyakalile navo. <verse eid="GEN 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24"/>Avo Yakobo kasigala yeiyeka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Abaho keza munhu, kasonga kuifida nayo mbaka imitondo. <verse eid="GEN 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25"/>Ija imunhu viyonile kolemelwa kumuhuma Yakobo, kamkwasa mdipengene viwakalile wokiifida, na idipengene disiguka. <verse eid="GEN 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26"/>Abaho ija imunhu kamulongela Yakobo, “Ndekesa nyhole, kwavija usiku ocha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Ila Yakobo kamulongela, “Sikulekesa mbaka vondaunimoteze.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27"/>Ija imunhu kamuuza, “Twaga jako dijo dilihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Kamwidika, “Twaga jangu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28"/>Abaho ija imunhu kamulongela, “Songela sambi hukemigwa kabili Yakobo, ila kokemigwa Islaeli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Islaeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kuifida na Mulungu.</char></note> kwavija kuifida na Mulungu hamoja na wanhu, na kuhuma.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29"/>Yakobo kamulongela, “Nongela twaga jako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Ila heyo kamuuza, “Habali uniuza twaga jangu?” Abaho kammoteza.<verse eid="GEN 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30"/>Avo Yakobo kahakema hanhu haja Penueli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:30</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Penueli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kihanga cha Mulungu.</char></note> kalonga, “Kwavija nimona Mulungu kihanga kwa kihanga, na ning'hali mgima.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31"/>Zua vidisongile kulawa, Yakobo kasegela Penueli kuno yodendegulila sama ya pengene jake. <verse eid="GEN 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32"/>Avo mbaka lelo, Waislaeli hawaja nyama ya pengene, kwavija pengene da Yakobo dikwasigwa behi na kigudi chake.<verse eid="GEN 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Koiting'hana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1"/>Yakobo kalola na kumona Esau yokwiza na wambigalo mia nne, avo kawagola wana wa Lea, wana wa Laheli, na wana wa waja watwanzi zake wabili wa kunze. <verse eid="GEN 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2"/>Kaweka haulongozi waja iwatwanzi zake wabili wa kunze hamoja na wana zao, abaho Lea na wanage, abaho Laheli na Usufu kuchugu chao. <verse eid="GEN 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3"/>Heyo mwenyego kalongola haulongozi wao, kafugama mavindi, kainamila mbaka hasi mianza saba mbaka viyavikile behi na mkulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4"/>Ila Esau kamkimbilila Yakobo, kamkumbatila na kumnonela. Abaho wose wabili walila. <verse eid="GEN 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5"/>Esau kawalola waja iwatwanzi na iwana, kauza, “Wano uulinao iwo wanhu walihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobo kedika, “Wano wao wana Mulungu iyanigwelele nie, mtumigwa wako.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6"/>Abaho waja iwatwanzi zake wa kunze na wana zao wawakwenhukila behi na wamfugamila mavindi na kumwinamila mbaka hasi. <verse eid="GEN 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7"/>Vivija weza Lea na wanage wamfugamila mavindi na kumwinamila mbaka hasi. Hakimambukizo, weza Usufu na Laheli, na hewo wamfugamila mavindi na kumwinamila mbaka hasi.<verse eid="GEN 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8"/>Esau kauza, “Madale gano ganiiting'hanile nago nhegulo yake choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo kamwidika, “Madale gano gago nhunza ha mndewa wangu giladi mhate ngekewa hameso gako.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9"/>Ila Esau kalonga, “Nna vinhu bwando, mdodo wangu, vino vuulinavo viwe vako mwenyego.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10"/>Yakobo kalonga, “Si vivo, kamba nitogoligwa hameso gako, bokela nhunza ino kulawa kumwangu. Kwavija kona kihanga chako kumwangu nie ilinga na kona kihanga cha Mulungu, avija viunibokele na noge. <verse eid="GEN 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11"/>Nokuyalalila, bokela nhunza ino inikugalile. Mulungu kanyonela bazi kangwelela kila kinhu kinilonda.” Vino vivo Yakobo viyamgong'ondeze Esau, na Esau katogola.<verse eid="GEN 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12"/>Abaho Esau kalonga, “Tuchole, nie nolongola haulongozi.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13"/>Ila Yakobo kamulongela, “Uvimanye, mndewa wangu, wana wano wang'hali wadodo na vivija nolondigwa niwaseseze ng'hondolo na ng'ombe awo wokong'heza. Kamba wahasosozigwa mdizua dimwe, wang'onyo wose wofa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14"/>Avo nokuyalalila, mndewa wangu, longola haulongozi wa mtumigwa wako, nie nokwiza mholemhole hamoja na iwang'onyo na iwana mbaka vondatuvike Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15"/>Esau kalonga, “Beta nikulekele wanhu zangu kidogo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Yakobo kamulongela, “Sambiutende hivo, mndewa wangu, kinilonda nie mhate ngekewa hameso gako.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16"/>Avo zua didija Esau kafunga mwanza wa kubwela Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17"/>Ila Yakobo kachola Sukuti ako kuyazengile ng'anda yake na banda da wang'onyo zake. Kino kicho kilamso hanhu haja hakemigwa Sukuti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sukuti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">banda da wang'onyo wa kufuga kamba ng'ombe na menhe.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18"/>Yakobo kasegela Padani-Alamu, na kuvika na upile mdiwambo da Shekemu muiisi ya Kanaani, na keka ng'hambi yake behi na idiwambo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19"/>Hanhu kuyekile ng'hambi kahagula kulawa ha wana wa Hamoli, tataake Shekemu, kwa vidanga mia va feza. <verse eid="GEN 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20"/>Haja kazenga kilingo cha kulavila nhosa na kukikema Mulungu iyo Mulungu wa Islaeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Dina Kobakigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1"/>Zua dimwe Dina, mwana wa Yakobo iyalelile na Lea, kachola kuwatembelela watwanzi Wakikanaani. <verse eid="GEN 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2"/>Ila Shekemu, yakalile mwana wa mkulu wa isi yakalile yokemigwa Hamoli Muhivi, viyamuwene Dina, kamkwida na kumuwasa kwa shuluti. <verse eid="GEN 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3"/>Moyo wa Shekemu unogelwa na Dina mndele wa Yakobo, na kamnogela ija imndele, na kalonga nayo mbuli zinogile. <verse eid="GEN 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4"/>Shekemu kamulongela Hamoli tataake, yolonga, “Nigwelele mndele ino yawe mtwanzi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5"/>Yakobo viyahulike kamba Dina mndele wake katendeligwa mbuli zigela kinyala, wanage wakala kumgunda wochunga, avo kanyamala mbaka viwabwelile. <verse eid="GEN 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6"/>Na Hamoli tataake Shekemu kachola ha Yakobo giladi walongelele. <verse eid="GEN 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7"/>Wana wa Yakobo viwakalile wobwela kulawa kuchunga, wahulika gaja galawilile, wehilwa ng'hani na wona lusango, kwavija Shekemu kakala yatendile kinhu kihile ha Waislaeli kumuwasa kwa shuluti mndele wa Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8"/>Ila Hamoli kawalongela Yakobo na wanage, “Mwanangu Shekemu kanogelwa ng'hani na mndele wenu, avo nowayalalila mmuleke yamsole mndele wenu. <verse eid="GEN 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9"/>Natuisole. Tugweleleni wandele zenu, na mweye wasoleni wandele zetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10"/>Avo mkale hano muisi yetu hamoja na tweye, mkale hanhu hohose hamulonda, tendeni uchuluzi mkuilegeha, na muwe na hanhu henu wenyego.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11"/>Abaho Shekemu kamulongela tataake Dina na ndugu zake, “Munitogolele, na nowagweleleni chochose chumulonda. <verse eid="GEN 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12"/>Mnongele nhunza yaki yumulonda, na maliho gogose ga zengele gomulonda, nowagwelela kiasi chochose chumulonda, kamba muhanitogoza nie nimsole.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13"/>Avo wanage Yakobo wamulongela Shekemu na Hamoli tataake mkuwavwizila, kwavija Shekemu kamtendela mbuli zigela kinyala lumbu jao Dina. <verse eid="GEN 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14"/>Wawalongela, “Hatudaha kutenda kinhu kino, kumgwelela lumbu jetu munhu hanakwingila kumbi, kumwetu tweye yowa kinyala. <verse eid="GEN 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15"/>Todaha kutogola kamba muhatenda kinhu kino, kamba kila mbigalo mmwanza wenu yehengizigwa kumbi kamba vituli tweye. <verse eid="GEN 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16"/>Abaho tweye towagwelela wandele zetu na tweye towasola wandele zenu, na tweye tokala hamoja na mweye na kugaluka wanhu wamwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17"/>Ila kamba hamtutogolela mweye kwingila kumbi, tomsola lumbu jetu, tochola nayo.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18"/>Mbuli zija ziwanogela Hamoli na Shekemu mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19"/>Mmhale ija ayo yakalile yohishimilwa ng'hani kubanza wose mng'anda ya tataake, kalopola kugatenda gaja gawalongile kwavija kanogelwa na mndele wa Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20"/>Avo Hamoli na mwanage Shekemu wachola ha ulwivi lwa idiwambo jao na kulonga na vilangizi wa idiwambo. <verse eid="GEN 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21"/>Walonga, “Wanhu wano wanoga, na tuwaleke wakale muisi yetu, na kutenda uchuluzi, isi ino ina hanhu bwando hakukala hewo. Tuwasole wandele zao na wasole wandele zetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22"/>Ila wanhu wano wotogola kukala hamoja na tweye, na kuwa hamoja na tweye, kamba tuhatogola wambigalo zetu wengizigwe kumbi kamba viwali hewo. <verse eid="GEN 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23"/>Kamba twahatenda vino, wang'onyo zao na vinhu vose viwalinavo vowa vetu. Na tuwatogolele mbuli zao, tuwaleke wakale hamoja na tweye.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24"/>Wambigalo wose waiting'hane hana ulwivi lwa idiwambo waitogolela na Hamoli na Shekemu mwanage, na kila mbigalo muja mdiwambo kengizigwa kumbi.<verse eid="GEN 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25"/>Mazua madatu vigabitile, waja wengizigwe kumbi viwakalile wang'hali na usungu, wana wabili wa Yakobo, Simioni na Lawi lumbu zake Dina, wasola mizele yao, wadivamhila idiwambo mkwidukiza na kuwakoma wambigalo wose, <verse eid="GEN 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26"/>wawakoma Hamoli na Shekemu mwanage na zele, wamsola Dina lumbu jao kulawa mng'anda ya Shekemu, wachola nayo. <verse eid="GEN 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27"/>Viweshile kuwakoma, wana wayagwe wa Yakobo wengila mdiwambo na kusamha kila kinhu, kwavija lumbu jao kakala yatendeligwe mbuli zigela kinyala. <verse eid="GEN 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28"/>Wasola ng'hondolo, ng'ombe, mhunda, na kila kinhu kikalile mdiwambo dija na mmigunda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29"/>Wasola mali gao gose, watwanzi zao wose, na wana zao, na wasola kila kinhu kikalile mng'anda zao.<verse eid="GEN 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30"/>Yakobo kawalongela Simioni na Lawi, “Mungalila mbuli, munitenda nie nihilwe na Wakanaani na Wapelizi na kila munhu yokala muisi ino. Nie nabule wanhu bwando, na kamba wahaiduganya hamoja na kunivamhila nie na wanhu wa ng'anda yangu, tobanangigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31"/>Wamwidika na lusango wolonga, “Habali tumuleke heyo yamtende lumbu jetu kamba mtenda ugoni ndwanga?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Kommoteza Yakobo ako Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1"/>Mulungu kamulongela Yakobo, “Genda Beteli na ukakale hiko, na ukanizengele nie kilingo cha kulavila nhosa, nie iyo Mulungu nikulawilile gweye kipigiti vuukalile umkimbila mkulu wako Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2"/>Avo Yakobo kawalongela wanhu wa mulango wake na wanhu wose wakalile hamoja na heyo, “Segezeni miungu yose ya Wamhazi imulinayo, yogeni, na m'vale vivalo ving'alile, <verse eid="GEN 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3"/>abaho mwize tuchole Beteli, nikazenge kilingo cha kulavila nhosa ha Mulungu yanhazile mmazua ga migayo yangu na yakalile na nie kokose kunicholile.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4"/>Avo wamgwelela Yakobo miungu yose ya Wamhazi iwakalile nayo, na heleni ziwakalile wavalile, na Yakobo kavihimbilila hasi ya m'biki ukemigwa mwaloni haja Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5"/>Yakobo na wanage viwasongile kusegela, Mulungu kawatenda wanhu wose wa miwambo ija ikalile behi wone bwembwe ng'hani, na haduhu munhu yawakoleleze. <verse eid="GEN 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6"/>Yakobo hamoja na wanhu wose iyakalile nao wavika hanhu hakemigwe Luzi ama mtwaga diyagwe Beteli muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7"/>Yakobo kazenga kilingo cha kulavila nhosa, na kuhakema hanhu haja Eli-Beteli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Eli-Beteli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mulungu wa Beteli.</char></note> kwavija haja baho Mulungu hayaigubule kumwake kipigiti viyakalile yomkimbila Esau mkulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8"/>Debola, yaya wa Lebeka, kadanganhika, na kazikigwa hasi ya m'biki ukemigwa mwaloni muisi ya Beteli. Avo Yakobo kaukema m'biki uja Aloni-Bakusi nhegulo yake “Mwaloni wa Mahozi.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9"/>Yakobo viyabwelile kulawa Padani-Alamu, Mulungu kamulawilila kabili na kummoteza. <verse eid="GEN 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10"/>Mulungu kamulongela, “Twaga jako Yakobo, ila hukemigwa kabili Yakobo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yakobo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kananahila kisiginho </char><char style="ft" closed="false">na vivija </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">m'vwizi.</char></note> ila kokemigwa Islaeli.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Islaeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kagomba na Mulungu.</char></note> Avo kakemigwa Islaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11"/>Abaho Mulungu kamulongela, “Nie iyo Mulungu Mwene Mhiko. Ukalele wongezeke, ndewa bwando zolawa kumwako, na wandewa wolawa mulukuli lwako gweye. <verse eid="GEN 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12"/>Isi inimgwelele Ablaham na Isaka, isi ino nokugwelela gweye na lukolo lwako londalwize.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13"/>Abaho Mulungu kamuleka, kachola uchana kulawa hanhu haja kuyalongile na Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14"/>Yakobo kasimika nguzo hanhu haja Mulungu hayalongile nayo, kasimika nguzo ya dibwe, kaigidila nhosa ya divai, abaho kaigidila mavuta. <verse eid="GEN 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15"/>Yakobo kahakema hanhu haja Mulungu hayalongile nayo, “Beteli.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Beteli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ng'anda ya Mulungu.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laheli Kodanganhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16"/>Yakobo na mulango wake wasegela Beteli, na viwakalile wang'hali kutali na wambo da Eflati, kipigiti cha Laheli kulela kivika, avo kasonga kona usungu ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17"/>Na usungu wa kulela vuubanzile, ija yakalile imng'hunga kamulongela, “Sambiudumbe, kulela mwana mbigalo iyagwe.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18"/>Laheli viyakalile behi na kudanganhika, kamgwelela twaga imwana, kamkema Beni-Oni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Beni-Oni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mwana wa mgayo wangu.</char></note> ila tataake kamkema Benjamini.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Benjamini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mwana wa mkono wangu wa ukulume.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19"/>Avo Laheli kadanganhika, kazikigwa hamgwazo wa inzila ichola Eflati, wambo dikalile na twaga diyagwe dikemigwa Betelehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20"/>Yakobo keka nguzo hadipanga da Laheli kamba ng'humbukila, nguzo ija ya baho mbaka lelo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:20 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka lelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti vichandikigwe kitabu kino.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21"/>Yakobo, ayo vivija yakemigwe Islaeli, kagendelela na mwanza wake na kwika ng'hambi ng'ambu ya ikabili ya ulingo wa Edeli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:21 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ulingo wa Edeli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ulingo wa kwimilizila ng'hondolo sambiwebigwe.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1Vipig. 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22"/>Yakobo viyakalile yokala muisi ija, Lubeni kachola kuwasa na Bilha mtwanzi wa kunze wa tataake, na Yakobo kahulika.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo kakala na wana mbigalo longo dimwe na wabili. <verse eid="GEN 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23"/>Wana wa Lea wakala Lubeni, yakalile chaudele wa Yakobo, Simioni, Lawi, Yuda, Isakali, na Zabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24"/>Wana wa Laheli wakala Usufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25"/>Wana wa Bilha nyakadala wa Laheli wakala Dani na Naftali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26"/>Wana wa Zilpa nyakadala wa Lea wakala Gadi na Asheli. Wano wao wana wa kimbigalo wa Yakobo iyawalelile viyakalile Padani-Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isaka Kodanganhika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27"/>Yakobo kachola ha tataake Isaka ako Mamle behi Kiliasi-Aliba, sambi hokemigwa Hebloni, ako Ablaham na Isaka kuwakalile wokala kamba wahenza. <verse eid="GEN 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28"/>Isaka kakala na uvyele wa milao mia na malongo manane. <verse eid="GEN 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29"/>Isaka kadanganhika kuno yali na milao bwando na kuilumba hamoja na wahenga zake. Wanage Esau na Yakobo wamzika tataao.<verse eid="GEN 35:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Lukolo lwa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1"/>Luno lulo lukolo lwa Esau, ayo vivija yakemigwe Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2"/>Esau kawasola watwanzi zake kulawa muisi ya Kanaani, Ada mndele wa Eloni Muhiti, na Oholibama, ayo yakalile mndele wa Ana na mzukulu wa Zibeoni Muhivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3"/>na Basemati mwanage Sumaili na lumbu ja Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4"/>Ada kamulelela Esau mwana yokemigwa Elifazi, Basemati kamulelela Esau mwana yokemigwa Leueli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5"/>na Oholibama kawalela Yeushi, Yalamu, na Kola. Wano wose iwo wana iyawalelile Esau kipigiti viyakalile Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6"/>Abaho Esau kawasola watwanzi zake, wanage wakitwanzi na wakimbigalo, na wanhu wose wakalile mng'anda yake, hamoja na wang'onyo zake wose na vinhu vose viyakalile navo haja Kanaani. Kasegela, kachola kuisi ikalile kutali na mdodo wake Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7"/>Katenda avo kwavija isi iwakalile wokala heyo na mdodo wake Yakobo ikala ndodo, avo havidahike kukala hamoja, kwavija wakala na wang'onyo bwando. <verse eid="GEN 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8"/>Avo Esau ayo yakalile na twaga diyagwe dikemigwa Edomu kachola kukala muisi ya vigongovigongo ya Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9"/>Luno lulo lukolo lwa Esau, muhenga wa Waedomu muisi ya vigongovigongo ya Seili. <verse eid="GEN 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10"/>Matwaga ga wana wa Esau gakala Elifazi, mwana wa mtwanzi wa Esau yokemigwa Ada, na Leueli, mwana wa mtwanzi wa Esau yokemigwa Basemati. <verse eid="GEN 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11"/>Wana wa Elifazi wakala Temani, Omali, Zefo, Gatamu, na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12"/>Mwana wa Esau yokemigwa Elifazi kakala na mtwanzi wa kunze twaga jake dikemigwa Timna, iyalelile nayo mwana yokemigwa Amaleki. Wana wano sita wambigalo wakala wazukulu wa mtwanzi wa Esau yokemigwa Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13"/>Wana wa Leueli wakala Nahati, Zela, Shama, na Miza. Wano wakala wazukulu wa Basemati, mtwanzi wa Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14"/>Oholibama, ayo yakalile mndele wa Ana na mzukulu wa Zibeoni, kamulelela Esau wana wadatu wakemigwe Yeushi, Yalamu, na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15"/>Wano wao wakulu wa mitala ilawile mulukolo lwa Esau. Elifazi kakala chaudele wa Esau na heyo kakala na wana wakemigwe Temani, Omali, Zefo, Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16"/>Kola, Gatamu, na Amaleki. Wano wao wakulu kulawa mulukolo lwa Elifazi muisi ya Edomu, wakala wazukulu wa mtwanzi wa Esau yokemigwa Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17"/>Leueli, mwanage Esau, kawalela Nahati, Zela, Shama, na Miza. Wano wao wakulu wa lukolo lwa Leueli muisi ya Edomu, wakala wazukulu wa mtwanzi wa Esau yokemigwa Basemati.<verse eid="GEN 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18"/>Wana wa mtwanzi wa Esau yokemigwa Oholibama wakala Yeushi, Yalamu, na Kola. Wano wao wakulu wa lukolo lwa mtwanzi wa Esau yokemigwa Oholibama mwanage Ana. <verse eid="GEN 36:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19"/>Wano wao wana wa Esau, vivija yakemigwe Edomu, na kila munhu kakala mkulu muisi yake.<verse eid="GEN 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukolo lwa Seili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1Vipig. 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20"/>Wano wao wana wa Seili Mholi. Wakalile wokala muisi ija, matwaga gao gakala Lotani, Shobali, Zibeoni, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21"/>Dishoni, Ezeli, na Dishani. Wana wano wa Seili wakalile wokala Edomu wakala wakulu wa Waholi.<verse eid="GEN 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22"/>Wana wa Lotani wakala Holi na Hemani. Timna kakala lumbu jake Lotani. <verse eid="GEN 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23"/>Wana wa Shobali wakala Alvani, Manahati, Ebali, Shefo, na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24"/>Wana wa Sibeoni wakala Aya na Ana. Ana iyo yavumbule nzokwe za mazi ga moto kuluwala, kipigiti viyakalile yochunga mhunda za Zibeoni tataake. <verse eid="GEN 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25"/>Wana wa Ana wakala Dishoni na Oholibama lumbu jake. <verse eid="GEN 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26"/>Wana wa Dishoni wakala Hemdani, Eshibani, Itilani, na Kelani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27"/>Wana wa Ezeli wakala Bilhani, Zaavani, na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28"/>Wana wa Dishani wakala Uzi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29"/>Wakulu wa Waholi wakala Lotani, Shobali, Zibeoni, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30"/>Dishoni, Ezeli, na Dishani. Wano wakala wakulu wa Waholi muisi ya Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wandewa wa Isi ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1Vipig. 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31"/>Wano wao wandewa wakalile watawale isi ya Edomu kipigiti hanatawala mndewa yoyose muisi ya Islaeli. <verse eid="GEN 36:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32"/>Bela mwanage Beoli kawa mndewa wa isi ya Edomu, wambo jake dikala dikemigwa Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33"/>Bela viyadanganhike, Yobabu mwanage Zela wa wambo da Bozla kawa mndewa, kusola nafasi yake. <verse eid="GEN 36:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34"/>Yobabu viyadanganhike, Hushamu wa isi ya Watemani kawa mndewa, kusola nafasi yake. <verse eid="GEN 36:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35"/>Hushamu viyadanganhike, Hadadi mwana wa Bedadi kawa mndewa, kusola nafasi yake, na kutawala songela mdiwambo da Avita. Heyo kakala yawahumile Wamidiani muisi ya Moabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36"/>Hadadi viyadanganhike, Samla kulawa mdiwambo da Masleka kawa mndewa, kusola nafasi yake. <verse eid="GEN 36:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37"/>Samla viyadanganhike, Shauli kulawa mdiwambo da Lehoboti behi na ulwanda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe zolonga </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lwanda luno lukala Lwanda lwa Yuflati.</char></note> kawa mndewa, kusola nafasi yake. <verse eid="GEN 36:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38"/>Shauli viyadanganhike, Baali-Hanani mwanage Akiboli kawa mndewa, kusola nafasi yake. <verse eid="GEN 36:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39"/>Baali-Hanani mwanage Akiboli viyadanganhike, Hadadi kawa mndewa, kusola nafasi yake, na kutawala songela mdiwambo da Pau. Mtwanzi wake kakemigwa Mehetabeli, mndele wa Matiledi na mzukulu wa kitwanzi wa Me-Zahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wakulu wa lukolo lwa Esau, hanhu hawakalile wokala hakemigwe matwaga ga madale gao, Timna, Alva, Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41"/>Oholibama, Ela, Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42"/>Kenazi, Temani, Mibizali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43"/>Magidieli, na Ilamu. Wano wakala wakulu wa isi zao kulawa mulukolo lwa Esau, muhenga wa Waedomu. Hanhu hawakalile wokala hakemigwa matwaga ga mitala yao.<verse eid="GEN 36:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37"/>
  <para style="s1">Usufu na Wandugu Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1"/>Yakobo kakala muisi yaakalile tataake kamba muhenza, isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2"/>Ino iyo simulizi ya mulango wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Usufu viyakalile na milao longo dimwe na saba, kakala yochunga ng'hondolo na wakulu zake, wana wa Bilha na wana wa Zilpa watwanzi wa tataake. Usufu kamgalila tataake mbuli zihile ziwatendile wakulu zake.<verse eid="GEN 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3"/>Islaeli, ayo vivija yakemigwe Yakobo, kamnogela ng'hani Usufu kubanza wanage wasigale kwavija kamulela kipigiti cha uvyele wake, na kamtendela kanzu nhali ihambigwe. <verse eid="GEN 37:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4"/>Wakulu zake viwonile kamba tataao kamnogela heyo ng'hani kubanza hewo wose wasigale, wamwihila, na hawalongelele nayo goya.<verse eid="GEN 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5"/>Usufu kalota nzozi, na viyawalongele wakulu zake, wabanza kumwihila. <verse eid="GEN 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6"/>Kawalongela, “Tegelezeni nzozi ino inilotile. <verse eid="GEN 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7"/>Tweye tose tukala kumgunda tufunga makinza ga ngano, nidukila kinza jangu dinuka na kwima wima na mikinza yenu izunguluka kinza jangu na kudinamilila mbaka hasi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8"/>Wakulu zake wamuuza, “Kokwagiza gweye kowa mndewa wetu, kokwagiza gweye kotutawala tweye?” Avo wamwihila ng'hani kabisa sama ya nzozi yake na mbuli zake. <verse eid="GEN 37:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9"/>Abaho Usufu kalota nzozi iyagwe na kuwalongela wakulu zake, “Nilota nzozi iyagwe. Zua na mulenge na nhondo longo dimwe na imwe zininamilila nie mbaka hasi.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10"/>Ila viyamulongele tataake kamba viyawalongele wandugu zake, tataake kamkomhokela na kumulongela, “Nzozi yaki ino yuulotile! Mamaako na nie na wakulu zako tokwiza na kukunamilila gweye mbaka hasi?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11"/>Avo wakulu zake wamonela migongo, ila tataake kazika mbuli zija mmoyo.<verse eid="GEN 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usufu Koguzigwa na Kugaligwa Kuisi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12"/>Vuzimalile mbuli zino, wakulu zake wachola kuchunga ng'hondolo za tataao behi na Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13"/>Na Yakobo kamulongela Usufu, “Wakulu zako wachola Shekemu kuchunga ng'hondolo, isasale nolonda kukutuma kumwao.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Usufu kalonga, “Nhogola.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14"/>Tataake kamulongela, “Genda ukawalole wakulu zako hamoja na iwang'hondolo kamba wana ugima, abaho ubwele unongele.” Avo tataake kamtuma Usufu kulawa Kudibonde da Hebloni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Viyavikile Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15"/>munhu imwe kam'vika yozungulukazunguluka muluwala, kamuuza, “Kozahila choni hano?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16"/>Kalonga, “Nowazahila wakulu zangu. Nilongele kwahi kowachungila ng'hondolo zao.”<verse eid="GEN 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17"/>Ija imunhu kalonga, “Wasegela hano kwavija niwahulika wolonga, ‘Tucholeni Dotani.’ ” Avo Usufu kawakoleleza wakulu zake, kawavika Dotani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18"/>Wamona songela viyakalile kutali, na kipigiti hanawakwenhukila, wamwikila zundo da kumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19"/>Wailongela, “Ayo mulota nzozi kokwiza. <verse eid="GEN 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20"/>Izoni tumkome abaho tumwase mdikolongo dimwe mmwanza wa mikolongo ino. Tulonge mng'onyo wa kumuhulo kamkoma. Abaho tulole malawililo ga nzozi zake.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21"/>Lubeni viyagahulike gano, kalonda kumkombola kulawa mmakono gao. Kalonga, “Sambitumkome.” <verse eid="GEN 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22"/>Lubeni kawalongela, “Sambitwite mulopa wake, ila tumwase mdikolongo dino dili hano mmuhulo, ila sambimmulumize.” Lubeni kalonga vino giladi yamwihule kulawa mmakono gao yam'bweze ha tataake. <verse eid="GEN 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23"/>Usufu viyavikile ha wakulu zake, wam'vula kanzu yake nhali ihambigwe iyavalile. <verse eid="GEN 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24"/>Wamsola wamwasila mdikolongo dikalile bule kinhu, dikala bule mazi mgati yake.<verse eid="GEN 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25"/>Viwakalile hasi waje mandia, walola wona dale da Wasumaili wokwiza kulawa Gileadi, hamoja na ngamia zao wapapile ubane, zeli, na manemane,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ubane, zeli, na manemane </char><char style="ft" closed="false">vikala vinhu vilawa muululu wa mibiki, vokwanikigwa na kunyala.</char></note> na wakala mnzila wovigala Misili. <verse eid="GEN 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26"/>Yuda kawalongela wandugu zake, “Kamba tuhamkoma mdodo wetu na kuufisa mulopa wake, topata choni? <verse eid="GEN 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27"/>Izoni tumguze ha Wasumaili na sambitumulumize kwavija ino mdodo wetu, lukuli lwetu, na mulopa wetu.” Na ndugu zake watogola. <verse eid="GEN 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28"/>Avo waja iwachuuzi kulawa Midiani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hano </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wamidiani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wao Wasumaili.</char></note> viwakwenhuke, wakulu zake wamulava Usufu hanze ya idikolongo na kumguza ha Wasumaili kwa vidanga malongo mabili va feza,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kino kicho kiasi cha hela kiyalihigwe nyakadala wa kimbigalo.</char></note> na wamsola na kumgala Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29"/>Lubeni viyabwelile kudikolongo na kona kamba Usufu kahaduhu muja mdikolongo, kadega vivalo vake mkona giogio. <verse eid="GEN 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30"/>Kabwela ha wandugu zake na kuwalongela, “Immhale kahaduhu muja mdikolongo, nitendeze?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31"/>Avo wasola kanzu ya Usufu, wamchinja menhe, waivubika ija ikanzu mmulopa. <verse eid="GEN 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32"/>Waisola ija ikanzu ihambigwe waigala ha tataao na kulonga, “Tuidondola kanzu ino. Ilole goya, siku yowa kanzu ya mwanago.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33"/>Tataao kaitanga na kulonga, “Ino iyo kanzu ya mwanangu, mng'onyo mkali kamja. Mwanangu Usufu kadegigwa vidangavidanga.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34"/>Abaho Yakobo kadega vivalo vake mkona giogio, kavala migunia, na kumulilila mwanage mmazua bwando. <verse eid="GEN 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35"/>Wanage wose wakimbigalo na wakitwanzi weza kumuhembekeza, ila kalema kuhembekezwa. Kalonga, “Nomulilila mwanangu mbaka vondaningile kuzimu.” Avo tataake kagendelela kumulilila.<verse eid="GEN 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36"/>Kipigiti kikija, viwavikile Misili, waja Iwamidiani wamguza Usufu ha Potifa, ayo yakalile imwe wa wakulu wa silikali, ayo vivija yakalile kilangizi wa wemilizi wa ng'anda ya Falao, mndewa wa Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1"/>Kipigiti kija Yuda kawaleka wandugu zake na kuchola kukala na munhu wa kiwambo cha Adulamu yokemigwa Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2"/>Yuda kipigiti viyakalile haja kamona mndele kulawa isi ya Kanaani, ayo tataake yakalile yokemigwa Shua. Kamsola na kuwasa nayo. <verse eid="GEN 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3"/>Kapata inda, kalela mwana mbigalo, na kumgwelela twaga dikemigwa Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4"/>Kapata inda iyagwe, kalela mwana mbigalo, na kumgwelela twaga dikemigwa Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5"/>Abaho kapata inda mwanza uyagwe, kalela mwana mbigalo, na kumgwelela twaga dikemigwa Shela. Yuda kakala mkiwambo kikemigwe Kezibu kipigiti viyavumbuke Shela.<verse eid="GEN 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6"/>Yuda kamsolela mtwanzi mwanage wa udele yokemigwa Eli, twaga jake mtwanzi ija kakala yokemigwa Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7"/>Ila Eli mwana wa udele wa Yuda kakala yehile hameso ga MNDEWA, avo MNDEWA kamkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8"/>Avo Yuda kamulongela Onani, “Genda kawase na mtwanzi wa mkulu wako, utende gaja goulondigwa kutenda kumwake giladi umulelele wana mkulu wako.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9"/>Ila Onani kavimanya kamba wana wondawavumbuke si wake heyo, avo kila yahachola kuwasa nayo ketila hasi zimbeyu giladi sambiyamulele wana mkulu wake. <verse eid="GEN 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10"/>Mbuli ija imgevuza MNDEWA, avo na heyo kamkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11"/>Abaho Yuda kamulongela mkwe yake Tamali, “Ukale kamba kizuka muing'anda ya tataako mbaka mwanangu Shela yakule.” Kalonga vino kwavija kadumba siku na heyo kodanganhika kamba wakulu zake. Avo Tamali kachola kukala mng'anda ya tataake.<verse eid="GEN 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12"/>Viibitile milao bwando, mwehe wa Yuda, ija imwana wa Shua, kadanganhika. Yuda viyamambukize kumulilila mwehe wake, heyo na mbwigaake Hila munhu wa Adulamu wachola Timna ako ng'hondolo zake kuwakalile wokanhigwa mijusu. <verse eid="GEN 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13"/>Munhu imwe kamulongela Tamali kamba mkwe yake kakala yochola Timna kuwakanha mijusu ng'hondolo zake. <verse eid="GEN 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14"/>Avo kavula vivalo vake va ukizuka viyakalile yavalile, kaitanda kiziweziwe na kuigalula, abaho kakala hasi hana ulwivi lwa ikiwambo cha Enaimu mnzila ya kuchola Timna, kwavija kona kamba Shela kakula ila halavigwe yawe mtwanzi wake.<verse eid="GEN 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15"/>Yuda viyamuwene, kagiza mtenda ugoni ndwanga, kwavija kaigubika mkihanga. <verse eid="GEN 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16"/>Kamcholela kuja kumgwazo wa inzila na kumulongela, “Izo niwase nagwe,” kwavija Yuda kakala hanavitanga kamba heyo kakala mkwe yake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Na heyo kamuuza, “Niheza kuwasa na gweye kongwelela choni?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17"/>Kamulongela, “Nokulagizila mwanamenhe kulawa mkikwama changu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Na heyo kamulongela, “Nigwelele kinhu kiwe zamana mbaka kipigiti vondaumgale.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18"/>Kamulongela, “Zamana ilihi yondanikugwelele?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Kalonga, “Luzabi lwako luli na kitindi kili na utango wako hamoja na fimbo yako.” Avo kamgwelela abaho kawasa nayo, avo kapata inda. <verse eid="GEN 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19"/>Abaho kachola ukae yake, kakisegeza kiziweziwe chake na kuvala kabili vivalo vake va ukizuka.<verse eid="GEN 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20"/>Mkipigiti kidodo hamwande, Yuda kamtuma mbwigaake Hila yamsole ija imenhe yakamgwelele ija imtwanzi na kuvisola vija ivinhu viyamgwelele ija imtwanzi kamba zamana, ila Hila ham'vikile ija imtwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21"/>Kawauza wanhu wakalile wokala haja Enaimu, “Kakwahi ija imtenda ugoni ndwanga yakalile hano hamgwazo wa inzila?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Wamulongela, “Hano hakukalile na mtenda ugoni ndwanga.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22"/>Avo kabweleganya ha Yuda na kulonga, “Sim'vikile. Wanhu wa haja walonga kamba haja hakukalile na mtenda ugoni ndwanga.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23"/>Yuda kamwidika, “Natumulekele vija ivinhu viwe vake, kamba hatutendile hivo wanhu wokwiza kutuseka. Nimgalila menhe ino, ila hum'vikile.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24"/>Viibitile milenge midatu, Yuda kalongeligwa, “Mkwe yako Tamali katenda ugoni ndwanga, na sambi kana inda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda kalonga, “Mulaveni hanze mumsome moto mbaka yadanganhike.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25"/>Viwakalile womulava hanze, katuma usenga ha mkwe yake kalonga, “Munhu mwene vinhu vino iyo yangwelele inda ino,” abaho kongeza, “Lola, kokitambula kitindi kino na luzabi luno na fimbo ino va munhu yalihi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26"/>Yuda kavitambula na kulonga, “Heyo katenda galumbile kunibanza nie, kwavija nie simgwelele mwanangu Shela yamsole.” Avo Yuda hawasile nayo kabili.<verse eid="GEN 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27"/>Kipigiti cha kulela vikivikile, kakala na wana ubasa wa kimbigalo muinda yake. <verse eid="GEN 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28"/>Viyakalile yolela mwana, imwe kalava hanze mkono wake, ija imng'hunga kasola luzi ludung'hu na kulufunga mumkono wake na kulonga, “Ino iyo yasongile kulawa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29"/>Ila viyaubwezile mgati mkono wake, miyage kavumbuka, ija imng'hunga kalonga, “Vino vivo vuuitulile nzila mwenyego.” Avo kakemigwa twaga da Pelezi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Pelezi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kutula.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30"/>Abaho ija imwana yakalile yafungigwe luzi ludung'hu mumkono wake kavumbuka na kagweleligwa twaga dikemigwa Zela.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zela </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">udung'hu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ama </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mhwani yau.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 38:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39"/>
  <para style="s1">Usufu na Mtwanzi wa Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1"/>Usufu kasoligwa mbaka Misili. Potifa Mmisili, ayo yakalile imwe wa wakulu wa silikali, ayo vivija yakalile kilangizi wa wemilizi wa ng'anda ya Falao, mndewa wa Misili, kamgula kulawa ha Wasumaili, awo wakalile wamgalile haja. <verse eid="GEN 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2"/>MNDEWA kakala na Usufu na kakala yammoteze m'vinhu vose viyatendile, kakala yokala mng'anda ya Potifa. <verse eid="GEN 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3"/>Potifa viyonile kamba MNDEWA ka hamoja na Usufu na kamba MNDEWA kammoteza mkila kinhu kiyatendile, <verse eid="GEN 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4"/>mbuli ino imnogela ng'hani Potifa avo kamtenda yawe mtumigwa wake heyo mwenyego. Potifa kamtenda Usufu kuwa mkulu wa ng'anda yake yose na kavika vinhu vake vose hasi yake heyo. <verse eid="GEN 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5"/>Songela kipigiti kiyamtendile heyo kuwa mkulu wa ng'anda yake yose na vinhu vake vose, MNDEWA kaimoteza ng'anda yose ya Potifa sama ya Usufu. Motelo za MNDEWA zikala uchana ya vinhu vose viyakalile navo Potifa, vinhu vikalile mng'anda na vikalile mmigunda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6"/>Avo kila kinhu kiyakalilenacho Potifa kakika hasi ya wimilizi wa Usufu. Potifa hasang'hanike na kinhu chochose ila mandia gayadile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Usufu kakala yalumbigwe vinogile na kakala yanogile mmeso ga wanhu. <verse eid="GEN 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7"/>Vikibitile kipigiti kidodo, mtwanzi wa Potifa kamulola Usufu na kulonga, “Izo uwase na nie!”<verse eid="GEN 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8"/>Ila heyo kalema na kumulongela, “Mndewa wangu hasang'hanika na kinhu chochose mng'anda ino, ila nie, kwavija nie kanika niwe mkulu wa vinhu vose viyalinavo. <verse eid="GEN 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9"/>Haduhu munhu yali mkulu mng'anda ino kunibanza nie. Na hanizuilile kinhu chochose ila gweye, kwavija gweye kwa mwehe wake, nitendeze mbuli ino ihile, nimtendele vilozo Mulungu?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10"/>Kamnanahila Usufu mianza bwando, ila heyo kalema kuwasa nayo na hata kumkwenhukila.<verse eid="GEN 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11"/>Zua dimwe Usufu kengila mng'anda kutenda sang'hano zake, na haduhu mtumigwa yoyose wa mng'anda yakalile muja mng'anda. <verse eid="GEN 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12"/>Mtwanzi wa Potifa kamgoga mkivalo chake na kulonga, “Izo uwase na nie!” Ila kakileka kivalo chake mumkono wake na kukimbila hanze. <verse eid="GEN 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13"/>Viyonile kamba kaleka kivalo chake mumkono wake na kukimbila hanze, <verse eid="GEN 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14"/>kawakema watumigwa zake wa mng'anda na kuwalongela, “Loleni, mbigalo wangu kamgala Mueblania ino yeze kutugela kinyala! Kaningilila mng'anda giladi yawase na nie, avo nitoa nyangi, <verse eid="GEN 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15"/>na viyanihulike notoa nyangi, kakileka kivalo chake hamgwazo wangu, kakimbila na kulawa hanze.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16"/>Avo ija imtwanzi kakileka kivalo cha Usufu hamgwazo wake mbaka mbigalo wake viyabwelile. <verse eid="GEN 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17"/>Abaho kamulongela vino, “Ija inyakadala wa Kieblania yuutugalile keza kumwangu nie kunigela kinyala. <verse eid="GEN 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18"/>Ila vunitoile nyangi, kaleka kivalo chake hamgwazo wangu, kakimbila na kulawa hanze.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19"/>Potifa viyahulike gaja gayamsimulile mtwanzi wake, vija Usufu viyamtendele mtwanzi wake, kona lusango ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20"/>Potifa kamsola Usufu na kumwasa mkifungo, hanhu hawakalile wafungigwa wa mndewa wofungigwa, kakala himo mkifungo. <verse eid="GEN 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21"/>Ila MNDEWA kakala na Usufu na kumulagusila noge dilekile kuhungula, kamgwelela mhome ya kunogelwa na mkulu wa ikifungo. <verse eid="GEN 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22"/>Ija imkulu wa ikifungo kamtenda Usufu kuwa mkulu wa wafungigwa wose na kilangizi wa mbuli zose zitendeke muja mkifungo. <verse eid="GEN 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23"/>Ija imkulu wa ikifungo hasang'hanike na kinhu chochose kikigwe mmakono ga Usufu, kwavija MNDEWA kakala hamoja na heyo, na kutenda kila kinhu kiyatendile Usufu kinoge.<verse eid="GEN 39:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Usufu Kotapita Nzozi za Wanhu Wafungigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1"/>Vugabitile mazua madodo hamwande, munhu yakalile mkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji Falao, mndewa wa Misili, na ija yakalile mkulu wa waja womokela mikate, wamgevuza mkulu wao, Falao. <verse eid="GEN 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2"/>Falao kagevuzigwa ng'hani na wakulu wano wabili, mkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji na mkulu wa waja womokela mikate, <verse eid="GEN 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3"/>na kawagela mkifungo muing'anda ya mkulu wa wemilizi amo mwayakalile yafungigwe Usufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4"/>Wakala muja mkifungo mkipigiti kitali, ija imkulu wa wemilizi kamsagula Usufu yawe mtumigwa wao.<verse eid="GEN 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5"/>Kilo imwe ija imkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji mndewa na ija imkulu wa waja womokela mikate mndewa walota nzozi muja mkifungo, na kila nzozi ikala na nhegulo yake. <verse eid="GEN 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6"/>Imitondo iyagwe Usufu viyawakwenhukile, kawona wanyunguala. <verse eid="GEN 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7"/>Kawauza, “Habali lelo mnyunguale?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8"/>Wamwidika walonga, “Tweye tose tulota nzozi, na haduhu hata munhu imwe yadahile kutapita nhegulo ya nzozi zetu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Usufu kawalongela, “Si Mulungu yolava udaho wa kutapita nhegulo ya nzozi? Nilongeleni nzozi zenu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9"/>Avo ija imkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji mndewa kamulongela Usufu nzozi yake, kamulongela, “Mnzozi yangu, nyona mzabibu haulongozi wangu, <verse eid="GEN 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10"/>Na muja mumzabibu kukala na matambi madatu. Kipigiti kikija vuusongile kuzuka, malua gake galika na kulela vikungwi vili na zabibu zipile. <verse eid="GEN 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11"/>Kikasi cha Falao kikala mumkono wangu, avo nisola zija zizabibu nizikamulila mkikasi cha Falao na kumgwaa Falao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12"/>Usufu kalonga, “Nhegulo ya nzozi ino iyo ino, matambi madatu gago mazua madatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13"/>Mkipigiti cha mazua madatu, Falao kokufungula, na kokubweza hana isang'hano yako, na komgomela mndewa ung'waji kamba vuukalile utenda kipigiti vuukalile mkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji mndewa. <verse eid="GEN 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14"/>Ila mbuli zose zihakucholela goya sambiunisemwe, undagusile unhu, ukanhambule ha Falao siku konilava kulawa mkifungo kino. <verse eid="GEN 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15"/>Nie ninyamuligwa bila kulonda kulawa muisi ya Waeblania, na hata hano Misili sitendile kinhu chochose kilumbile nie kugeligwa mkifungo.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16"/>Ija imkulu wa waja womokela mikate mndewa viyonile kamba Usufu kamulongela mbuli zinogile za nzozi yake, ija imkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji mndewa kamulongela, “Na nie vivija nilota nzozi, mditwi jangu kukala na vigelo vidatu va mikate. <verse eid="GEN 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17"/>Mkigelo kikalile uchana kukala na namna zose za mandia gokigwe sama ya Falao, ila ndege wagaja gamandia kipigiti vigakalile gang'hali mditwi jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18"/>Usufu kalonga, “Ino iyo nhegulo yake, vigelo vidatu vima sama ya mazua madatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19"/>Mkipigiti cha mazua madatu, Falao kokufungula, ila kukukanha ditwi jako na kulutungika lukuli lwako mum'biki. Na ndege woija nyama yako.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20"/>Zua da ikadatu dikala zua da ng'humbukila ya mvumbuka ya Falao, avo Falao kawatendela lusona watumigwa zake wose, kamfungula mkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji mndewa na ija imkulu wa waja womokela mikate mndewa na kuwagala haulongozi wa waja iwatumigwa. <verse eid="GEN 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21"/>Kam'bweza msang'hano yake ija mkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji mndewa, giladi yagendelele kumgwelela Falao kikasi, <verse eid="GEN 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22"/>ila ija imkulu wa waja womokela mikate mndewa kakanhigwa ditwi jake, na lukuli lwake lutungikigwa kamba Usufu viyawatapitile. <verse eid="GEN 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23"/>Ila ija imkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji mndewa kamwisemwa Usufu, hamkumbuke mmbuli yoyose.<verse eid="GEN 40:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41"/>
  <para style="s1">Usufu Koitapita Nzozi ya Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1"/>Viibitile milao mibili, Falao kalota nzozi. Kema hamgwazo wa Lwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2"/>ng'ombe saba wanenehe tena wanyilibuke wakwela kulawa Mulwanda lwa Naili, wasonga kuja mijani. <verse eid="GEN 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3"/>Abaho ng'ombe wayagwe saba wasokile tena wapunyukile wakwela kulawa Mulwanda lwa Naili hachugu cha waja wa ichanduso, wema behi na waja iwang'ombe wanenehe haja mumgwazo wa Ulwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4"/>na waja iwang'ombe wasokile wawaja waja iwang'ombe wanenehe abaho Falao kalamuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5"/>Kawasa kabili na kalota nzozi iyagwe. Masukwe saba ga ngano gakangale tena gazamile gakala mdibelege dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6"/>Abaho masukwe gayagwe saba ga ngano gapalatile tena gali fuya gasokezwe na ubeho wa muluwala gazuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7"/>Gaja gamasukwe ga ngano gapalatile gagameza gaja gamasukwe ga ngano gazamile. Falao kalamuka na kavitanga kamba kumbe zikala nzozi. <verse eid="GEN 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8"/>Imitondo yake kagaya ng'hani mmoyo, avo kawakema waja wose wali na nzewele na wahawi wose wa muisi ya Misili. Falao kawalongela nzozi zake, ila haduhu hata imwe yadahile kumulongela nhegulo ya nzozi zake.<verse eid="GEN 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9"/>Abaho ija imkulu wa waja womgomela ung'waji mndewa kamulongela Falao, “Lelo ng'humbuswa gaja ganihonyele. <verse eid="GEN 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10"/>Falao viyakalile na lusango na watumigwa zake, kanigela mkifungo nie hamoja na mkulu wa waja womokela mikate mndewa muing'anda ya mkulu wa wemilizi. <verse eid="GEN 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11"/>Kilo imwe tulota nzozi heyo na nie, kila nzozi ikala na nhegulo yake. <verse eid="GEN 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12"/>Mmhale wa Kieblania kakala haja hamoja na tweye, mtumigwa wa mkulu wa wemilizi. Tumulongela nzozi zetu, na heyo katulongela nhegulo zake, kila munhu kamulongela nhegulo ya nzozi yake. <verse eid="GEN 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13"/>Na ilawilila vivija kamba viyatulongele. Nie nibwezigwa kuisang'hano yangu, na ija miyangu katungikigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14"/>Avo Falao kawatuma wanhu wamgale Usufu hima, na hima wamgala kulawa mkifungo. Viyamalile kubea na kuvala vivalo viyagwe, keza haulongozi wa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15"/>Falao kamulongela Usufu, “Nilota nzozi na haduhu munhu yadahile kunongela nhegulo yake. Ila nihulika kamba gweye uhaihulika nzozi, kodaha kuitapita nhegulo yake.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16"/>Usufu kamulongela Falao, “Nie sidaha kuitapita nhegulo ya nzozi yako, ila Mulungu kokugwelela nhegulo yondaikutende upate mulegeho.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17"/>Abaho Falao kamulongela Usufu, “Nilota nikala nimile hamgwazo wa Ulwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18"/>ng'ombe saba wanenehe tena wanyilibuke wakwela kulawa Mulwanda lwa Naili, wasonga kuja mijani. <verse eid="GEN 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19"/>Abaho ng'ombe wayagwe saba wakwela kulawa mulwanda hachugu cha waja wa ichanduso, wasokile, tena wapunyukile. Sinawona ng'ombe wehile kamba wano muisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20"/>Waja iwang'ombe wasokile tena wapunyukile wawaja waja iwang'ombe saba wanenehe wa ichanduso, <verse eid="GEN 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21"/>ila viwawadile, haduhu munhu yahadahile kuvitanga kamba wawaja kwavija wakala wang'hali wasokile na kupunyukila kamba viwakalile ha ichanduso. Abaho nilamuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22"/>Niwasa kabili abaho nilota masukwe saba ga ngano gakangale tena gazamile gakalile mdibelege dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23"/>Na masukwe gayagwe saba gapalatile tena gali fuya gasokezwe na ubeho unyalile kulawa ulawilo wa zua gazuka hachugu cha gaja ga ichanduso, <verse eid="GEN 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24"/>na gaja gamasukwe gapalatile gagameza gaja gamasukwe gazamile. Ila viniwalongele wahawi, haduhu hata imwe yadahile kunongela nhegulo yake.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25"/>Abaho Usufu kamulongela Falao, “Nzozi zino mbili zolonga kinhu kimwe, na zose ziilinga. Mulungu kakugubulila gweye kija choyolonda kukitenda mkipigiti kiguhi hamwande. <verse eid="GEN 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26"/>Waja iwang'ombe saba wanenehe iwo milao saba, na gaja gamasukwe saba gakangale tena gazamile gago milao saba, nzozi zino zolonga kinhu kimwe na zose ziilinga. <verse eid="GEN 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27"/>Waja iwang'ombe saba wasokile na wapunyukile walawilile hachugu cha waja wa ichanduso, na gaja gamasukwe saba gapalatile gasokezwe na ubeho wa ulawilo wa zua, gago milao saba ya nzala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28"/>Kamba vinikulongele, Mulungu kakulagusila kija choyolonda kukitenda mkipigiti kiguhi hamwande. <verse eid="GEN 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29"/>Kowa na milao saba ya mandia bwando muisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30"/>Ihabita milao ija saba ya mwanduso, kowa na milao saba ya nzala, na milao ija ya mandia bwando yosemwigwa kwavija nzala yogubika isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31"/>Kipigiti cha mandia bwando chosemwigwa kwavija nzala yondaize yowa mpamanho. <verse eid="GEN 41:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32"/>Nzozi zino mbili zuulotile nhegulo zake mbuli ino isha kusasaligwa na Mulungu na ya mmabehi kulawilila.<verse eid="GEN 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33"/>“Avo mina Falao yamsagule munhu mwene ng'hungwe na nzewele ya kwimila isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34"/>Vivija uwasagule wanhu wayagwe wasole imwe ya tano ya vakuja vose kipigiti cha milao saba ya vakuja bwando. <verse eid="GEN 41:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35"/>Walagize wakunzanye vakuja vose mkipigiti cha milao ikwiza ya vakuja bwando na wagwelele udaho wa kuvika vakuja mmakano ga mmiwambo na kuvimiliza. <verse eid="GEN 41:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36"/>Vakuja vino volondigwa vikigwe ngama sama ya isi ino, giladi vidigwe mkipigiti cha milao saba ya nzala chondakize muisi ya Misili, giladi isi sambiigubikwe na nzala.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usufu Kotendigwa Kuwa Mkulu wa Isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37"/>Falao na salange zake wanogelwa ng'hani na gaja gayalongile Usufu, <verse eid="GEN 41:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38"/>avo Falao kawauza wayage, “Tupate kwahi munhu kamba ino, munhu yali na Loho wa Mulungu mgati yake?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39"/>Avo Falao kamulongela Usufu, “Kwavija Mulungu kakulagusila gweye gano gose, haduhu munhu iyagwe yali na ng'hungwe na nzewele kamba gweye. <verse eid="GEN 41:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40"/>Gweye kowa mkulu wa ng'anda yangu, na wanhu zangu wose wotenda gaja gondauwalongele gweye, ila kwavija nie na mndewa, nie niiyeka nowa mkulu kubanza gweye.” <verse eid="GEN 41:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41"/>Falao kamulongela Usufu, “Lola, nikugwaa ukulu muisi yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42"/>Falao kavula kitindi chake kili na utango kulawa mkidole chake na kukigela mkidole cha Usufu. Kam'vaza kivalo kinogile cha kitani na kumgela mkufu wa zahabu msingo yake. <verse eid="GEN 41:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43"/>Abaho kamgela mdikwama da mkulu wa isi yali hasi ya Falao, na wanhu watoa nyangi haulongozi wake wolonga, “Fugameni mavindi.” Avo Falao kamtenda Usufu kuwa mkulu wa isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44"/>Falao kamulongela Usufu, “Nie iyo Falao, muisi yose ya Misili munhu sambiyenule mgulu wake ama mkono wake bila gweye kumulongela.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45"/>Falao kamgwaa Usufu twaga da Kimisili dikemigwa Zafenati-Panea,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:45</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zafenati-Panea </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mulungu kalongaga.</char></note> na kamgwaa mwehe yokemigwa Asinati mwanage Potifela, mkulu wa nhambiko wa wambo da Heliopoli. Avo Usufu kapata ukulu muisi yose ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 41:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46"/>Usufu kakala na milao malongo madatu kipigiti viyengile msang'hano ya Falao mndewa wa Misili. Usufu kalawa haulongozi wa Falao na kutembela muisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47"/>Kipigiti cha milao saba ya vakuja bwando, isi ilela vakuja bwando. <verse eid="GEN 41:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48"/>Usufu kakunzanya vakuja vose vilelile mmilao ija saba ya vakuja bwando muisi ya Misili na kuvika mmakano ga mmiwambo. Kila wambo keka vakuja vihunigwe mmigunda izunguluke wambo dija. <verse eid="GEN 41:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49"/>Usufu kakunzanya vakuja bwando kamba misenga ya mumgwazo wa bahali, vikala bwando mbaka mheta yake impotela kwavija vikala vibanzile mhima.<verse eid="GEN 41:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50"/>Kipigiti cha milao ya nzala vikikalile hakinalawilila, Usufu kakala na wana wabili iwamulelele Asinati mwanage Potifela mkulu wa nhambiko wa wambo da Heliopoli. <verse eid="GEN 41:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51"/>Usufu kamgwaa mwanage wa ichanduso twaga dikemigwa Manase,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Manase </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kinhu kimtenda munhu yaisemwe.</char></note> kalonga, “Mulungu kanitenda nie niisemwe migayo yangu yose na wanhu wa ng'anda ya tataangu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52"/>Mwanage wa ikabili kamgwaa twaga dikemigwa Eflaim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mkieblania </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Eflaim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kupata wana na kumotezwa.</char></note> kwavija kalonga, “Mulungu kangwelela wana muisi ya migayo yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53"/>Milao saba ya mandia bwando muisi ya Misili imala, <verse eid="GEN 41:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54"/>na milao saba ya nzala isonga kamba Usufu viyalongile. Kukala na nzala muisi ziyagwe zose, ila muisi yose ya Misili kukala na mandia. <verse eid="GEN 41:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55"/>Nzala viisongile kwingila mwa Wamisili, wanhu wamulilila Falao yawagwelele mandia. Abaho Falao kawalongela Wamisili wose, “Gendeni ha Usufu na mtende gaja gondayawalongele.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56"/>Nzala vuyenele muisi yose, Usufu kagavugula gamakano na kuwaguzila Wamisili vakuja kwavija nzala ikala mpamanho muisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57"/>Na wanhu wa isi zose weza Misili kugula mandia ha Usufu, kwavija nzala ikala mpamanho muulumwengu wose.<verse eid="GEN 41:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42"/>
  <para style="s1">Wakulu Zake Usufu Wochola Misili Kugula Mandia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1"/>Yakobo viyahulike kamba kuna mandia Misili, kawalongela wanage, “Habali mgendelela kuilola? <verse eid="GEN 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2"/>Nihulika kamba kuna mandia muisi ya Misili, gendeni mkagule giladi sambitudanganhike.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3"/>Avo waja iwakulu zake Usufu longo dimwe wachola Misili kugula mandia. <verse eid="GEN 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4"/>Ila Yakobo halondile Benjamini mdodo wake Usufu yachole na wayage, kwavija kadumba mbuli zihile zodaha kumvika.<verse eid="GEN 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5"/>Avo wana wa Yakobo wakala mmwanza wa awo wacholile kugula vakuja kwavija vivija nzala ingila muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6"/>Usufu kakala mkulu wa isi ya Misili, na heyo iyo yakalile yoguza vakuja ha wanhu wose wa isi ija. Avo wakulu zake Usufu viwavikile, wafugama mavindi wainamila mbaka hasi. <verse eid="GEN 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7"/>Usufu viyawawene wakulu zake, kawatanga ila kaitenda kamba hawatangile, kawauza mkukalika, yowalongela, “Mweye molawa kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Wamwidika, “Tweye tolawa Kanaani, twiza kugula mandia.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8"/>Usufu kawatanga wakulu zake, ila hewo hawamtangile. <verse eid="GEN 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9"/>Abaho kaikumbukila nzozi yake iyawalotile hewo na kuwalongela, “Mweye mwa visepi, mwiza hano kulola hanhu halekile kwimilizwa muisi yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10"/>Wamulongela, “Si vivo, mndewa wangu, watumigwa zako twiza hano kugula mandia. <verse eid="GEN 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11"/>Tweye tose twa wana wa munhu imwe, watumigwa zako hatuli wavwizi. Tweye hatuli visepi.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12"/>Usufu kawalongela, “Si vivo, mwiza hano kulola hanhu halekile kwimilizwa muisi yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13"/>Wamulongela, “Watumigwa zako tukala longo dimwe na wabili, wana wa munhu imwe yokala muisi ya Kanaani, ija ikizuwanda kasigala na tataetu, na imwe kadanganhika.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14"/>Usufu kawalongela, “Kamba viniwalongele, mweye mwa visepi! <verse eid="GEN 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15"/>Vino vivo vondatuwanamate, noiduila ha Falao, hamchola kumwenu mbaka kizuwanda wenu yavike hano. <verse eid="GEN 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16"/>Mtumeni imwe mmwanza wenu yachole kumuwinza kizuwanda wenu. Mweye msigale towagela mkifungo giladi mbuli zenu zumulonga tuzigeze tone kamba molonga kweli ama sio. Kamba si kweli avo noiduila mditwaga da Falao kamba, kweli mweye mwa visepi.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17"/>Na kawagela mkifungo wose hamoja mmazua madatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18"/>Mdizua da ikadatu, Usufu kawalongela, “Muhatenda gondaniwalongele, mowa na ugima kwavija nie nomdumba Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19"/>Kamba mweye hamuli wavwizi, imwe mmwanza wenu nayakale mkifungo muja mumkalile mweye, na mweye msigale gendeni mkasole vakuja mkawagalile wanhu wa mng'anda yenu awo wene nzala, <verse eid="GEN 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20"/>na nigalileni kizuwanda wenu hano, giladi yoneke kamba hamnivwizile, na mkutenda avo hamdanganhika.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:20">Watogola kutenda avo. <verse eid="GEN 42:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21"/>Wakiilongela, “Kweli tolanhigwa sama ya mdodo wetu. Tumona viyakalile yogela bazi, viyakalile yotuyalalila tumonele bazi, ila tweye hatumtegeleze, kino kicho kilamso mgayo uno wiza kumwetu.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22"/>Lubeni kawalongela, “Nie siwalongele kamba sambimumtendele gehile imwana? Ila hamunitegeleze! Sambi topata maliho ga mulopa wake.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23"/>Hawavitangile kamba Usufu kakala yowahulika avija viyakalile yolonga nao kubitila mtapita. <verse eid="GEN 42:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24"/>Usufu kainega na hewo na kusonga kulila, abaho kabweleganya na kulonga nao kabili. Kamsola Simioni na kumfunga hameso gao.<verse eid="GEN 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wakulu Zake Usufu Wobweleganya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25"/>Usufu kawalagiza watumigwa zake wagamemeze vakuja magunia gao, na wawabwezele hela zao mmagunia gao, na wawagwelele mhamba. Na gano gose watendeligwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26"/>Avo waja iwakulu zake Usufu wakweleza vakuja vao mmhunda zao na kuchola. <verse eid="GEN 42:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27"/>Kilo viingile wema, imwe mmwanza wao kafungula gunia jake yasole mandia yamgwelele mhunda wake, kona hela zake hamulomo wa gunia jake. <verse eid="GEN 42:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28"/>Kawalongela wandugu zake, “Hela zangu zibwela azino hano mdigunia jangu.” Mioyo yao ibogoyoka wakiihindukila kuno wogudema, wolonga, “Kinhu chaki kino Mulungu kiyatutendele?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29"/>Viwavikile ha Yakobo tataao muisi ya Kanaani, wamulongela gose gawalawilile. Wamulongela, <verse eid="GEN 42:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30"/>“Munhu imwe yali mkulu wa isi yose ya Misili katulonga mkutukalikila na katutenda kamba vija tweye tukala tucholile kuisepa isi yao. <verse eid="GEN 42:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31"/>Ila tweye tumulongela, ‘Tweye hatuli wavwizi, tweye sio visepi. <verse eid="GEN 42:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32"/>Tweye tukala wanhu longo dimwe na wabili wana wa tata imwe, imwe mmwanza wetu kadanganhika na ikizuwanda kasigala na tataetu ako Kanaani.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33"/>Abaho ija imkulu wa isi katulongela, ‘Vino vivo vondanimtangeni kamba mweye mwa wanhu mulibule wavwizi. Nilekeleni imwe wa ndugu zenu hano na msole mandia mchole mkawagalile wanhu wa mng'anda yenu awo wene nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34"/>Ila nigalileni kizuwanda wenu giladi nivitange kamba mweye sio visepi ila mwa wanhu mulibule uvwizi. Abaho nowabwezela ndugu yenu, na mweye modaha kutenda uchuluzi muisi ino.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35"/>Viwakalile wobakula magunia gao, kila munhu kavika kibweta chake cha hela. Hewo na tataao viwaviwene ivibweta va hela, wadumba. <verse eid="GEN 42:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36"/>Yakobo tataao kawalongela, “Molonda niwagize wanangu wose? Usufu kapotela, Simioni kapotela, na sambi molonda kumsola Benjamini. Kila kinhu chochola mbali na vija vinilonda nie!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37"/>Abaho Lubeni kamulongela tataake, “Kamba sim'bwezile Benjamini kumwako, basi wakome wanangu wano wabili, mwike mmakono gangu nie na nie nom'bweza kumwako.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38"/>Ila Yakobo kalonga, “Mwanangu hadaha kuchola na mweye, mkulu wake kadanganhika na heyo iyo yeiyeka yasigale. Kamba gaham'vika gehile mnzila, na uvyele uno unilinao, mong'homa na giogio.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43"/>
  <para style="s1">Wandugu Zake Usufu Wobweleganya Misili Hamoja na Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1"/>Nzala muisi ya Kanaani ikala mpamanho. <verse eid="GEN 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2"/>Avo viwamambukize kuja mandia gose gawagalile kulawa Misili, tataao kawalongela, “Bweleganyeni Misili mkatugulile kabili mandia.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3"/>Ila Yuda kamulongela, “Ija imunhu katulongela mkuiduila yolonga, ‘Kamba hamwizile na mdodo wenu, hamchona kihanga changu kabili.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4"/>Kamba uhamuleka Benjamini yachole na tweye Misili, tochola kukugulila mandia, <verse eid="GEN 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5"/>ila kamba uhamgomesa, na tweye hatuchola kwavija ija imunhu katulongela, kamba hatucholile na mdodo wetu, hatuchona kihanga chake kabili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6"/>Yakobo kalonga, “Habali mngalile mgayo uno mkumulongela ayo imunhu kamba muna mdodo iyagwe?” <verse eid="GEN 43:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7"/>Wamulongela, “Ija imunhu kakala yotuuzagiza ng'hani, tweye wenyego na mulango wetu, yolonga, ‘Tata wenu yang'hali mgima? Mweye muna mdodo iyagwe?’ Na tweye tumwidika gaja gayakalile youza. Tuhavimanyileze kamba kokwiza kulonga, ‘Mgaleni mdodo wenu hano’?”<verse eid="GEN 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8"/>Abaho Yuda kamulongela Yakobo tataake, “Muleke imwana hamoja na nie tuchole hima, giladi gweye na tweye na wanetu sambitufe nzala. <verse eid="GEN 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9"/>Nie mwenyego iyo zamana wa ugima wake. Kamba habwelile, unigoge nie. Kamba sim'bwezile kumwako na kumwika haulongozi wako, mbuli ino noipapa nie milongo yose. <verse eid="GEN 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10"/>Kamba tuhalekile kukawa, mkipigiti kino tuhabweleganye Misili mianza mibili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11"/>Yakobo tataao kawalongela, “Kamba mbuli zenyego vivo zili, basi tendeni vino, soleni vinhu vinogile va muisi ino vigeleni m'bahasha zenu mumgalile ija imunhu kamba nhunza, soleni zeli kidogo, uki kidogo, ubane, manemane, jozi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Jozi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nzele zilawa mmibiki ya Kanaani, zinoga kudafuna.</char></note> na kungu. <verse eid="GEN 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12"/>Vivija soleni hela mianza mibili ya zija zimcholile nazo haichanduso, kwavija molondigwa m'bweze zija zihela zim'bwezeligwe na kwikigwa mmilomo ya magunia genu, siku wakala wahonyele. <verse eid="GEN 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13"/>Msoleni na ndugu yenu mchole nayo hima ha ija imunhu. <verse eid="GEN 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14"/>Na Mulungu Mwene Mhiko yamtende ija imunhu yawonele mweye bazi, giladi yamulekese ndugu yenu Simioni na Benjamini wabwele hamoja na mweye. Ila kamba nihawagiza wanangu, basi.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15"/>Avo waja iwandugu wasola zinhunza na mianza mibili ya zihela za ichanduso wachola Misili hamoja na Benjamini. Wavika Misili na kwima haulongozi wa Usufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16"/>Usufu viyamonile Benjamini ka hamoja na hewo, kamulongela mtumigwa wa ng'anda yake, “Wasole wanhu wano uwagale kung'anda yangu, chinja mng'onyo na uteleke mandia, kwavija wolondigwa kuja mandia hamoja na nie imisi ya lelo.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17"/>Ija imtumigwa katenda kamba Usufu viyamulongele, kawasola waja iwanhu na kuwagala kung'anda ya Usufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18"/>Viwakalile wogaligwa kung'anda ya Usufu, wakala wodumba ng'hani, wakala wogelegeza wolonga, “Tugaligwa kuno sama ya zija zihela zibwezigwe mmagunia getu mwanza wa ichanduso. Wolonda watuvamhile, na kutuhuma na kututenda tuwe nyakadala na kuwasola mhunda zetu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19"/>Viwavikile halwivi lwa ing'anda ya Usufu, wamcholela ija imtumigwa wa ng'anda ya Usufu, <verse eid="GEN 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20"/>wamulongela, “Chonde, mndewa, tweye tukala twizile hano mwanza wa ichanduso kugula mandia. <verse eid="GEN 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21"/>Ila kilo vikingile twima na vitufungule magunia getu, kila munhu kavika hela yake kiasi kikija hamulomo wa gunia jake. Avo tuzibweza. <verse eid="GEN 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22"/>Vivija twiza na hela ziyagwe za kugula mandia. Hatummanyile yekile hela zetu mmagunia getu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23"/>Ija imtumigwa kawalongela, “Sambimdumbe, Mulungu wenu, Mulungu wa tataenu, kawagwelela hela mmagunia genu. Ila zija zihela zimgulile mandia haichanduso nie nizibokela.” Abaho kamulava Simioni na kumgala kuwakalile hewo.<verse eid="GEN 43:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24"/>Ija imtumigwa kawasola waja iwanhu na kuwengiza mng'anda ya Usufu, kawagwaa mazi ga kugela magulu gao na kuwagwelela mandia mhunda zao. <verse eid="GEN 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25"/>Wasasala nhunza zao sama ya Usufu vondayavike kipigiti cha imisi, kwavija wahulika kamba kokwiza kuja na hewo. <verse eid="GEN 43:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26"/>Usufu viyabwelile ukae, wamgwaa zija zinhunza ziwezile nazo mng'anda, wafugama mavindi, wainamila haulongozi wake mbaka hasi. <verse eid="GEN 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27"/>Kawalamsa abaho kawauza, “Tataenu im'vyele ng'hani imunilongele mpile? Yang'hali mgima?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28"/>Wamulongela, “Tata wetu ayo yali mtumigwa wako yang'hali mgima na mpile.” Wafugama mavindi wainamila mbaka hasi haulongozi wake.<verse eid="GEN 43:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29"/>Abaho Usufu kamulola mdodo wake Benjamini, mwana wa mamaake, kauza, “Ino iyo mdodo wenu ikizuwanda imunilongele? Mulungu yakumoteze, mwanangu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30"/>Abaho Usufu kasegela hima kulawa haja kuno yokona chuhila, Usufu kalawa hanze na kuzahila hanhu ha kulilila. Kachola kugati dilibule munhu na kulila. <verse eid="GEN 43:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31"/>Viyamalile kunava kihanga chake, kalawa hanze na kaizuila sambiyalile, abaho kalonga, “Goleni gamandia.” <verse eid="GEN 43:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32"/>Waja wakalile wogola wamgolela Usufu yeiyeka hameza yake, na waja iwandugu zake wawagolela weiyeka hameza yao. Waja Iwamisili wakalile woja na Usufu wakala weiyeka hameza yao, kwavija Wamisili wakala hawaja hamoja na Waeblania sama ya ndagizi za nhamanila yao. <verse eid="GEN 43:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33"/>Waja iwandugu zake Usufu wakala wakalile mumnhongo kulingana na vija viwavumbuke, songela waichanduso kuvumbuka mbaka waikimambukizo, wokiilola na Usufu. Wakiilola wenyego kwa wenyego kuno wokanganya. <verse eid="GEN 43:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34"/>Mandia gakala gogoligwa kulawa hameza ya Usufu, ila Benjamini kakala yagoleligwe mianza mitano ya vija viwagoleligwe wayagwe. Avo watenda lusona, wang'wa hamoja na heyo kamba viwalondile wenyego.<verse eid="GEN 43:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44"/>
  <para style="s1">Kikasi cha Usufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1"/>Usufu kamulagiza mtumigwa mkulu wa ng'anda yake, yomulongela, “Memeza magunia ga wanhu wano vakuja bwando kamba vowodaha kupapa na ika hela ya kila munhu hamulomo wa gunia jake. <verse eid="GEN 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2"/>Ika kikasi changu cha feza mdigunia da ija ikizuwanda wao hamoja na hela zake ziyezile nazo kugula vakuja.” Na heyo katenda kamba Usufu viyamulagize. <verse eid="GEN 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3"/>Imitondo ng'hani wandugu zake Usufu walekigwa wachole na zao hamoja na mhunda zao. <verse eid="GEN 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4"/>Viwakalile hawanavika kutali na idiwambo, Usufu kamulongela mtumigwa wake, “Genda ukawakweleleze waja iwanhu na uhawavika walongele, ‘Habali mulihile gehile kwa ganogile? <verse eid="GEN 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5"/>Habali mwibile kikasi cha feza cha mndewa wangu? Kino sio kikasi chayang'wilaga mndewa wangu na kutendela uhokozi? Mtenda mbuli ihile ng'hani.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6"/>Ija imtumigwa viyawavikile, kawalongela vivija viyamulongele Usufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7"/>Wamulongela, “Habali mndewa wangu yolonga mbuli kamba ino? Mbuli ino na iwe kutali na tweye watumigwa zako, sambitutende mbuli kamba ino! <verse eid="GEN 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8"/>Hata hela zituvikile mmilomo ya magunia getu kuja Kanaani tukubwezela, avo habali twibe madini ga feza ama zahabu kulawa mng'anda ya mndewa wako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9"/>Kamba imwe wa watumigwa zako yahavikwa nacho nayadanganhike, na tweye wose na tuwe nyakadala wa mndewa wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10"/>Na heyo kawalongela, “Vinoga, na iwe kamba vuulongile. Ila ija yondayavikigwe nacho kowa nyakadala wangu, na mweye mose msigale mochola na zenu.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11"/>Avo kila munhu mmwanza wao hima kahumulusa gunia jake hasi na kudifungula. <verse eid="GEN 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12"/>Abaho ija imtumigwa wa Usufu kasonga kusakula, kasonga gunia da imkulu wao na kumambukizila da imdodo. Na kija ikakasi kivikigwa mdigunia da Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13"/>Waja iwakulu zake wasigale viwonile vija, wadega vivalo vao mkona bwembwe, abaho wakweleza magunia gao mmhunda zao na kubweleganya mdiwambo.<verse eid="GEN 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14"/>Usufu kakala yang'hali mng'anda kipigiti Yuda na wandugu zake viwakalile wobweleganya, waibwanha hasi haulongozi wake, <verse eid="GEN 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15"/>Usufu kawalongela, “Habali mtendile vino? Ham'vitangile kamba munhu kamba nie nodaha kuvumbula vinhu mkulolesa?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16"/>Yuda kalonga, “Tulonge choni kumwako, mndewa, todahaze kuwatenda wanhu watutogole kamba tweye sio wavwizi? Mulungu kavigubula vilozo vetu. Tweye tose twa nyakadala zako, sio ija tu yavikigwe na ikikasi.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17"/>Usufu kalonga, “Si vivo! Mbuli ino na iwe kutali na nie, sambinitende mbuli kamba ino. Ija tu yavikigwe na ikikasi iyo yondayawe nyakadala wangu. Mweye msigale gendeni ukae ha tataenu mditindiwalo.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Koiyalala Giladi Benjamini Yalekesigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18"/>Yuda kamcholela Usufu na kulonga, “Chonde, mndewa wangu, nileke nie mtumigwa wako nikulongele mbuli imwe gweye mndewa wangu, sambiunyonele lusango kwavija gweye kwa kamba Falao mwenyego. <verse eid="GEN 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19"/>Mndewa, gweye kukala utuuzile ulonga, ‘Mweye muna tata ama ndugu iyagwe?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20"/>Na tweye tukwidika, tulonga, ‘Tweye tuna tata m'vyele ng'hani na mdodo wetu mzuwanda yavumbuke muuvyele wake. Mkulu wake kadanganhika, na heyo iyo mwana yeiyeka yasigale mmwanza wa wana wa mamaake, na tataake kamnogela ng'hani.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21"/>Abaho kutulongela tumgale hano kumwako umone na meso gako, <verse eid="GEN 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22"/>na tweye tukulongela, ‘Havidahika mwana ija kusegela ha tataake, kamba yahasegela, tataake kodanganhika.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23"/>Na gweye kulonga, ‘Kamba hamwizile na mdodo wenu hano, hamuchona kabili kihanga changu.’<verse eid="GEN 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24"/>“Vitubwelile ha mtumigwa wako, ayo yali tataangu, tumulongela gaja gaulongele, mndewa wangu. <verse eid="GEN 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25"/>Na tataetu viyatulongele, ‘Gendeni kabili mkatugulile mandia,’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26"/>tumulongela, ‘Hatuchola, ila kamba mdodo wetu imzuwanda yahachola hamoja na tweye basi tochola, kwavija hatuchona kihanga cha ija imunhu mbaka mdodo wetu imzuwanda yachole hamoja na tweye.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27"/>Abaho mtumigwa wako ayo yali tataangu katulongela, ‘M'vitanga kamba mwehe wangu kandelela nie wana wabili wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28"/>Imwe kapotela, na nie nilonga, “Kadegigwa vidangavidanga na mng'onyo.” Na sinamona songela kipigiti kija. <verse eid="GEN 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29"/>Na kamba muhamsola na ino, gaham'vika gehile na uvyele uno unilinao, mong'homa na giogio.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30"/>“Avo kamba tuhabwela ukae ha mtumigwa wako ayo yali tataangu bila mwana ino kuwa hamoja na tweye, na avija ugima wake vuuifungile hamoja na ugima wa mwana ino, <verse eid="GEN 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31"/>yahona kamba imwana hali hamoja na tweye, kodanganhika, avo tweye watumigwa zako tomkoma na giogio tataetu m'vyele. <verse eid="GEN 44:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32"/>Kwavija nie mtumigwa wako iyo nisolile zamana ha tataangu nilonga, ‘kamba sim'bwezile kumwako, nie iyo yondaniipape mbuli ino muugima wangu wose.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33"/>Avo nileke nie mtumigwa wako nisigale hano kamba nyakadala wako nisole hanhu ha mwana ino, giladi umuleke ino imwana yabwele ukae na wakulu zake. <verse eid="GEN 44:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34"/>Kwavija nodahaze kubwela ukae ha tataangu kamba ino imwana hali hamoja na nie? Nodumba kona mgayo wondaumpate tataangu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45"/>
  <para style="s1">Usufu Koitambula ha Ndugu Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1"/>Usufu hadahile kuizuila haulongozi wa waja wose wemile haulongozi wake, avo kenula dizwi kawalongela watumigwa zake wawasegeze Wamisili wakalile muja mdigati, kalonga, “Wasegezeni hano hamwangu.” Avo haduhu Mmisili yakalile behi na heyo kipigiti viyaitambule ha wandugu zake. <verse eid="GEN 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2"/>Avo kalila na dizwi kulu mbaka Wamisili wahulika, na kuchola kuwalongela wanhu wa ng'anda ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3"/>Usufu kawalongela wandugu zake, “Nie iyo Usufu! Tataangu yang'hali mgima?” Ila wandugu zake hawamwidike, kwavija wadumba. <verse eid="GEN 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4"/>Abaho Usufu kawalongela wandugu zake, “Nikwenhukileni.” Viwakwenhuke, kalonga, “Nie iyo ndugu yenu Usufu, ayo imumguzile hano Misili! <verse eid="GEN 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5"/>Avo sambimdungwedungwe ama kuiyonela lusango sama ya kuniguza nie hano, kwavija Mulungu kanituma nie nilongole kwiza hano sama ya kukombola ugima wa wanhu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6"/>Kwavija sambi milao mibili ibita songela nzala viingile muisi, na milao mitano ikwiza hakuwa na kulima ama kuhuna. <verse eid="GEN 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7"/>Ila Mulungu kanituma niwalongole giladi niwakombole mweye na ukombola mkulu, mweye hamoja na wanenu na kuwatenda wanhu bwando wawe na ugima muisi. <verse eid="GEN 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8"/>Avo sio mweye mungalile nie hano ila Mulungu. Mulungu kanhenda nie niwe tata ha Falao,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Tata ha Falao</char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Usufu kakala iyo mulava masala wa Falao.</char></note> mkulu wa ng'anda yake yose, na mtawala wa isi yose ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9"/>“Avo lopoleni m'bweleganye ha tataangu mkamulongele vino, ‘Vino vivo mwanago Usufu viyolonga, “Mulungu kanitenda nie kuwa mkulu wa isi yose ya Misili, izo sambiukawe. <verse eid="GEN 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10"/>Kokwiza kukala hanhu hokemigwa Gosheni behi na nie, gweye, wanago, wazukulu zako, ng'ombe na menhe zako, na vose vuulinavo. <verse eid="GEN 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11"/>Uhavika haja, nie nokugwelela kila kinhu kwavija kuna milao mitano ya nzala ikwiza. Kamba si hivo, gweye na wanhu wa ng'anda yako na waja wose wali hamoja na gweye mofa nzala.” ’<verse eid="GEN 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12"/>“Na sambi meso genu na meso ga mdodo wangu Benjamini gonyona kamba nie iyo Usufu mwenyego. <verse eid="GEN 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13"/>Mulongeleni tataangu vija vinihishimilwa ng'hani muisi ya Misili na gose gaja gamonile. Hima mgaleni tataangu hano.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14"/>Abaho Usufu kamkumbatila mdodo wake Benjamini msingo na kusonga kulila, na Benjamini vivija kamkumbatila Usufu na kusonga kulila. <verse eid="GEN 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15"/>Usufu kawanonela wandugu zake wose kuno yolila. Viyeshile kutenda vija, wandugu zake wasonga kulongelela nayo.<verse eid="GEN 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16"/>Mbuli zija vuzivikile mng'anda da Falao kamba ndugu zake Usufu weza, Falao na wakulu zake wose wa silikali wanogelwa ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17"/>Falao kamulongela Usufu, “Walongele wandugu zako, ‘Tendeni vino, wafungasheni wang'onyo zenu, m'bwele muisi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18"/>msoleni tataenu hamoja na wanhu wose wali mng'anda yenu mwize kumwangu, nie nowagwelela hanhu hanogile ng'hani muisi ya Misili na monogelwa na udekedeke wa muisi.’ <verse eid="GEN 45:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19"/>Vivija walongele, ‘Tendeni vino, soleni mikwama kulawa Misili ya kuwapapila wanenu na watwanzi zenu na mumsole tataenu mwize nayo hano. <verse eid="GEN 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20"/>Sambimgese ng'hani mmbuli ya kuvileka vinhu venu, ila kinhu cha kukigesa ng'hani icho kino, Misili yowa yenu mweye.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21"/>Wana wa Yakobo, ayo vivija yakemigwe Islaeli, watenda kamba viwalongeligwe na Falao, Usufu kawagwelela mikwama kamba viyalagize Falao abaho kawagwelela mhamba. <verse eid="GEN 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22"/>Vivija kawagwelela kila imwe vivalo va sambi, ila Benjamini kamgwelela vidanga mia ndatu va feza hamoja na vivalo vitano va kusaula. <verse eid="GEN 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23"/>Na kamulagizila tataake mhunda longo dimwe wapapile vinhu vinogile va Kimisili na mhunda longo dimwe wa kitwanzi wapapile vakuja na mikate na mhamba. <verse eid="GEN 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24"/>Abaho kawaleka ndugu zake wachole, viwakalile wochola, kawalongela, “Sambimgombe mnzila.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25"/>Wahalawa muisi ya Misili na kuchola ha tataao Yakobo muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26"/>Wamulongela tataao, “Usufu yang'hali mgima! Tena heyo iyo mtawala wa isi yose ya Misili.” Yakobo kasinhuka, hatogole gaja gayalongeligwe.<verse eid="GEN 45:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27"/>Ila viwamulongele mbuli zose Usufu ziyawalongele, na viyonile ija imikwama Usufu iyaitumile impape heyo yachole Misili, moyo wa Yakobo usamhuka. <verse eid="GEN 45:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28"/>Na Yakobo kalonga, “Nokona, kweli mwanangu Usufu mgima. Nochola nikamone kipigiti sinadanganhika.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46"/>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo na Mulango Wake Wochola Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1"/>Yakobo kafungasha vinhu vose viyakalile navo na kuchola Beeli-Sheba kulava nhosa ha Mulungu wa tataake Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2"/>Mulungu kalonga na Yakobo mnzozi kamkema na kulonga, “Yakobo, Yakobo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Yakobo kedika, “Nie hano.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3"/>Mulungu kalonga, “Nie iyo Mulungu wa tataako, sambiudumbe kuchola Misili, kwavija ako nokutenda gweye kuwa undewa mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4"/>Nie nochola na gweye Misili na nolubweza lukolo lwako kabili muisi ino. Na gweye kodanganhikila mmakono ga Usufu.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5"/>Avo Yakobo kasegela Beeli-Sheba. Wanage wamsola Yakobo tataao na wana zao na watwanzi zao wawagela mmikwama iyawagalile Falao. <verse eid="GEN 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6"/>Wasola fugo zao, na vinhu viwakalile navo haja Kanaani. Yakobo na lukolo lwake lose wachola Misili. <verse eid="GEN 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7"/>Kachola hamoja na wanage wa kitwanzi na wa kimbigalo na wazukulu zake wa kitwanzi na wa kimbigalo. Lukolo lwake lose kalugala Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wana wa Yakobo wacholile Misili. Mwana wa ichanduso wa Yakobo kakala Lubeni. <verse eid="GEN 46:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9"/>Wana wa Lubeni wakala Hanoki, Palu, Heziloni, na Kami. <verse eid="GEN 46:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Simioni. Wana wa Simioni wakala Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Zohali, na Shauli. Shauli kakala mwana iyamulelile na mtwanzi wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Lawi. Wana wa Lawi wakala Gelishoni, Kohasi, na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Yuda. Wana wa Yuda wakala Eli, Onani, Shela, Pelezi, na Zela. Ila Eli na Onani wadanganhikila muisi ya Kanaani. Wana wa Pelezi wakala Heziloni na Hamulu. <verse eid="GEN 46:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Isakali. Wana wa Isakali wakala Tola, Puva, Jashubu, na Shimloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Zabuloni. Wana wa Zabuloni wakala Seledi, Eloni, na Jaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15"/>Wano wao wana wa Lea iyamulelele Yakobo ako Padani-Alamu uhasegeza mndele wake Dina. Mheta ya wanhu wa lukolo lwa Yakobo watwanzi na wambigalo kubitila Lea, wose kwa wose wakala malongo madatu na wadatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Gadi. Wana wa Gadi wakala Zifoni, Hagi, Shuni, Eziboni, Eli, Alodi, na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Asheli. Wana wa Asheli wakala Imna, Ishiva, Ishivi, Belia, na lumbu jao Sela. Wana wa Belia wakala Hebeli na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18"/>Ino iyo mheta ya wanhu wa lukolo lwa Yakobo kubitila Zilpa, ayo Labani iyamgwelele mwanage Lea yawe mtumigwa wake, wose kwa wose wakala longo dimwe na sita.<verse eid="GEN 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19"/>Usufu na Benjamini wano wao wana wa Yakobo waleligwe na mtwanzi wake yokemigwa Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 46:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20"/>Manase na Eflaim wakala wana wa Usufu iyamulelele Asinati mwanage Potifela, mkulu wa nhambiko wa wambo da Heliopoli, muisi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 46:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21"/>Wana wa Benjamini wakala Bela, Becha, Ashibeli, Gela, Naamani, Ehi, Loshi, Mupim, Hupim, na Adi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22"/>Ino iyo mheta ya wanhu wa lukolo lwa Yakobo kubitila Laheli, wose kwa wose wakala longo dimwe na wane.<verse eid="GEN 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Dani. Mwana wa Dani kakala Hushim. <verse eid="GEN 46:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24"/>Mwana iyagwe wa Yakobo kakala Naftali. Wana wa Naftali wakala Jazeeli, Guni, Jezeli, na Shilem. <verse eid="GEN 46:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25"/>Ino iyo mheta ya wanhu wa lukolo lwa Yakobo kubitila Bilha, ayo Labani iyamgwelele mwanage Laheli yawe mtumigwa wake, wose kwa wose wakala saba.<verse eid="GEN 46:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26"/>Wanhu wacholile Misili hamoja na Yakobo, awo wakalile wa lukolo lwake Yakobo, uhawalava watwanzi wa wanage, wakala wanhu malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="GEN 46:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27"/>Uhongeza wana wabili wa Usufu iyawalelile Misili, wanhu wakalile wolawa mulukolo lwa Yakobo wakalile wacholile Misili wakala malongo saba.<verse eid="GEN 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo na Mulango Wake Wovika Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28"/>Viwakalile wokwenhukila kuvika, Yakobo kamtuma Yuda yalongole yachole ha Usufu yakamulagile inzila icholile Gosheni. Viwavikile muisi ya Gosheni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29"/>Usufu kengila mdikwama jake na kuchola Gosheni kuiting'hana na tataake Yakobo, viwaiting'hane Usufu kamkumbatila tataake msingo na kulila ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 46:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30"/>Yakobo kamulongela Usufu, “Sambi nihadanganhika, haduhu mbuli kwavija nikona nene mwenyego kamba ung'hali mgima.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31"/>Abaho Usufu kawalongela wandugu zake na wanhu wa mulango wa tataake, kalonga, “Nochola nikamulongele Falao kamba ndugu zangu na wose wali mng'anda ya tataangu weza kumwangu kulawa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32"/>Nomulongela kamba wanhu wano wafugaga wang'onyo avo weza na madale gao ga ng'hondolo, menhe, na ng'ombe na kila kinhu kiwalinacho. <verse eid="GEN 46:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33"/>Avo Falao yahawakema na kuwauza mna sang'hano yaki imtendaga, <verse eid="GEN 46:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34"/>mulongeleni kamba, ‘Mazua gose tweye watumigwa zako tochunga wang'onyo, kamba wahenga zetu viwakalile wotenda.’ Mkulonga vino kowaleka mkale muisi ya Gosheni.” Usufu kalonga vino kwavija wanhu wa Misili wakala wawehile ng'hani wachunga wang'onyo sama ya ndagizi za nhamanila yao.<verse eid="GEN 46:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1"/>Avo Usufu kachola na kumulongela Falao, kalonga, “Tataangu na wandugu zangu hamoja na madale gao ga ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na vinhu vao vose viwali navo weza kulawa Kanaani na sambi wa muisi ya Gosheni hano Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2"/>Kawasola wanhu watano mmwanza wa wandugu zake na kuwagala haulongozi wa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3"/>Falao kawauza, “Mna sang'hano yaki imtendaga?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Walonga, “Mndewa, tweye twa wachunga wang'onyo kamba viwakalile wotenda wahenga zetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4"/>Twiza kukala muisi ino kwavija kuna iisi ya Kanaani kuna nzala mpamanho, na wang'onyo wa watumigwa zako wabule mijani. Avo tokuyalalila, utuleke watumigwa zako tukale hano Gosheni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5"/>Falao kamulongela Usufu, “Tataako na wandugu zako weza kumwako, <verse eid="GEN 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6"/>avo sagula hanhu hohose muisi ya Misili hawanogele hewo kukala, mwike tataako na wandugu zako hanhu hanogile ng'hani muna iisi, wagale wakakale muisi ya Gosheni, na kamba kuna wanhu mmwanza wao wali na udaho, watende kuwa wemilizi wa wang'onyo wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7"/>Abaho Usufu kamwingiza mng'anda tataake Yakobo, na kumwika haulongozi wa Falao, na Yakobo kammoteza Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8"/>Falao kamulongela Yakobo, “Kuna milao mingahi songela hauvumbuke?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9"/>Yakobo kamulongela Falao, “Milao yangu ya kutembela muisi ivika mia na malongo madatu, milao yangu ikala midodo, imemile migayo, hailingile na milao ya wahenga zangu kipigiti viwakalile wotembela muisi.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10"/>Abaho Yakobo kammoteza Falao mwanza wa ikabili na kusegela. <verse eid="GEN 47:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11"/>Avo Usufu kaweka tataake na ndugu zake muisi ya Misili na kuwagwelela hanhu hanogile muisi ija behi na kiwambo kikemigwa Lamesesi kamba Falao viyalagize. <verse eid="GEN 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12"/>Usufu kawagwelela mandia tataake, ndugu zake, na wose wakalile mng'anda ya tataake, kulingana na mheta ya wana zao.<verse eid="GEN 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13"/>Nzala ikala mpamanho, kukala haduhu mandia muisi yose ya Misili na isi ya Kanaani, na wanhu wasonga kunyolila sama ya nzala. <verse eid="GEN 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14"/>Wanhu kulawa Misili na kulawa Kanaani viwakalile wogula vakuja, Usufu kazikunzanya hela zose na kuzigala kung'anda ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15"/>Hela za wanhu wa Misili na za wanhu wa Kanaani vuzimalile, wanhu wose wa Misili weza ha Usufu na kumulongela, “Tugwelele mandia. Habali tudanganhike hameso gako? Kwavija hela zetu zose zimala.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16"/>Usufu kawedika, “Kamba hela zenu zimala, basi natuibadilishe, ngweleleni wang'onyo zenu wa kufuga, na nie nowagwelela mandia.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17"/>Avo wagala wang'onyo zao wa kufuga ha Usufu, na heyo kawagwelela mandia mkuibadilisha na falasi, ng'hondolo, menhe, ng'ombe, na mhunda. Avo mulao uja kawagwelela wanhu mandia mkuibadilisha na wang'onyo zao wose wa kufuga.<verse eid="GEN 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18"/>Mulao uja umala, vuusongile mulao uyagwe, wamwizila na kulonga, “Hatudaha kumfisa mndewa wetu kweli ino, kamba, hela zetu zimala, na wang'onyo zetu wa mmakono gako, twabule kinhu kisigale ila ng'huli zetu na migunda yetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19"/>Habali tweye tudanganhike hameso gako na migunda yetu ibanangike? Tugule tweye hamoja na migunda yetu mkutubadilisha na mandia. Tweye hamoja na migunda yetu towa nyakadala wa Falao. Tugwelele mbeyu giladi sambitudanganhike, na migunda yetu sambiigaluke luwala.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20"/>Avo Usufu kamgulila Falao migunda yose ya Misili. Wamisili wose waguza migunda yao, kwavija nzala ikala mpamanho na migunda yose ikala ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21"/>Na wanhu wose kulawa ng'ambu imwe ya isi mbaka ng'ambu iyagwe ya isi kawatenda kuwa nyakadala. <verse eid="GEN 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22"/>Migunda ilekile kuguligwa ikala migunda ya wakulu wa nhambiko kwavija wakulu wa nhambiko wakala wobokela mandia kulawa ha Falao, avo wakala bule kilamso cha kuguzila migunda yao <verse eid="GEN 47:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23"/>Usufu kawalongela wanhu, “Loleni, lelo niwagula mweye hamoja na migunda yenu muwe wa Falao, zino hano mbeyu, soleni mkahande mmigunda. <verse eid="GEN 47:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24"/>Kipigiti cha kuhuna kihavika, molondigwa mumgwelele Falao fungu dimwe kulawa mmafungu matano ga vakuja na mafungu mane gasigale msole mweye mkeke mbeyu na gawe mandia genu mweye na wanhu wose wali nzing'anda zenu hamoja na wanenu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25"/>Wamulongela, “Mndewa, gweye kuukombola ugima wetu na kututendela ganogile, na tweye towa nyakadala wa Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26"/>Avo Usufu kaditenda dija diwe lagizo da isi muisi yose ya Misili, na lagizo dino dosang'hanika mbaka lelo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:26 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka lelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti vichandikigwe kitabu kino.</char></note> kamba fungu dimwe kulawa mmafungu matano dochola ha Falao, na migunda ya wakulu wa nhambiko iyo iiyeka ilekile kuwa migunda ya Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Kopula Kinhu cha Ikimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27"/>Waislaeli wakala muisi ya Misili hanhu hokemigwa Gosheni, aho kuwapatile ugoli na kuwa na wana bwando na kongezeka ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 47:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28"/>Yakobo kakala muisi ya Misili milao longo dimwe na saba, avo milao ya Yakobo yose kwa yose ikala mia na malongo mane na saba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29"/>Kipigiti cha Yakobo kudanganhika vukikwenhuke, kamkema mwanage Usufu na kumulongela, “Kamba kweli nie ningila mmoyo wako, ika mkono wako hasi ya haza jangu uniduilile kamba konitendela galibule uzenzeleganye na gali kweli kamba hunizika muisi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30"/>Nihadanganhika, unisegeze hano muisi ya Misili ukanizike kuwazikigwe wahenga zangu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Usufu kamwidika, yolonga, “Notenda kamba vowolonga.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31"/>Yakobo kamulongela Usufu, “Niduilile kamba kotenda avo.” Avo Usufu kamduilila Yakobo. Abaho Yakobo kainamila mulusazi lwake.<verse eid="GEN 47:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48"/>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo Kowamoteza Eflaim na Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1"/>Mazua madodo hamwande, Usufu kalongeligwa kamba tataake kolumwa, avo Usufu kawasola wanage wabili Manase na Eflaim na kuchola nao ha tataake. <verse eid="GEN 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2"/>Yakobo viyalongeligwe kamba, “Mwanago Usufu kabaha,” kaigagahiza, kenuka, kakala mulusazi. <verse eid="GEN 48:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3"/>Yakobo kamulongela Usufu, “Mulungu Mwene Mhiko kandawilila nie hanhu hokemigwa Luzi, kuna iisi ya Kanaani, na kunimoteza, <verse eid="GEN 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4"/>na kunilongela, ‘Nokugwelela wana bwando na kulongeza lukolo lwako. Nowatenda mweye kuwa wanhu bwando, na isi ino nolugwelela lukolo lwako iwe yao milongo yose.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5"/>Yakobo kagendelela, “Avo wanago wabili wavumbuke muisi ino kipigiti sinakwiza hano wowa wangu nie, Eflaim na Manase wowa wangu nie kamba viwali Lubeni na Simioni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6"/>Wana wondawavumbuke hachugu chao wowa wako gweye, na wopata uhazi kubitila wakulu zao, Eflaim na Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7"/>Kipigiti vunikalile nibwela kulawa Padani,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Padani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kicho kiguhi cha </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Padani-Alamu, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mditwaga diyagwe </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mesopotamia.</char></note> Laheli kadanganhika muisi ya Kanaani kipigiti vutukalile tung'hali mnzila behibehi na Eflati. Avo nimzika mumgwazo wa inzila ichola Eflati.” Eflati dijo wambo da Betelehemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8"/>Yakobo viyawonile wana wa Usufu, kalonga, “Kina nani wano?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9"/>Usufu kamulongela tataake, “Wano iwo wanangu Mulungu iyanigwelele hano, muisi ya Misili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Yakobo kalonga, “Wagale hano hamwangu niwamoteze.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10"/>Meso ga Yakobo gakala gavulale sama ya ulazi, na hadahile kulola goya. Avo Usufu kawagala wanage behi na heyo, na tataake kawanonela na kuwakumbatila. <verse eid="GEN 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11"/>Yakobo kamulongela Usufu, “Sitamanile kona kihanga chako kabili, ila sambi Mulungu kanhenda niwone na wanago.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12"/>Abaho Usufu kawasegeza wanage kulawa hana gamahaza ga tataake, kafugama mavindi kainamila mbaka hasi.<verse eid="GEN 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13"/>Usufu kawasola wanage wabili, na kumwika Eflaim kumkono wa ukumoso wa Yakobo na Manase kumkono wa ukulume. <verse eid="GEN 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14"/>Ila Yakobo kagagombekeza makono gake kawika mkono wake wa ukulume mditwi da Eflaim ayo yakalile imdodo, na mkono wake wa ukumoso mditwi da Manase ayo yakalile imkulu. <verse eid="GEN 48:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15"/>Abaho kammoteza Usufu na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Mulungu yakalile yotambikilwa na Ablaham na Isaka, wahenga zangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">Mulungu yakalile mchunga wangu mkipigiti chose mbaka lelo,<verse eid="GEN 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16"/>msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga yanikombole nie mmigayo yose, yawamoteze wamhale wano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Watende twaga jangu na matwaga ga wahenga zangu Ablaham na Isaka gagendelele kutangigwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Wapate wana bwando wongezeke ng'hani muisi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17"/>Usufu viyonile kamba tataake keka mkono wake wa ukulume mditwi da Eflaim, hanogelwe, avo kageza kuusegeza mkono wa tataake mditwi da Eflaim yawike mditwi da Manase, <verse eid="GEN 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18"/>Usufu kamulongela tataake, “Sio hivo, tataangu, kwavija ino iyo imkulu, ika mkono wako wa ukulume mditwi da ino.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19"/>Ila tataake kalema na kulonga, “Novimanya, mwanangu, novimanya. Manase vivija kowa munhu wa wanhu bwando, na heyo vivija kowa munhu mkulu. Ila mdodo wake kowa mkulu ng'hani kum'banza heyo, na lukolo lwake lowa madale ga ndewa.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20"/>Avo zua dija kawamoteza, yolonga, “Waislaeli wogatambula matwaga genu kipigiti cha kumoteza, wolonga, ‘Mulungu yawatende mweye kamba Eflaim na Manase.’ ” Mkutenda vino, Yakobo kamwika Eflaim haulongozi wa Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21"/>Abaho Yakobo kamulongela Usufu, “Nie na mmabehi kudanganhika, ila Mulungu kowa hamoja na mweye na kowabweza kabili kuna iisi ya wahenga zenu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22"/>Hamgwazo wa gaja ganiwagwelele ndugu zako, nokugwelela gweye isi ya Shekemu kamba nyongeza, isi ili na udeke iniisolile na mhinde na zele jangu kulawa ha Waamoli.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli za Kimambukizo za Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1"/>Abaho Yakobo kawakema wanage na kulonga, “Nikwenhukileni niwalongele gaja gondagawalawilile mmazua ga hamwande.<verse eid="GEN 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2"/>“Iduganyeni hamoja mtegeleze, mweye wana wa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:2">Mtegelezeni tataenu, Islaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3"/>“Lubeni, gweye iyo mwanangu wa udele, gweye iyo mhiko yangu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">na mwana wa ichanduso wa umhale wangu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">Gweye iyo mkulu kubanza wose, na kuna mhiko kuwabanza wose.<verse eid="GEN 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4"/>Gweye kwa kamba mmemo wa mazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">ila hauwa wa ichanduso tena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">kwavija gweye kuwasa na mtwanzi wangu wa kunze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">na kulunyolodosa lusazi lwa tataako.<verse eid="GEN 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5"/>“Simioni na Lawi hewo iwo ndugu, mizele yao iyo via va kutendela ukaini.<verse eid="GEN 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6"/>Siilumba hamoja nao kipigiti wahanyong'onya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">ama kuwa hamoja nao mmiting'hano yao,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">kwavija sama ya lusango lwao, wawakoma wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">na kuwagela ulemale ng'ombe sama ya mchezo.<verse eid="GEN 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7"/>Ndukumiza na iwe mulusango lwao, kwavija lukali ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">ndukumiza na iwe mng'hasilika zao, kwavija wana ng'hasilika ya kikaini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Ng'holo zao nozipwililisila mwa wanhu wa lukolo lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">nozipwililisila muisi yose ya Islaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8"/>“Yuda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Yuda mwenyego, ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> wandugu zako wokuyenzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">mkono wako wowa msingo ya wadumuka zako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">Wandugu zako wokufugamila mavindi na kukwinamilila.<verse eid="GEN 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9"/>Yuda, mwanangu, ka kamba mwana simba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">kovikoma vija voyopelemba na kuvibweza ukae yake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">kokiigolosa na kutambalala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Haduhu munhu yogeza kumgaza.<verse eid="GEN 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10"/>Fimbo ya kindewa haisegela mumkono wa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">na fimbo ya kindewa haisegela hana gamagulu gake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">mbaka vondayeze ayo mwene fimbo yake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">ayo yondayahishimilwe na ndewa zose.<verse eid="GEN 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11"/>Komfunga mwana mhunda wake mmizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">hana imizabibu inogile ng'hani,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yuda kowa na mizabibu bwando mbaka hona vihile kuwafunga wana mhunda zake mmizabibu. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">kosuluza vivalo vake mdivai ndung'hu ng'hani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yuda kowa na divai bwando mbaka iyagwe kosuluzila vivalo vake. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12"/>Meso gake madung'hu kubanza divai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yuda kong'wa divai bwando mbaka meso gake gowa madung'hu kamba divai.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:12">meno gake mazelu kubanza matombo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yuda kong'wa matombo bwando ga ng'ombe mbaka meno gake gowa mazelu kamba matombo. </char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13"/>“Zabuloni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Zabuloni mwenyego, ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> kokala behi na mgwazo wa bahali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">na hanhu hoyokala heyo howa bandali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">undewa wake wovika kutali mbaka wambo da Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14"/>“Isakali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Isakali mwenyego, ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> kowa kamba mhunda mwene mhiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:14">yatambalale hagatigati ya misogi yake,<verse eid="GEN 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15"/>kuno yohalola haja hayatambalale vihanogile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">na vija ija iisi viinogile.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">Avo koganamiza maega gake yaipape imisogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">na koigagahiza kusang'hanika kamba nyakadala.<verse eid="GEN 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16"/>“Dani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Dani mwenyego, ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> kowa mtawala wa wanhu zake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:16">Wowa kamba mitala iyagwe ya Islaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17"/>Dani kowa kamba nyoka hamgwazo wa idigwang'wando,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">nyoka yali na sumu hamgwazo wa inzila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">yomulumiza falasi mkisiginho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">avo ija yali uchana ya ifalasi kolagalila kukisogo.<verse eid="GEN 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18"/>“Noubeta ukombola wako, MNDEWA.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yakobo koubeta ukombola wa Mndewa kulawa ha wadumuka zake.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19"/>“Gadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Gadi mwenyego, ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> kovamhilwa na mibokonyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:19">ila heyo kowavamhila m'visiginho vao.<verse eid="GEN 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20"/>“Migunda ya Asheli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Asheli mwenyego, ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> yolava vakuja bwando,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:20">kowa na mandia ga kuimemeza ng'anda ya mndewa.<verse eid="GEN 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21"/>“Naftali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Naftali mwenyego, ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> iyo mnokela yailegehe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:21">yolela wana wanogile.<verse eid="GEN 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22"/>“Usufu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Usufu mwenyego ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> ka kamba m'biki ulelile mujo, uli behi na nzokwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:22">matambi gake gokwela hata kukibanza kiwambaza.<verse eid="GEN 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23"/>Wadumuka zake wam'vamhila na lusango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:23">wamwasila misale na kumgaza ng'hani.<verse eid="GEN 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24"/>Ila mhinde yake igendelela kuwa na mhiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">na makono gake gagangamala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">sama ya Mulungu wa Yakobo Mwene Mhiko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">ayo vivija yokemigwa Mchunga, Dibwe da Islaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25"/>Mulungu wa tataako inimtambikila nie yakutaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Mulungu Mwene Mhiko yakumoteze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">kokumoteza motelo za mvula kulawa uchana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">na mazi bwando kulawa hasi ya isi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">motelo za wang'onyo wofugigwa na wana.<verse eid="GEN 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26"/>Motelo za tataako ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">kubanza motelo za migongo ya umwaka, zovika kuna zisota za ivigongo va gunge na gunge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Motelo zino zose nazikale mditwi da Usufu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nhegulo ya mnhongo uno iyo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Usufu kobokela motelo bwando kuwabanza wandugu zake.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">ayo yali mndewa hagatigati ya ndugu zake.<verse eid="GEN 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27"/>“Benjamini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sio Benjamini mwenyego, ila lukolo lwake.</char></note> ka kamba mbwizi mkali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">imitondo na ichungulo kogoga na kuja.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28"/>Ino iyo mitala longo dimwe na mibili ya Islaeli, na gano gago gayalongile tataao kipigiti viyakalile yowalaga. Kammoteza kila imwe na motelo ziwalingile.<verse eid="GEN 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ifa na Mazisi ga Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29"/>Abaho Yakobo kawalongela wanage, “Nie na mmabehi kudanganhika. Mnizike hamoja na wahenga zangu muimhango, mumgunda wa Efloni ija Imuhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30"/>mhango ili mumgunda wa Makipela, behi na Mamle kuja Kanaani. Mhango iyagulile Ablaham kulawa ha Efloni Muhiti, hamoja na umgunda hawe hanhu ha kuzikila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31"/>Kuja kuyazikigwe Ablaham hamoja na mtwanzi wake Sala, haja kuwazikigwe Isaka na mtwanzi wake Lebeka, na haja baho hanimzikile Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32"/>Mgunda uja, uli na mhango mgati yake, uguligwa kulawa ha Muhiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33"/>Yakobo viyamambukize kulava ndagizi zino ha wanage, kakunza magulu gake mkisazi, kadanganhika na kuilumba hamoja na wahenga zake.<verse eid="GEN 49:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1"/>Usufu kainamilila kukihanga cha tataake na kumkumbatila, kamulilila na kumnonela. <verse eid="GEN 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2"/>Abaho Usufu kawalagiza waganga wake wam'bake tataake dawa giladi sambiyole, avo waja iwaganga wam'baka Yakobo dawa ya kuzuila kola. <verse eid="GEN 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3"/>Wam'baka dawa ija mmazua malongo mane, kwavija kino kicho kipigiti kilondigwa kubakigwa dawa munhu yadanganhike. Wamisili wamulilila Yakobo mmazua malongo saba.<verse eid="GEN 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4"/>Mazua ga kumulilila Yakobo vugamalile, Usufu kawalongela wakulu wa ng'anda ya Falao, “Nowayalalila, soleni usenga uno mumgalile Falao, <verse eid="GEN 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5"/>‘Tataangu viyakalile behi na kudanganhika, kanilongela nimduilile kamba nomzika mdipanga diyahimbile muisi ya Kanaani. Avo nileke nichole nikamzike tataangu abaho nobwela.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6"/>Falao kamulongela, “Genda ukamzike tataako kamba vuumduilile kamba kotenda avo.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7"/>Avo Usufu kachola kumzika tataake. Kasindikizigwa na watumigwa wose wa Falao hamoja na wakulu wose wa ng'anda ya Falao na wakulu wose wa isi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8"/>Vivija Usufu kawasola watumigwa wose wa ng'anda yake na wandugu zake na wanhu wose wakalile mng'anda ya tataake. Ila wana zao, madale gao ga ng'hondolo, na madale ga ng'ombe zao wao wasigale Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9"/>Waja wogala mikwama na wakwela falasi vivija wachola hamoja na heyo. Dikala dale kulu ng'hani da wanhu.<verse eid="GEN 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10"/>Viwavikile hana ulubuga lwa kwanikila ngano lukemigwa Atadi, lukalile ng'ambu ya ulawilo wa zua wa Lwanda lwa Yolodani, wagegemeza na dizwi kulu na usungu mkulu ng'hani umemile giogio, Usufu kakala haja mkipigiti cha mazua saba yomulilila tataake. <verse eid="GEN 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11"/>Wenekae wa Kanaani viwonile kililo kija haja halubuga lwa kwanikila ngano lukemigwa Atadi, walonga, “Wamisili wana mting'hano wa kililo.” Kino kicho kilamso hanhu haja behi na Yolodani hokemigwa Abeli-Misili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abeli-Misili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ulinga na ulonzi wa Kieblania ulonga </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kililo cha Wamisili.</char></note><verse eid="GEN 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12"/>Wana wa Yakobo watenda kamba viyawalagize, <verse eid="GEN 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13"/>wampapa Yakobo mbaka kuisi ya Kanaani na kumzika muimhango, mumgunda wa Makipela behi na Mamle, awo Ablaham uyaugulile kulawa ha Efloni Muhiti, hawe hanhu ha kuzikila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14"/>Usufu viyeshile kumzika tataake, kabweleganya Misili hamoja na wandugu zake na waja wose wacholile na heyo kumzika tataake.<verse eid="GEN 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usufu Kowagela Kumgongo Wakulu Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15"/>Wakulu zake Usufu viwonile kamba tataao kadanganhika, walonga, “Yowaze ihawa Usufu yang'hali na lusango na tweye, na yahagelegeza kutubwelezela mbuli zose zihile zitumtendele?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16"/>Avo wamgalila usenga Usufu, wolonga, “Kipigiti tataetu hanadanganhika katulongela, <verse eid="GEN 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17"/>tukugalile usenga uno, ‘Wagele kumgongo wakulu zako gehile gose gawakutendele.’ Avo tugele kumgongo sama ya gehile gose gatukutendele tweye, watumigwa wa Mulungu wa tataako.” Usufu viyahulike gano kalila ng'hani.<verse eid="GEN 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18"/>Abaho wakulu zake weza waibwanha hasi haulongozi wake, na kulonga, “Tweye twa nyakadala zako.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19"/>Ila Usufu kawalongela, “Sambimdumbe, nie na Mulungu mbaka niwataguse? <verse eid="GEN 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20"/>Hata kamba mweye mgesa gehile, ila Mulungu kagesa ganogile, giladi ugima wa wanhu bwando sambiubanangike kamba voyotenda sambi. <verse eid="GEN 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21"/>Avo sambimdumbe, nie nowagwelela mandia mweye hamoja na wanenu.” Mkulonga mbuli zino zilimwilile, kawahoza imioyo.<verse eid="GEN 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ifa ya Usufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22"/>Avo Usufu kagendelela kukala muisi ya Misili, heyo hamoja na wanhu wa ng'anda ya tataake. Usufu kakala milao mia na longo dimwe. <verse eid="GEN 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23"/>Usufu kawona wana na wazukulu wa Eflaim. Vivija kawona wana wa Makili mwana wa Manase awo iyawalongile kamba wanage. <verse eid="GEN 50:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24"/>Abaho Usufu kawalongela wandugu zake, “Nie na mmabehi kudanganhika, ila Mulungu kokwiza kuwemiliza na kuwalava mweye muisi ino na kuwagala kuisi iyawaduilile Ablaham, Isaka, na Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25"/>Abaho Usufu kawalongela Waislaeli wamduilile, kalonga, “Mulungu yeheza kuwataza kuwalava muisi ino, muipape mizege yangu kulawa hano.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26"/>Avo Usufu kadanganhika kipigiti viyakalile na milao mia na longo dimwe. Wam'baka dawa ya kuzuila kola, na kumwingiza mdijanaenza kuja Misili.<verse eid="GEN 50:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50"/>
</usx>
